Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.55,0:04:16.12,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 命靠天定 但我们偏要逆流而上 ♪\N♪ We don't have the power but we never say never ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:19.76,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 潮来潮去 人生苦短啊 ♪\N♪ Sitting in a sandpit, life is a short trip ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.77,0:04:22.39,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 能懂这歌的人 也懂我的伤 ♪\N♪ The music's for the sad men ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:26.10,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 这场竞赛会怎么收场？ ♪\N♪ Can you imagine when this race is won? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.73,0:04:30.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 是胜利还是灭亡？ ♪\N♪ Turn our golden faces into the sun ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:33.14,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我们唱着赞歌 别无选择 ♪\N♪ Praising our leaders, we're getting in tune ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:36.36,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 魔鬼弹着舞曲 逼我们起舞 ♪\N♪ The music's played by the, the mad man ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:38.09,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 永远年轻 ♪\N♪ Forever young ♪
