Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:50.87,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 永远永远地活着 ♪\N♪ Forever and ever ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.04,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 永远年轻 ♪\N♪ Forever young ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.04,0:04:56.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我想永远年轻 ♪\N♪ I want to be forever young ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:01.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 谁不想永远活着？ ♪\N♪ Do you really want to live forever? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.39,0:05:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手 反手\NBackhand. Backhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,正手 正手 正手\NForehand. Forehand. Forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.81,0:05:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手 反手\NBackhand. Backhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.55,0:05:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,正手 正手\NForehand. Forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.99,0:05:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,反手 反手\NBackhand. Backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.11,0:05:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放高球\NAnd lob.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.70,0:05:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,正手\NForehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.49,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 干嘛\N- Marty! - What!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有电话 - 跟他说我二十分钟前就走了\N- Phone! - Tell him I left 20 minutes ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.87,0:05:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不当你的传声筒 自己去接那该死的电话\NI'm not your goddamn messenger! Pick up the goddamn phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟不上 沃利 把白衬衫脱了\NI can't. Wally, take the white shirt off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,白球配白衬衫 看不清\NI can't follow the white ball against the white shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别找借口 孬种才这样找借口\NStop it. You're a fucking sun dodger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我孬种？怎么怕了 怕了？\NOh, yeah? I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.78,0:05:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我是朱迪\NIt's Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 朱迪\NHi, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你妈病得很重\NYour mother, she's very sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的假的？ - 真的\N- Okay, really? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她脸色苍白 满嘴胡话\NShe's gray in the face. She's speaking nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.43,0:05:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直喊你 你得赶快回家一趟\NShe's asking for you. You should come home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,听上去不行了 你们赶紧叫救护车吧\NSounds really bad. You should probably call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.35,0:05:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,谁陪她去啊\NWho's gonna go with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 你这么上心 你陪她去呗\NUh, I don't know. You should probably go since you're so invested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.94,0:05:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下 别挂\NHold on a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.40,0:06:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他不吃这套\NHe's not buying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.49,0:06:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说我断气了\NJust tell him I stopped breathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,绝对不行 太严重了 我不能这么说\NAbsolutely not. That's ridiculous. I'm not saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.99,0:06:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他说你正急着送我去医院\NTell him you're taking me to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.20,0:06:09.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我得赶紧把她送去急诊\NOkay, fine. I'll take her to the emergency room
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,然后在那儿陪着 天知道要陪多久\Nand sit there and wait for God knows how long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你来负责伺候我丈夫 给他喂药\NAnd you can come here and give my husband his medicine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.26,0:06:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,“晚上给他翻身做按摩”\Nand massage his feet all night long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,“跟他说我晕倒了”\NTell him I passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.30,0:06:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- “天呐 你妈刚刚昏过去了” - 你好啊 小姑娘\N- Oh, my God! Your mother, she just lost consciousness. - Hi, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,“你现在赶紧回家”\NYou've gotta come home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,谁啊\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.62,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 饭马上好\NHi. Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.01,0:06:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,“朱迪 别闹了行吗”\NI don't know what you want me to say, Judy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.81,0:06:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,“我正忙着 连午饭都还没吃呢”\NI'm busy. I'm on my lunch break.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,“我妈就在你旁边指挥 我都听得见”\NI can hear her whispering. She's right there standing next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.25,0:06:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- “我都说她昏过去了”- “别来烦我了”\N- I told you she passed out.- It's annoying me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.87,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟谁通话呢？\NWho are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没人\NOh. I'm not talking to anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,朱迪一直占着电话好久了\NJudy's just been tying up the line for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你买了点热饭\NI got you some broth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.39,0:06:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,都凉透了\NIt's ice cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.53,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 买饭排了好久 买回来都凉了 - 你都不打草稿？\N- Yeah, 'cause the line was really long at the shop. - Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,信不信我现在打电话去核实？\NSo that's what they'll say if I call down and ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是觉得我骗你\NYou don't believe me? You calling me a liar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.85,0:06:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你就打电话核实去\NPick up the phone and call them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.15,0:07:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不过看你怎么打 朱迪在占着电话 - 喔 行\N- You're gonna have to get Judy off the phone first. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 朱迪 把电话给我挂掉\NHey, Judy, get off the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看 这颗是国际乒联标准球\NOkay, this is a normal IATT approved ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.35,0:07:20.15,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【国际乒乓球联合会：1926年成立 主管国际乒乓球赛事和规则】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.12,0:07:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,盯紧这颗白球\NTry to follow the white ball against the white.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.73,0:07:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,在白背景下挺难的吧\NAlmost impossible, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.11,0:07:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你眼珠根本没跟上\NI don't even see your eyes moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我穿白衬衫 你连球都看不到\NIf I'm wearing a white shirt, you can't see the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,换颗橙球试试 这是我自个儿想出来的\NNow, imagine it with an orange ball, which no one's ever thought of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.60,0:07:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧 你盯得多牢 瞧他那眼神\NSee? You're already following it way better. Look at his eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看见没？ - 嗯 看见了\N- See how his eyes are looking? - Yeah, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在盯得更紧了\NYou're looking more engaged now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是机遇所在 目前桌球界\NSo that's what we wanna do. Right now in the world of table tennis,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:39.08,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【桌球：乒乓球早期在上流场合叫做"桌上网球" 简称"桌球"】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,为了盯住白球都得穿黑衣\Nyou're obliged to wear black, just so you can follow the white ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看看这个 这是泰德·贝利 - 他是谁？\N- Look at this. That's Ted Bailey. - Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾是英国冠军 世界第一\NThat's ex-number one ranked player in the world right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,已经被我打败了\NHe's the British champion. I've already beat him, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,再看这个\NNow look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,网球界第一杰克·克雷默\NThat's Jack Kramer, number one tennis player.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:51.42,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【杰克·克雷默：40-50年代著名网球手 推动网球精英化】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有啥区别？ - 他穿的是全白\N- What's the difference there? - He's wearing all white.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,对 一身白 很绅士\NHe's in all white. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:55.56,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【50年代网球为绅士运动 桌上网球(乒乓球)尚非主流】
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.06,0:07:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫品味 这叫格调 这是卖点\NTo me, that's luxury. To me, that's class. You could sell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 这种定制球得花不少钱\NMarty, a custom ball like that is gonna cost a lot of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.06,0:08:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,当然得定制 奇人配奇球\NOf course it's custom. It's an original ball for an original guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是至尊马蒂牌 不是平庸马蒂牌\NIt's the Marty Supreme ball, not the Marty Normal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.34,0:08:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你算过成本吗？\NBut what's it gonna cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.51,0:08:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,钱不重要 咱别抠门\NIt doesn't matter the cost. We can't cheap out on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.46,0:08:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,花不了多少钱的 加拉尼斯先生\NIt's gonna be nominal, Mr. Galanis.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.09,0:08:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是老说先花钱才能赚钱吗\NYou always said we gotta spend money to make money, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.44,0:08:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,给我端杯咖啡来\NGet me a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没门 让你秘书去弄\NNo. Get your secretary to get ya a cup of coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.77,0:08:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,南希忙着呢 你去弄吧\NNancy's busy. Just get me a coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,才不 我正像大人那样谈生意\NDad, we're talking like men about business here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.52,0:08:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我才不给你端咖啡 - 赶紧去给老子端咖啡去\N- I'm not getting ya a cup of coffee. - Get me the damn coffee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.60,0:08:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 也给你来一杯？\NMarty, you want a coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 不用了 我不碰咖啡因\NNo, I'm all right. I'm not drinking caffeine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.00,0:08:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听着\NListen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我感谢你和我儿子的这份交情\NI appreciate you're friends with my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.47,0:08:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不成器\NHe's limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.69,0:08:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,三十岁还靠爹吃饭\NHe's 30 years old. He's still living at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没啥名堂\NHe hasn't done much.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,他也不懂做生意 算不清账\NAnd he doesn't know business. He doesn't know the costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.29,0:08:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 盖拉尼斯先生 我不觉得他不成器\NI don't think he's limited, Mr. Galanis, respectfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.66,0:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,看看您做生意的本事\NI mean, look at your business success.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那是刻在骨子里的 迪翁也有\NThat's in your DNA, and you passed that through to Dion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.64,0:08:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是还没显露出来 - 谁知道呢\N- It just hasn't been awoken yet. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我要是没把握\NI wouldn't be here trying to involve you in something that I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.10,0:09:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会拉您入伙的\Ndidn't fully in my bones believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.36,0:09:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我很尊重您的钱 说来您可能不信\NAnd I have tremendous respect for your money. I know it's hard to believe,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但这门运动在国外是火得不得了\Nbut I'm telling you, this game, it fills stadiums overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,在美国火起来也只是时间问题\NAnd it's only a matter of time before it fills stadiums in the United States too,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.01,0:09:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我的广告会铺天盖地\Nbefore I'm staring at you from the cover of a Wheaties box.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我对这行一窍不通\NI- I don't know nothing about this business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,确实不通 所以更该信我\NNo, you don't. That's why you gotta trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.27,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,下周这个时候 我就是首位赢下英国公开赛的美国人\NThis time next week, I'll be the first American to ever win the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.35,0:09:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我就能一路杀到世锦赛 然后拿下世界第一\NThat'll slide me into the number one ranking for the World Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.14,0:09:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候《生活》和《展望》都会报道\NLife magazine's gonna cover it. Look magazine's gonna cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这是板上钉钉的事 《展望》就在捧我 他们都会捧我\NThey have to. The editor of Look magazine, he loves me. They all love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.69,0:09:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候我就是这项运动在美国的唯一代言人\NI'm uniquely positioned to be the face of the entire sport in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊\NLloyd!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.18,0:09:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我要打样\NI'm closing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我来找我舅\NYeah, I can see that. Just here to see my uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.34,0:09:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他走了\NHe left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.44,0:09:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,走了？你什么意思？不回来了？\NHe left? What do you mean he left? For the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他得带你妈去医院\NHe had to take your mother to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.48,0:10:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别闹了 她根本没病\NFor crying out loud. She's not sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.60,0:10:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 他还欠我工钱 说好了今天结清\NHey, Lloyd, he owes me money. We were supposed to settle up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是你午休了五个钟头\NWell, maybe if you didn't take that five-hour lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 兴许就能见着他 - 闭嘴吧你\N- you would have spoke with him. - Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁呀 - 吃了什么狗皮膏药 好得挺快的啊\N- Hello. - You're sounding a lot better, huh? That happened quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.24,0:10:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我会挺过去的 别指望我靠你\NI'll live, no thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 别扯了 默里在你那儿吗？别骗我\NEnough, Mom. Are you with Murray? Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 但他好像准备出趟远门\NNo. I think he left for his trip. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.64,0:10:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,出哪门子的远门？\NHis trip? What trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.27,0:10:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他带着埃丝特要去库彻度假村过周末\NHe's taking Esther to Kutchers for the weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这算什么啊 - 只要我一句话 他就会留下\N- When this... - But he would have stayed if I asked him to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没病 妈 他答应给我机票钱的\NYou're not sick, Mom. He was supposed to give me my money for my flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子 那事我可不知道\NWell, I don't know anything about that, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.90,0:10:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,别装蒜 否则我干嘛干这活？\NYes, you do! Why do you think I'm working here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.91,0:10:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是为了挣那笔钱\NI literally only accepted this job for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:11:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我可比窦娥还冤\NI have no idea what you are implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.12,0:11:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道你在干嘛吗？ - 我在干嘛？\N- You know what this is? - What, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你在毁我 你在毁我前程\NThis is sabotage. You're sabotaging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.12,0:11:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,别扯了 你是在自毁前程\NOh, please. You're sabotaging your own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.33,0:11:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 什么？\N- What is that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然觉得我要抢你？\NAre you seriously thinking I'm gonna rob you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.60,0:11:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,职业反应\NJust a reflex.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.68,0:11:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我要真想抢你 你早死在血泊里了\NIf I wanted to rob you, you'd be dead. You'd be in a pool of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.24,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来拿西装的 这是我特地为这趟比赛买的\NI came to grab my suit. You know I bought this specifically for my trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,打小乒乓还要穿西装 真长见识了\NDidn't know you need a suit to play ping pong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.14,0:11:29.11,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【乒乓：1950年代“乒乓”在部分场合带有嘲讽意味】
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:31.80,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【从事这项运动常被歧视 被视为不务正业】
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我就要老默欠我的那七百块\NI just want the $700 that Murray owes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.91,0:11:40.53,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约合2026年8,600美元 6万人民币 26万新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.47,0:11:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不然呢？\NYeah, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.55,0:11:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不然我就往你腿上来一枪 - 你不敢\N- Or I'm gonna shoot you in the leg. - No you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.47,0:11:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你敢赌吗？\NYou sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.54,0:11:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是打我腿 你未来几年都得坐牢\NYou shoot me in the leg, you'll be spending the next few years in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.89,0:11:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,行 那我就朝你脑门开枪\NOkay, I'll shoot you in the head instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.33,0:11:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你没那胆子\NYou're not gonna do that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.54,0:11:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 听我说 我只拿走我的那七百 绝不多拿\NLook, Lloyd, I just want what was promised to me, not a penny more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,回来我会带回十倍奖金\NI'm gonna be coming home with ten times that amount in prize money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.55,0:11:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,睁只眼闭只眼吧 让我拿走欠我的\NSo just turn the other cheek, let me take what I'm owed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,等我回来给你整整一百\Nand I'll give you an even $100 dollars when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.63,0:11:59.05,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约1,230美元 8,600人民币 3.7万新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.43,0:11:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,不干\NNot interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 别这样 转过来\NLloyd, come on. Look at me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,咱俩都清楚 你巴不得看我卷铺盖走人\NWe both know you'd love nothing more than to see my ass get canned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.48,0:12:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你干这行的劲头比我大千万倍\NYou're a thousand times more motivated than me to do this job,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,可你看看吧\Nand yet look at this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,看看\NLook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.12,0:12:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,老默给我的 看看背面\NMurray gave that to me. Flip it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.14,0:12:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,管事 我要当你管事了\NManager. I'm gonna be your boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.09,0:12:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,公平吗？我能把你扫地出门\NHow unfair is that? I could fire you whenever I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.38,0:12:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,还能叫你跪着扫地\NI could tell you to sweep the floor on your hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,任我差遣\NHow about that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,洛伊 我真拿枪指着你\NLloyd, I'm actually pointing a gun at you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.29,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,真的在威胁你\NI'm actually threatening to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.21,0:12:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这是实打实的抢劫 枪上有我的指纹\NThis is a legit robbery like any other. My fingerprints are all over this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这都是铁证\NThese are facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.38,0:12:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱柜打开 让我把该我的拿走\NSo open the safe, let me take what I'm owed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.69,0:12:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,回头你照实跟老默说\Nand you can call Murray, tell him exactly what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.83,0:12:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,想把我轰走还是告我都随你 行吗？\Nget me fired, press charges. Whatever you want, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.34,0:12:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,行\NFine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.35,0:12:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给您 先生 - 谢谢\N- Here you go, sir. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.48,0:12:56.82,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我爱高光时刻 ♪\N♪ The time I like is the rush hour ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:58.93,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我爱人群喧嚣 ♪\N♪ 'Cause I like the rush ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.82,0:13:01.91,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 人群拥挤又吵闹 ♪\N♪ The pushing of the people ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.77,0:13:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,垃圾\NYou son of...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.82,0:13:04.37,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我就沉浸其中 ♪\N♪ I like it all so much ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:07.29,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 人潮蜂拥涌过来 ♪\N♪ Such a mass of motion ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.83,0:13:09.83,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 谁晓得要去哪儿 ♪\N♪ Do not know where it goes ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:13.21,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 我随人群往前走 ♪\N♪ I move with the movement ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.63,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,还没有单间吗？\NWe don't get our own rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:15.79,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（英国 伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:16.80,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 尽情享受这感觉 ♪\N♪ And I have the touch ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这里还冷得要死\NIt's freezing in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.42,0:13:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,现在给我正经点儿 眼睛看这里\NI really need you to be serious now. Eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.78,0:13:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,巴基斯坦 看这里\NPakistan, I need you to look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.35,0:13:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,日本今年也派队来了？瞧见没？\NWait, Japan brought a team this year? You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.58,0:13:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 小日本也来了\NYeah. The Japs sent a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,出国禁令呢？\NWhat about the travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:32.04,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【1952年随盟军移交日本主权 出入境管制开始放宽】
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 肯定解禁了 - 出国禁令解除了？\N- They must have lifted it. - No more travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.04,0:13:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 现在把球拍翻过来 露出国旗\NOkay, gentlemen, I want you to flip your paddles for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢配合\NThank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.22,0:13:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,准备 一 二 三\NHere we go. One. Two. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:40.70,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 握个手吧 ♪\N♪ Shake those hands ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.99,0:13:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\NHold it still.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:43.00,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 握个手吧 ♪\N♪ Shake those hands ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.44,0:13:45.79,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 握手 ♪\N♪ Shake hands ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.67,0:13:45.98,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第一场）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.02,0:13:48.38,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 握手 ♪\N♪ Shake hands ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.79,0:13:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,毛瑟 赛点\NMatch point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.57,0:14:02.63,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【赛点：率先达到者只需再得一分即可赢下整场比赛】
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:10.23,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【1950年代乒乓球普遍采用每局21分制 比赛多为五局三胜】
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 胜出\NMatch, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你给我太多正手机会了 应该逼我打反手\NYou let me get to my forehand too much. Should've tried to put me in my backhand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:28.43,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【译注：在乒乓球中正手利于进攻 反手偏防守】
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分\NPoint, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.24,0:14:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分\NPoint, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 几比几了？ - 19比4\N- What's the score here? - Nineteen-four.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 日本人领先？ - 那日本小子在揍烂贝利\N- The Japanese guy? - Japanese guy's trashing Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他手里是什么？那是什么球拍？\NWhat's he using? What's that paddle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.93,0:15:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道 没人见过\NI don't know, mate. No one knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.62,0:15:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没声音\NIt's silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.01,0:15:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 神出鬼没的 - 哇\N- Like a ghost! - Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,贝利 好好打\NFuck, Bailey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.26,0:15:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分\NPoint, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,赛点\NMatch point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.36,0:15:32.58,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第三场）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.21,0:15:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打得好 马蒂 - 打得好\N- Great game, Marty. - Great game.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.40,0:16:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 胜出\NMatch, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.76,0:16:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那些在斯德哥尔胜出的人...\NThe winners of the tournament at Stockholm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你是拉姆·塞西吧\NHey. You're Ram Sethi, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.86,0:16:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 您先等一会儿\NSorry, could you hold for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不介意吧？ - 请说 您有啥事儿？\N- You don't mind? - No. Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.57,0:16:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,打听个事 你们住在哪家酒店？\NI was just curious, where are you staying while you're in town?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.82,0:16:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这关您什么事儿？ - 没事\N- What business is it of yours? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就是随便打听下\NI'm just saying, what hotel are you staying at?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.46,0:16:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,国际乒联儿的官员儿都住丽兹酒店\NAll the IATT representatives are stationed at the Ritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 丽兹酒店？别人也这么说 - 对\N- At the Ritz? Yeah, that's what I heard. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.25,0:16:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就这么定了 你没意见吧？ - 什么就这么定了？\N- Do you think that's okay? - I don't know what you're implying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.43,0:16:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你见过我住的那地方吗？ - 有啥问题吗？\N- Have you seen where they put me? - Is it a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,客气说 那地方就是个狗窝\NWell, with all due respect, sir, it's a dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.01,0:16:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 真不好意思啊 没伺候好您这位\NI'm so sorry it doesn't meet your high standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,咱这儿可是免费包住的 毛瑟先生啊\NWe offer complimentary housing to all our players, Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.51,0:16:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我就纳闷 怎么就您在这儿挑三拣四？\NSo far as I know, you're the only one to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你这口气 别把我当普通选手 好吗？\NYou're talking to me like I'm any player off the street, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.91,0:16:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我得休息好 才能赢下比赛\NI need good rest so I can win the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚美国人赢对这项运动的好处\NYou know perfectly well what an American win will do for the future of the sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.86,0:17:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就是未来桌球的代言人 - 那您就向美乒协反映呗\N- I'm good for table tennis, Mr. Sethi. - Appeal to the USTTA.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.04,0:17:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,美乒协有用吗？他们整个比赛就派两个人\NThere is no USTTA. The USTTA is two guys and a desk. It doesn't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.73,0:17:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就不归我管了 - 就归你管\N- Well, that's not my problem. - It is your problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我要住你住的那家酒店 就这么简单\NI wanna stay where you're staying! That's what I need!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.61,0:17:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,您这番言论实在是太失礼了\NI am finding this whole exchange really offensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我失礼？ - 对 您失礼\N- You're offended? - I am offended.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你们才失礼呢 让明星选手住狗窝\NI'm offended! You're making your star player huddle in a rat's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.12,0:17:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉刚才被打断了\NI'm so sorry for that interruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那咱们接着说锡兰和墨西哥的事儿...\NUm, back to Ceylon and Mexico...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.54,0:17:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这酒店真不赖 肯定很贵 - 是啊 确实不错\N- This is a nice hotel. Must cost a mint. - Yeah, very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.33,0:17:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,是国际乒联报销的吗？\NThe IATT covers accommodations?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.61,0:17:31.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明星选手才有这种待遇 - 是吗？那有多少名啊\N- Only for their star players. - Is that right? How many are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,明星选手？不知道 听说就一个\NStar players? I don't know. I haven't seen any others, so one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,进半决赛了 紧张吗？\NAny nerves, going into the semis?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,紧张？对阵克莱茨基？别闹了\NNerves? Against Kletzki? No. You kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾连续三年夺冠\NWell, he's won the tournament for the last three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他名气可不小 - 我名气也不小\N- He's got quite the reputation. - I have quite the reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.96,0:17:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯维辛集中营都办不到的事 我要办成\NLook, I'm gonna do to Kletzki what Auschwitz couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,看我怎么把他灭了\NOkay. I'm gonna finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.86,0:17:53.07,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【奥斯维辛：纳粹设立的集中营 实施种族灭绝】
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.09,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 这话有点过了\N- Jesus Christ. - A little strong, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 我能说 我也是犹太人\NIt's all right. I'm Jewish. I can say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.40,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上你想想 我更像是希特勒的大噩梦\NIn fact, if you think about it, I'm like Hitler's worst nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,此话怎讲？\NAnd why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我 我活得好好的\NLook at me. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还混到了上层 我就是希特勒失败的最终证明\NI did it, I'm on top. I'm the ultimate product of Hitler's defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对 把这句话记下来 都记下来\NYeah, write that down. That was good. Write that down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.59,0:18:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不错 - “希特勒失败的最终证明”\N- Nice one. - "Ultimate product of Hitler's defeat."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你总是那么自信吗？ -一定把那这句放在我照片下面\N- Do you like that confidence? - Put that under a picture of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.53,0:18:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来谈谈你的出身吧 - 我的出身？\N- Tell us a bit about your background. - My background?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.09,0:18:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过说真的 我...我妈死于难产\NNo, but seriously... My my my mother died in childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.98,0:18:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸就是个没出息的人 我两岁时他就丢下我走了\NMy father was a compulsive loser who abandoned me when I was two years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我被纽约孤儿院来回折腾\NI got stuck in the New York City orphanage system,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.54,0:18:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,到处被赶来赶去\Ngot shuttled from one hellhole to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.48,0:18:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 难免有了案底 - 那不是凯·斯通吗？\N- Naturally, got in trouble with the law. - Isn't that Kay Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.24,0:18:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那破事可不能定义我\NI don't want any of that to define me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.73,0:18:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,采访呢 采访呢 看什么呢？\NExcuse me. Excuse me. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看凯·斯通 - 就是她\N- It's Kay Stone over there. - That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,谁？\NWho's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.58,0:18:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,三十年代那阵儿的老牌女星\NWell, you know, the movie actress. Like, from the 1930s.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.50,0:18:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 演《机缘巧合》的那个 - 《机缘巧合》?\N- Opportunities. - Opportunities?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.21,0:18:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 演得很好 - 是啊 佳片一个\N- That was good. - Yeah, yeah. Great movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还有《黑匣子》 - 我爸特喜欢她\N- Black Box. - My dad loved her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.01,0:18:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 没错\N- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.06,0:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她当年很红吗？ - 红透半边天\N- She was big? - She was huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.95,0:18:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,后来销声匿迹了\NCame and went. That's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.60,0:18:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好莱坞就是这样 - 真是她\N- That's Hollywood, mate. - Yeah. It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.55,0:18:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是她\NIt is indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,还有个什么湖的电影\NSomething about a lake?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 《影湖》 - 嗯 那片也不错\N- Shadow Lake. - Yeah, that was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 身材真好 - 腿不错\N- Pretty. - Great legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮 真漂亮\NGorgeous, mate. Gorgeous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是在看我吗？ - 不是\N- Think I have a chance, lads? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.02,0:19:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她肯定在看毛瑟\NI think she's looking Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.15,0:19:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 下个问题\NNext question.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,喂\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.04,0:19:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凯吗？ - 有事吗？\N- Kay? - Speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我是马蒂·毛瑟 我住在皇家套房\NHey, it's Marty Mauser. I'm in the Royal Suite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.29,0:19:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天在大堂见过你\NI saw you in the lobby yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.16,0:19:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.88,0:19:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们互相看了一眼 当时我在接受采访\NYeah, we made eye contact. I was being interviewed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.52,0:19:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不记得了 - 这么说吧\N- I don't recall. - Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常仰慕您\NI'm a huge admirer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那好吧 要是没事我就挂了\NOkay. Can I help you with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,有点事 我刚把客房餐单上每样都点了一份\NMaybe. I just ordered one of everything off the room service menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我一个人肯定吃不完\NThere's no way I'll be able to eat it all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.53,0:19:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂了\NAh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.87,0:19:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你想让我去你房间？\NSo you'd like me to come up to your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.49,0:19:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 没错 - 要不我派我丈夫去吧\N- Mm-hmm. Yeah. - Perhaps I should send my husband instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.36,0:19:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 他来这里 我去你那里\NSure. He can come up here, and I'll come down to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.19,0:19:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真一套套的 行了 再见 - 等等 我还想再说会儿\N- Okay, wonderful. Thank you. Goodbye.- Wait. I wanna keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.12,0:19:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,说什么？\NWhy is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.50,0:19:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没跟真正的电影明星说过话\NBecause I've never talked to an actual movie star.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你说过了 希望你如愿以偿了\NWell, now you have. I hope the experience was all you thought it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我其实也会演点戏\NYou know, I'm something of a performer too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.16,0:19:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 是啊 你不信吗？\N- Are you? - Yeah. You don't believe me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.74,0:20:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我...\NI...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.20,0:20:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么？怎么结巴了？\NYou... What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你会演戏？\NYou're a performer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.66,0:20:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对 会演 你手边有《每日邮报》吗？\NYeah, I am a performer. You got the Daily Mailin front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.27,0:20:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还真有 怎么了？\NUh, I do have it. Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.43,0:20:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 那你翻到第12页\NOkay. Well, turn to page 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.00,0:20:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等下\NUh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,第12页\NPage 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 看什么？\NOkay. What am I looking at here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,看中间 正中间\NDown the middle, in the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.53,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是你？\NThis is you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.63,0:20:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对“天选之子” 拍得不错吧？\NYeah, "the chosen one." It's a nice picture, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,打小乒乓的？\NPing pong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.15,0:20:28.33,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（真是天选之子？）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我打的是桌球 来这儿参加英国公开赛\NI play table tennis. I'm here competing in the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你多大了？ - 我23\N- How old are you? - I'm 23.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,才23岁\NTwenty-three.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.04,0:20:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你都说不上来我演过什么吧\NI bet you can't name one film I've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,凭啥这么肯定？\NWhat makes you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我在你出生前就不演了\NBecause I stopped acting before you were born.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.68,0:20:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？有点意思 - 嗯\N- Really? That's really interesting. - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,凯 你拿我的刮胡刀刮腿毛了吗？\NKay, did you use my razor to shave your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.48,0:20:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刀钝了 我都划伤了 - 没拿\N- It's dull. I've cut myself. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁在说话？你丈夫？ - 嗯\N- Who's that? Your husband? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.50,0:20:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,难不成还有人偷偷溜进来用过它？\NI guess someone must've snuck in and chopped wood with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正打电话呢 - 操\N- I'm on the phone. - Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.89,0:20:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟谁打？ - 黛比\N- With whom? - Debbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.65,0:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 黛比 - 黛比？\N- Debbie. - Debbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,叫她少管闲事\NTell her to get a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他走了吗？ - 嗯\N- Is he gone? - Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,行\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.03,0:20:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那你为啥不演了？说说吧\NSo, why'd you stop acting? Let's talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.04,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我还有事 我得挂了\NYou know, I really have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,明天来温布利看我打球吧 你肯定会喜欢的\NYou must miss it, don't you? Come watch me play at Wembley tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我...我去不了\NI... I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.80,0:21:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 看看我怎么战胜世界第一\NCome on. You can watch me dethrone the number one ranked player in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我没空\NI'm not available.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦哟？你能有什么事？\NOh, yeah? What you got going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.91,0:21:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,有个大宣传会 我得陪我丈夫撑场子\NActually, I have a big promotional event to attend to for my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.29,0:21:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 好吧\NOh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.91,0:21:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,宣传什么？\NWhat's he promoting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.43,0:21:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,钢笔\NPens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.89,0:21:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卖笔？开什么玩笑  - 就是笔\N- Pens? Are you serious? - Pens.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.70,0:21:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 写字用的钢笔？ - 对\N- Like, writing pens? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.50,0:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个卖笔的？\NWhat, like, he's a pen salesman?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么住得起这种套房？\NHow can you afford the suite you're in?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.52,0:21:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他是洛克威尔墨水的老板\NHe owns Rockwell Ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.58,0:21:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那好吧...\NOh. Okay. Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.83,0:21:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我听说过洛克威尔墨水 - 你肯定知道\N- I know Rockwell Ink. - I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.29,0:21:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.86,0:21:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那活动内容是什么？\NWell, what's the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他请了阿加莎·克里斯蒂去哈查兹书店签名售书\NHe's hired Agatha Christie to sign books at Hatchards.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.55,0:21:39.78,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【阿加莎·克里斯蒂为英国知名小说家 哈查兹为伦敦老牌书店】
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 哦\NOoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.75,0:21:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,听着就无聊\NThat sounds really boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.06,0:21:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 没完没了了\NOh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.20,0:21:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有完没完？ - 别挂 别挂 问你个事\N- What is it? - Don't hang up, don't hang up. Just one question.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.32,0:22:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你房间是朝马路还是朝院子？\NDoes your room face the street or the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.08,0:22:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\NI don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.09,0:22:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,直说 马路还是院子？\NJust answer the question. Is it facing the street or the courtyard?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.18,0:22:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 朝院子 - 好\N- The courtyard. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.58,0:22:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,去窗边看看\NI need you to go to the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你住几楼？\NWhat floor are you on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.47,0:22:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,三楼吧\NI'm on the third floor, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,三楼 好 正好\NThird floor. Okay, perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.71,0:22:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,朝对面看看\NLook across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.68,0:22:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,看见对面那开窗 桌上有果盘的屋了吗？\NYou see the open window with a bowl of fruit on the table?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到了吗？ - 看到了\N- You see it? - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看好了 我会让那果盘里凭空多出一个苹果\NHere's what's gonna happen. I'm gonna make an apple appear in that bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.01,0:22:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我办到了 你就推掉你那场会\NAnd if I do, you're gonna blow off your little rendezvous
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.67,0:22:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 - 来看我比赛\N- No, no, no. - and come watch me play.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.25,0:22:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不答应任何事 不行\NI'm not agreeing to anything, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.85,0:22:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用答应 但看好了\NYou don't have to agree to anything. I'm gonna do it anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.71,0:22:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,看到了 一\NOkay? One...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.69,0:22:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,二\Ntwo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.34,0:22:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,三\Nthree.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.09,0:22:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我会把票留售票处给你取\NI'll leave a ticket for you at the box office.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.98,0:23:07.56,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（半决赛）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.32,0:23:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\NPoint, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.97,0:23:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,20比5\NTwenty to five.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.22,0:23:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基整场落后两局 零局比二\NKletzki trails Mauser two games to nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 局点兼赛点\NGame and match point, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.25,0:23:40.42,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【译注：表示马蒂再得一分即可赢下整场比赛】
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.43,0:23:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱们玩点绝活 - 好吧\N- Let's have a little fun with this one. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.17,0:23:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 玩出花样来 - 收到\N- Have a little fun, all right? - Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.29,0:23:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,换克莱茨基发球\NService switches to Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.79,0:24:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基 得分\NPoint, Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.01,0:24:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 诸位 谢谢大家 谢谢大家\NVery well, gentlemen. Thank you for that. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.80,0:24:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,克莱茨基发球 当前局分6比20\NKletzki serves 6-20.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.16,0:24:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟整场领先两局 两局比零\NMauser leads two games to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.86,0:24:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,又是马蒂·毛瑟的赛点\NMatch point again for Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.71,0:24:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,再次由你发球 克莱茨基\NYour service again, Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.07,0:24:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\NPoint, Mauser!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.39,0:24:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟以21比6赢下此局 以三局比零赢下整场比赛\NMauser wins the game and match by 21-6. Three games to nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.69,0:24:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟进入决赛 将对阵日本选手远藤功人\NMauser's on to the finals where he will face Koto Endo of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.56,0:25:03.74,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（菜单）
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.67,0:25:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别去看价钱 想吃什么随便点\NGet whatever you want. Don't even look at the prices, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.01,0:25:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你点什么？\NWhat are you getting?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.90,0:25:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我就来个威灵顿牛排和鱼子酱拼盘\NI'm gonna get the Beef Wellington and the caviar tasting plate
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.49,0:25:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,要点就点最贵的\Nbecause they're the most expensive items on the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.36,0:25:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我想再唠叨两句关于巡回表演队的事\NListen, I would like to keep going back a little bit about the Globetrotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.35,0:25:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哈林篮球队那事儿？ - 对\N- About the Harlem Globetrotters, again? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.35,0:25:16.70,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【哈林篮球队：美国巡回表演篮球队 擅长花式竞技与表演】
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.95,0:25:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我跟你说过了 我不干 - 为什么？\N- I told you, I'm not interested. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.49,0:25:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就是不想干\N'Cause I don't wanna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.70,0:25:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,报酬很高\NIt's great money.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.40,0:25:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们还能环游世界 你不想去威尼斯吗？\NAnd we will travel all over the world. Have you seen Venice?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.81,0:25:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我才不会去当马戏团的中场把戏 - 悉尼呢？\N- I don't wanna be doing trick shots for a halftime show - Sydney?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.83,0:25:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 观众上厕所时上场 - 巴塞罗那？\N- while people are going to the bathroom. - Barcelona?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.46,0:25:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,真丢人 明白吗？\NThat's beneath me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.55,0:25:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 观众相当捧他们的 - 服务员在哪儿呢？\N- They're treated like royalty. - Where's the waiter?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.59,0:25:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有个熟人干过这行 - 服务员\N- Listen, I know people who have done this. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,服务员\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.41,0:25:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,机会难得 咱们得把握住\NIt's a great opportunity. We should not miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.27,0:25:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂\NMarty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.68,0:25:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 请问要点什么？\NYes, sir. May I help you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.19,0:25:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,可以点菜了吗？\NHi. Can we order?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.27,0:25:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 我马上去叫这桌的服务员来\NOf course, sir. Let me fetch your waiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.73,0:25:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别走 - 请说\N- Hang on. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.26,0:25:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚洛克威尔的账由我来结\NUh, I'll be taking care of the Rockwell tab tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.34,0:25:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,把账记我房间上 皇家套房 马蒂·毛瑟\NPut it on my room. The Royal Suite. Marty Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟他们交代清楚 是我付的账 - 明白 先生\N- And make sure they know it's me, too. - I will. Leave it to me, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.41,0:25:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不许被回绝 - 没问题\N- Don't take no for an answer. - I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.95,0:25:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂·毛瑟 皇家套房 去告诉他们 - 好的 先生\N- Marty Mauser. Royal Suite. Go tell 'em. - Will do, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.27,0:26:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 看着我 别往那儿瞅 看着我\NOkay. Look at me. Don't look there. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.40,0:26:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛克威尔是谁啊 - 就个傻瓜\N- Who's Rockwell? - Some bozo.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.90,0:26:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在看过去 别太明显 告诉我他在干啥？\NLook over now. Be subtle about it. What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.15,0:26:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉先生 他之前没来过我们酒店\NHe hasn't been here before, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.03,0:26:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他在看这边\NHe's looking at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.04,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 嗯\N- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.12,0:26:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好 继续跟我说话 别露馅\NOkay, keep talking to me. Be normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.62,0:26:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 听我说 再考虑一下\NOkay, fine. I want you to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.66,0:26:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会是绝佳组合 我想跟你搭档\NWe would be a great team. I wanna do this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.45,0:26:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛老想着哈林篮球队？\NWhy are you so fixed on the Harlem Globetrotters?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.37,0:26:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那群人干的真丢人\NIt's very sad what they do, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.43,0:26:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,本该是顶尖的运动员却成了杂耍的小丑\NSome of the premier athletes on the planet reduced to acting like circus clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.61,0:26:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再看看什么情况\NWhat's he doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.00,0:26:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他正朝这桌走来 - 他来了？\N- He's coming towards us. - He's coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.36,0:26:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别紧张 表现得自然点 - 行 好的 明白\N- Just be normal. Act casual. - Okay, fine. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.39,0:26:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,劳驾 我认识你吗？\NExcuse me. Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.41,0:26:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,应该不认识\NI don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.62,0:26:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然想请客？\NAnd you wanna buy dinner for my entire table tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.91,0:26:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 可以吗？ - 为什么？\N- Yeah. Is it okay? - Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.39,0:26:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,什么叫为什么？我还需要理由？\NWhat do you mean, why? Do I need a reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.82,0:26:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我换个说法 你图什么？\NLet me rephrase that. What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.24,0:26:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我什么都不图 只是想表示点谢意\NNo, I don't want anything. It's just my small way of saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.19,0:26:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢我？ - 对\N- Thank you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.97,0:26:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,具体谢我什么？\NThank me for what, specifically?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.39,0:26:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢您那些产品\NFor all your products.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.97,0:26:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,没了你们的钢笔 世界该怎么办？\NI mean, where would we be without pens?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.45,0:27:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你看 我有不少本事 但最得意的就是\NYou know, I have many talents, but the one I'm most proud of
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.87,0:27:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能大老远闻出屁话 - 不\N- is the ability to smell bullshit from a mile away. - No,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.85,0:27:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我说的都是真心话\NI'm being completely sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.76,0:27:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是哪儿人？ - 纽约人 你呢？\N- Where are you from? - New York. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.23,0:27:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,也是纽约 你是做什么的？\NNew York too. What do you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.02,0:27:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个职业运动员\NI'm a professional athlete.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.51,0:27:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗 哪项运动？ - 桌上网球\N- Really? What sport? - Table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.62,0:27:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,桌球？这也算运动？\NTable tennis? That's a sport?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.07,0:27:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然算 我来参加英国公开赛的\NOf course it is. I'm here competing in the British Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.99,0:27:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天要在温布利打决赛\NI'm playing at Wembley tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.31,0:27:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,对阵日本 明天赛场座无虚席\Nin front of a sold-out crowd in the finals against Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.20,0:27:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我代表美国出赛 - 等一下\N- I'm here representing the United States. - Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.50,0:27:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,日本？日本也来了？\NJapan? Japan has a team here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.10,0:27:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我刚才不是说了吗 - 那出国禁令呢？\N- That's what I just said. - How'd they get around the travel ban?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.21,0:27:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为桌球在亚洲增长最快\NBecause table tennis is the fastest growing sport in Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.51,0:27:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,在那边火得不行\NIt's huge over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.19,0:27:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,说个有意思的事\NOh, you're gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.22,0:27:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他们怎么握拍的吗？\NDo you know what they call their grip? The way they hold their rackets?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.64,0:27:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 - 他们管那叫直笔握拍\N- No. - They call it penholder.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.64,0:27:40.89,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【直拍：起源日本 英文含“握笔”之意】
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.91,0:27:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那又怎样？\NSo what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.72,0:27:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以拿去用\NYou can use that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.08,0:27:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,用来干嘛？\NUse it for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去当宣传素材 我哪知道 你又不是生意人\NFor an advertisement or something. I don't know, you're the business guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.29,0:27:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才有点失礼 这位是我搭档贝拉·克莱茨基\NI'm being rude. This is my associate, Béla Kletzki.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.50,0:27:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,幸会 先生\NNice to meet you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.69,0:27:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是打桌球的？\NI assume you're a table tennis player also?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.90,0:27:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 没错 我是1935到39年的世界冠军\NI am. I am. Actually, I was the World Champion from '35 to '39.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.53,0:27:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,前世界冠军 我今天把他打败了\NHe was the World Champion. I beat him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.19,0:27:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他赢了我 他比我年轻得多\NHe beat me. But he's much younger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.91,0:28:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,也强得多 更有天赋\NI'm much better than him, much more talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.64,0:28:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到这个纹身 你是不是进过集中营？\NI can't help but notice this tattoo. You were in one of the camps, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.88,0:28:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,奥斯威辛二号营区 没错 怎么问这个？\NAuschwitz-Birkenau. Yeah. Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.41,0:28:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我儿子为了解放你们付出了生命\NMy son lost his life liberating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.07,0:28:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我深表遗憾\NI'm sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.40,0:28:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为是苏联人解放你们的\NI thought you were liberated by the Soviets.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.24,0:28:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 确实是 是苏联 - 并不是美国人\N- We were. It's Soviets.  - It wasn't the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.81,0:28:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不是字面意思 我儿子在太平洋战场\NI didn't mean it literally. He was serving in the South Pacific.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.70,0:28:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那他后来怎么了？\NWell, what happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.93,0:28:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,还能怎么了 他被杀了\NWhat do you mean? He was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.79,0:28:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这好笑吗？\NYou find that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.96,0:28:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 不是 我有时一紧张就会笑\NOh, God. No, I just get nervous laughter sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.92,0:28:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,说句安慰话\NIf it's any consolation,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.15,0:28:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天会送给他们第三颗原子弹\NI'll be dropping a third atom bomb on their heads tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.74,0:28:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你这套安慰话 顶多忽悠你妈\NYeah, I'm sure his mother's gonna get a lot of comfort
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,让她不反对你去打小乒乓\Nthat you're playing ping pong in his honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.64,0:28:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您操心我家事\NIt's not that big of a deal, but I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.81,0:28:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他讲讲...他以前给纳粹拆弹\NTell him-- He used to diffuse bombs for the Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.45,0:28:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,跟他讲讲那故事\NTell him the story you told me about--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.19,0:28:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我那桌还有人等我 我得走了 - 别走 别走\N- I've got a whole table of people waiting. - No, no, no, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.93,0:28:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他会喜欢的 讲给他听\NYou're gonna love this story. Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想听吗？ - 不太想 但快说吧\N- You wanna hear it? - Not really, but go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.67,0:28:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,别停 快说 是好故事\NNo, tell him. It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.12,0:28:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,行 那我长话短说\NOkay, I'll make it quick. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.02,0:28:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我进集中营被分配住处的时候\Nwhen I first got to the camp, I was put into housing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.72,0:29:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,幸好有个军官认出我\NLucky for me, there was an officer who recognized me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.64,0:29:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他在1935年布拉格世锦赛上见过我\NHe had seen me in 1935 at the World Championships in Prague.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那人是真心崇拜我 真心的\NThis guy was a real fan. I mean, a real fan, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.92,0:29:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,他居然因为你会打小乒乓就让你活着？\NYou're telling me he let you live because you played ping pong?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.82,0:29:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们很佩服我的本事 没错\NThey respected my skills, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.37,0:29:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,于是他们教我拆圆柱高爆炸弹\NSo then, they taught me how to dismantle SC bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.14,0:29:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,明白吗？\NOkay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.24,0:29:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,每天早上他们把我和炸弹送到营外的树林里\NEach morning, they would send me into the woods with the bombs
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.83,0:29:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,就算炸了也伤不到别人\Non the outskirts of the camp where I could only do damage to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.61,0:29:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有一回\NSo one time,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.88,0:29:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我尾随一只蜜蜂\NI followed a honeybee.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.59,0:29:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,什么蜂？\NA bee?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,蜜蜂\NA honeybee,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.37,0:29:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,一路跟它到了蜂巢\Nall the way to its hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.90,0:29:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我用烟把蜜蜂全都熏跑\NAnd I smoked all the bees out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.99,0:29:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,接着我把巢掰开\NAnd then broke it open,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.52,0:29:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我把蜂蜜抹满全身 胸口 胳膊全抹上了\Nand I smeared the honey all over my chest, my arms, everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.00,0:29:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.11,0:29:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上回去后\N'Cause later that night,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:30:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我就让室友把我身上的蜜舔掉充饥\NI let all my bunk mates to lick the honey off of me for nourishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.24,0:30:31.04,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（皇家套房）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,押正面\NHeads.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.40,0:31:50.70,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【抛硬币猜中者先选“发球”或“场地” 二选一】
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.64,0:31:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真倒霉 - 远藤 轮到你选了\N- Fuck. - Endo, choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.23,0:31:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）发球
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.71,0:31:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我选那边\NI'll go to that side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.46,0:31:59.68,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（决赛）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.88,0:32:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 右侧... - 加油 马蒂 加油\N- On my right... - Come on, Marty! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.98,0:32:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是美国选手马蒂·毛瑟 世界排名第二\N...Marty Mauser of the United States, ranked second,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.76,0:32:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,对阵日本选手远藤功人 未列排名\Nversus Koto Endo of Japan, unranked.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.33,0:32:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛为五局三胜\NThe gentlemen will battle to the best of five
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.40,0:32:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,单局21分制\Nin games to 21 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.41,0:32:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,每局须至少领先两分才能取胜\NEach game shall be won by at least two points.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.82,0:32:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,祝二位好运\NGood luck, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.96,0:32:23.43,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第一局）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.05,0:32:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,请保持安静\NQuiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.89,0:32:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛开始\NAll right!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.97,0:32:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 1比0\NPoint, Endo. One-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.54,0:32:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 美国人\NCome on, America!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.36,0:32:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 2比0\NPoint, Endo. Two-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.77,0:32:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马蒂\NAll right, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.73,0:32:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 马蒂\NCome on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.64,0:33:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 3比0\NPoint, Endo. Three-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.27,0:33:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 4比0\NPoint, Endo. Four-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.52,0:33:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马蒂\NCome on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.09,0:33:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 5比0\NPoint, Endo. Five-nil.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.06,0:33:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,换马蒂·毛瑟发球\NService switches to Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.04,0:33:44.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（局分:美国8比日本19 场分:美国零比一）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.52,0:33:46.11,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\NPoint, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.39,0:33:46.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（局分:美国9比日本19 场分:美国零比一）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.12,0:33:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,9比19 美方发球\NNine serving 19.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.01,0:33:53.76,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第二局）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.21,0:34:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分 10比19\NPoint, Mauser. 10-19.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.49,0:34:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,好样的 马蒂\NOkay, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.99,0:34:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 20比10\NPoint, Endo. 20-10.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.16,0:34:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,局点\NGame point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.95,0:34:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,快发球\NGo! Serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.86,0:35:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 21比10\NPoint, Endo. 21-10.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.88,0:35:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,本局远藤功人胜\NGame, Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.56,0:35:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人以两局比零领先\NEndo leads two games to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.83,0:35:23.39,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（局分:美国16比日本18 场分:美国零比二）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.51,0:35:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分\NPoint, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.85,0:35:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,18比16\NEighteen-16.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.71,0:35:28.63,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(第三局)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.10,0:35:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟 得分 17比18\NPoint, Mauser. 17-18.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.29,0:35:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,加油 马蒂 加油\NGo, Marty! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.58,0:35:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,换马蒂·毛瑟发球\NService switches to Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.70,0:36:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NFuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.46,0:36:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 17比19\NPoint, Endo. 17-19.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.86,0:36:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真见鬼了\NOh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.90,0:36:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤功人 得分 17比20\NPoint, Endo. 17-20.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.66,0:36:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,赛点\NAnd match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.07,0:36:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,请安静\NQuiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.62,0:36:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,请坐好 保持安静\NQuiet. Settle down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.13,0:36:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂·毛瑟发球\NYour service, Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.88,0:36:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,加油啊 马蒂\NCome on, Marty!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.01,0:37:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,完了\NFuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.73,0:37:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 这是胡闹 不行\NNo, bullshit! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.66,0:37:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就给我重赛 用正规硬拍\NI want a rematch right now with a standard-league hard-bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.66,0:37:14.23,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【1952年孟买世锦赛 日本选手佐藤博治首次用海绵拍 并赢得男单冠军】
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.33,0:37:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这太不像话了\NThat is unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.52,0:37:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我装了机械臂呢？\NWhat if I had a mechanical arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.25,0:37:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我在球上涂胶水呢？这合规吗？\NWhat if I put glue on the ball? Would that be kosher?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.27,0:37:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他全场都被教练指点 这太不像话\NWhy, he was getting coached the entire time! That is unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.45,0:37:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我打的可是正经桌球 正经桌球 \NI play real table tennis! Real table tennis!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.56,0:37:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,胡闹啊\NUnbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.99,0:37:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,胡闹啊\NUnbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.08,0:37:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,本届英国公开赛冠军是...\N...British Open champion from Japan...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.42,0:37:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧你\NFuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.52,0:37:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...日本选手远藤功人\N...Koto Endo!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.21,0:37:36.67,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（日本新闻）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.29,0:37:42.64,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（特别报道）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.29,0:37:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）第十九届英国桌球公开赛上 日本首次问鼎冠军\N第19回全英卓球選手権にて日本が初優勝
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.55,0:37:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这是自太平洋战争结束以来\N太平洋戦争終結以来初めて、
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.90,0:37:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）首位日本选手在国际赛场上夺得胜利\N日本人選手が国際的な大会で勝利を収めました。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.14,0:37:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）获胜者为远藤功人\N選手の名は遠藤こと。
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.82,0:37:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）这位无名的日本挑战者 他在决赛中\N無名の日本人挑戦者遠藤は、
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.31,0:38:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）以三比零的压倒性优势击败夺冠热门的美国强手\N優勝候補の米国選手にわく屈辱の三対零で完勝。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.65,0:38:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）东京十万民众涌上街头\N東京では十万人が詰めかけ、
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.88,0:38:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）宛若庆典游行\Nパレードさながらの賑わいの中
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.86,0:38:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）热烈欢庆他的凯旋\Nこの凱旋を祝いました。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.31,0:38:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤却以谦逊自持 愿以一名普通工匠身份回国\Nしかし、遠藤選手自身は英雄としてではなく
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.09,0:38:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）而非受封为所谓英雄\N謙虚な一職人として帰国したいと述べています。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.02,0:38:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）远藤十六岁遭遇东京大轰炸 失去听觉\N遠藤選手は十六歳の時、東京大空襲に遭い、聴覚を失いました。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.74,0:38:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）他在无声之中磨砺感官 最终以钢铁般意志征服赛场\N雑音のない世界で感覚を研ぎ澄ませ試合を制したのです。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.80,0:38:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）如今 世界桌球的目光聚焦于我邦\Nそして、日本に世界の卓球界の注目が集まる中、
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.68,0:38:39.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第23界世界桌球锦标赛）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.42,0:38:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）本年度世界锦标赛主办地已定为东京\N本年の世界選手権の東京開催が決定しました。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.11,0:38:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）美国选手必将卷土重来 誓要洗刷败绩\N米国選手もまた雪辱を果たすべく対戦に望むでしょう。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.70,0:38:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）但远藤并非孤军奋战\Nしかし、遠藤選手は一人ではありません。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.07,0:38:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）他背靠的是与他一道齐心实现民族愿望\N八千四百万の国民の
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.44,0:38:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,（日语）共怀不屈精神的八千四百万同胞\N希望を遂げるたワークの不屈の精神とともにあります。
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.98,0:38:55.75,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（完）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.74,0:39:03.15,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（法国 巴黎）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.79,0:39:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,（法语）您好先生 有什么需要吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.64,0:39:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,米尔顿·洛克威尔订的桌子在哪儿？\NDo you have a Milton Rockwell reservation?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.42,0:39:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- （法语）您说什么？ - 请查下米尔顿·洛克威尔的订位\N- Excusez-moi? - Milton Rockwell reservation, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.71,0:39:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,（法语）您是说洛克威尔吧？\NAh, Rockwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.86,0:39:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 马蒂 我得亲自谢谢你\NSo, listen, Marty, I wanna personally thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.14,0:39:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你带我接触桌球\Nfor introducing me to table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.31,0:39:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我压根儿没想到 这玩意能在亚洲火成那样\NI had no idea what a phenomenon it was in the Asias.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.95,0:39:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 对 对 - 尤其在日本\N- Oh, yeah. I know. - And how big it is in Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我早跟你说了 火得很\NThat's what I was trying to tell you. It's huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.60,0:39:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我打算把桌球列进\NSo, I'm thinking of incorporating it into some of the promotional events
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.29,0:39:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,秋季在那边的宣传项目里\Nwe're gonna be doing over there in the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.40,0:39:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备怎么安排？\NHow so? What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.77,0:39:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我想在世锦赛期间\NWhat I wanna do is stage an exhibition match
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.53,0:39:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,安排一场你和远藤的表演赛\Naround the time of the World Championships between you and Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.33,0:39:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 你肯定会喜欢的\N- Mmm. - I think you'd like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.28,0:39:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你开个价\NSo I'm gonna make you an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.82,0:39:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一千美金酬劳\NI'll pay you a thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.82,0:39:51.69,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约1.2万美元 8.5万人民币 37万新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.70,0:39:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,还安排你住东京帝国饭店\NI'll put you up at the Imperial Hotel in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.70,0:39:54.21,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【东京帝国饭店：建于19世纪末 东京三大顶级酒店之一】
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.21,0:39:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你从纽约出发 还可以坐我的私人飞机\NAnd if you're leaving from New York, I'll give you a seat on my private plane,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.02,0:39:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,让你这辈子体验一回什么叫奢华\Nand you'll fly in luxury for the first time in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.27,0:40:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,钱的事之后再商量\NOkay, we can negotiate my price later.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.67,0:40:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但这安排是在赛前还是赛后？\NBut this would be before or after the tournament?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.42,0:40:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赛前一周左右 - 不行 必须是赛后\N- About a week before the event. - No, it's gotta be after.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.22,0:40:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能在紧要关头前陪他演戏\NI can't face off against the guy in public before it actually counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.38,0:40:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏要留到关键时候\NDrama is very important to me. I can't undercut the drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.91,0:40:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,先别纠结细节\NLet's not get tied up in minutiae.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.33,0:40:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我只是想知道你有没有兴趣参加 - 有啊\N- I just want to find out if you're interested in participating. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.48,0:40:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,当然有 凡是能让我露一手的机会我都不会错过\NOh, yeah. Of course. I'm interested in any opportunity to show off my talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.16,0:40:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 这回我一定完胜他\NAnd you don't have to worry either, 'cause this time I'm gonna obliterate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.98,0:40:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,主要是球拍的问题\NIt's really the racket that I'm playing,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.67,0:40:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但我保证 准能赢\Nbut I can assure you, it's gonna be a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.30,0:40:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 听着 你得明白这是怎么回事\NOkay, listen. I need you to understand what this thing's about.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.51,0:40:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是正式比赛\NThis is not an official match.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.09,0:40:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,连真打都算不上\NIt's not even a real game.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.84,0:40:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,这是纯粹的宣传 目的就是讨好日本人\NThis is purely promotional, to entertain the Japanese people,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.03,0:40:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,好让他们多买我的钢笔 明白吗？\Nso they buy more of my pens, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.95,0:40:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你上去打几局 你会很亮眼\NYou're gonna play a few games. You're gonna be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.72,0:40:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但别把远藤的风头给抢了 - 你让我故意输给他？\N- But you can't play better than Endo. - You want me to lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.44,0:40:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 给你看样东西\NMarty, let me show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.19,0:40:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,日本头号杂志\NBiggest magazine in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.53,0:40:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你把远藤捧成了国民英雄\NYou made Endo a national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.16,0:40:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听着... - 你什么意思？\N- Listen-- - Why are you showing me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.20,0:40:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这会让我甘心输掉？我只会更想赢\NDo you think this makes me wanna lose? This makes me wanna win.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.18,0:40:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你要以退为进\NSometimes, when you lose you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.06,0:40:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听我解释一下 - 我比远藤强上万倍\N- Let me explain. Let me explain. - I'm ten trillion times better than Endo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.48,0:41:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,打败我的不是人是那把球拍上\NYou understand that, right? It's the racket that beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.44,0:41:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他水平很一般 - 我不在乎\N- He's a mediocre player. - I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.15,0:41:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本不在乎桌球 这都不算体育\NI don't care about table tennis. This is theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.34,0:41:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你担心什么？ - 我的名声\N- What are you worried about? - My reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.88,0:41:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你的名声？ - 没错 我的名声\N- Your reputation? - Yes, my reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.49,0:41:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会为你糟蹋我的名声 没门\NI don't wanna throw my reputation in the trash for you. I'm not doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.95,0:41:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你现在不就在当小丑吗？\NAren't you playing in a vaudeville circus act right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.62,0:41:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么小丑？把话说清楚\NWhat do you mean, vaudeville? Finish that sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.85,0:41:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思？ - 你不过是人家中场休息时的把戏\N- What are you implying? - You're the halftime show, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.15,0:41:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那可是哈林篮球队 都是世上最顶尖的运动员\NOf the Harlem Globetrotters! The finest athletes on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.22,0:41:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,从一月到现在 至少有八万观众看过我的表演\NI've probably played in front of 80,000 people since January.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.80,0:41:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这好笑吗？\NThat's funny to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.13,0:41:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 你让我觉得可笑\NNo. You're funny to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.63,0:41:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我好笑？你知道什么最好笑吗？\NI'm funny to you? You know what's funny to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.48,0:41:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么低三下四去讨好日本人\NThat you want to entertain the Japanese so badly,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.34,0:41:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,而他们杀了你儿子 这才叫可笑\Nand they murdered your son. That's funny to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.00,0:41:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 咱俩互揭伤疤 扯平了 行吗？\NLook, you struck a nerve, I struck a nerve. Okay? Now we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.53,0:41:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出去\NGet out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.93,0:41:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你还欠我一顿饭\NNah, I think you owe me a meal first.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.43,0:41:58.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（有请：哈林篮球队）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.83,0:42:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,（塞克语）让我们热烈欢迎小乒乓登场
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.73,0:42:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,（塞克语）他们将上演“一闪一闪亮晶晶”
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.63,0:42:08.80,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（南斯拉夫 萨拉热窝）
