Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.76,0:42:29.34,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（摩洛哥北部 丹吉尔）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.16,0:42:37.22,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 人人终会领悟 ♪\N♪ Everybody's gotta learn sometime ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.78,0:42:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快来 教练\NYeah, Coach, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.38,0:42:39.89,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（埃及 开罗）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.97,0:42:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一 说茄子\NThree, two, one. Say cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.02,0:42:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,茄子\NCheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.28,0:42:49.85,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（西德 慕尼黑）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.73,0:42:59.21,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（比利时 布鲁塞尔）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.07,0:42:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,（法语）接下来马蒂·毛瑟 对阵 海豹
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.79,0:43:07.80,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 人人终将长大 ♪\N♪ 'Cause everybody's Gotta learn sometime ♪
