Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.39,0:43:18.68,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【1950年代因种族隔离 黑人球员多从事娱乐表演】
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.60,0:43:20.60,Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\an7}♪ 人人终会领悟 ♪\N♪ Everybody's gotta learn sometime ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.03,0:43:37.71,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（美国 纽约）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.15,0:43:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,借过\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.25,0:43:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,也不打招呼\NHello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.86,0:44:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别在我房间吃喝 会生虫子\NPlease don't eat or drink in my room. It attracts bugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.20,0:44:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是进去打扫卫生 别多想\NI just go in there to clean. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.41,0:44:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,见到我你一点都不高兴啊\NWell, you don't seem happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.30,0:44:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 你不也不高兴吗\NYeah, and you don't seem happy to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.12,0:44:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要留这儿住吗？\NSo, now are you going to be staying here?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.40,0:44:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么 不行吗？\NWhat, is that not okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.82,0:44:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 我过几周就走 不烦你\NDon't worry. I'll be out of your hair in a few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.96,0:44:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,懂点事吧\NDon't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.94,0:44:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走去哪儿？过几周有什么事？ - 世锦赛\N- Why? What's in a few weeks? - World Championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.58,0:44:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪儿办？ - 东京\N- So, where's that gonna be? - Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.52,0:44:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,日本的东京？\NTokyo, Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.26,0:44:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还有其他东京吗？\NAre you asking me if Tokyo's in Japan?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.34,0:44:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你没正经问题吗？\NIs that a serious question?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.89,0:44:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我看你累坏了\NYou look very tired to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.26,0:44:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 我刚跑了大半个地球 能不累吗\NYeah, 'cause I just traveled halfway around the world. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.47,0:44:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我很忙 忙着工作 忙着挣钱\NI was busy. I was working. I was making money.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.27,0:45:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,趁着这会儿楼里没人用热水\NYou know, while everybody is at work in the building,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.36,0:45:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,去好好洗个热水澡吧\Nit would be a good time for you to take a nice, long, hot shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.42,0:45:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 这是什么？\N- Here. - What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.85,0:45:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,专门带给你的\NI got you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.44,0:45:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是从真金字塔上敲下来的\NIt's from an original Egyptian pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.46,0:45:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得小时候吗？\NWe built that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.04,0:45:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.43,0:46:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 利维 又长高了\NHey, Levi. You got a lot taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.62,0:46:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 有啊\N- No, I didn't. - Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.35,0:46:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是哪位 有事吗？ - 有 跟我走\N- Excuse me. Can I help you? - Yeah. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.94,0:46:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走 赶紧的 - 你干嘛？\N- Come on, come on. - Hey! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.54,0:46:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我走 快走 - 不 你搞什么鬼？\N- Let's go, let's go. Let's go. - No! What the fuck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.81,0:46:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你被捕了 - 我没有\N- You're under arrest. - No, I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.19,0:46:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 被捕了 过来 别乱动 - 凭什么逮捕我？\N- Yes, you are. Come here. Stop moving! - What am I under arrest for?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.23,0:46:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是我的洗漱用品 哎呦 - 你被捕了\N- That's my toiletries! Ow! - You're under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.90,0:46:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 犯了什么事？ - 持械抢劫 走吧\N- For what? - Armed robbery. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.49,0:46:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,持械？你胡说什么呢？\NArmed rob-- What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.82,0:46:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不想受伤就别动了\NYou're gonna hurt yourself if you keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.26,0:46:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 到底怎么回事？ - 走\N- What is going on? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.34,0:46:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老默 我妈在哪？ - 我叫她先走开一下\N- Murray, where's my mother? Murray. - I asked her to leave for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.05,0:46:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么？到底搞什么鬼？抓我？帮帮我！\NYou told her-- What the fuck is going on? I'm getting arrested! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.21,0:46:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,萨尔 萨尔 我跟他单独谈谈 你先回避下\NSal, Sal. I wanna talk to him in private. Excuse us. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.89,0:46:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去哪儿？ - 萨尔？ 你认识这人？\N- What do you want me to do? - Sal? You know this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.47,0:46:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先去屋里待会儿 - 好\N- Just go in the back for a while. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.06,0:46:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,关上门\NClose the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.33,0:46:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,行 情况不对就喊我\NAll right, if it gets crazy just holler.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.23,0:46:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼 我拿的那钱是你欠我的\NWhat the fuck is going on, Murray? That money I took, you owed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.68,0:46:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别胡扯 那钱是你持枪抢的\NNo, no, no, no. It was money you stole at gunpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.82,0:46:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 你答应过我的 听我说 - 不 你根本没...\N- No, you promised me... Excuse me. - No, you didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.85,0:46:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那钱本来就该给我的\NThat was my money and you took--
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.66,0:46:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你答应过要给我的 我没胡扯\NYou promised me that money. I'm not... Why would I make this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.16,0:46:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是去英国的路费 - 哦 比赛怎么样？\N- It was money for my trip to England. - What happened on your trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.62,0:46:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\NWhat do you mean, what happened on my trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.85,0:46:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你输了 - 我没输\N- You lost! - No, I didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.25,0:46:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你就是输了 - 听谁说的？\N- You did! - Where did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.73,0:46:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 对手作弊了 - 你知不知道我多少次\N- No, I got cheated against. - Do you know how many times
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.40,0:46:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 半夜得替你... - 行了 别扯了\N- in the middle of the night... - No, no. Stop with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.17,0:47:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 好好听着 - 少教训我\N- Shut up and listen to me! - Don't lecture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.13,0:47:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\NShut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.74,0:47:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道我多少次半夜被叫醒替你擦屁股\NYou don't know how many times I had to get woken up and bail you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.34,0:47:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你管的？\NWhen did I ask you to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.39,0:47:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我求过你吗？ - 你确实没求过我\N- When have I ever asked for your help? - You never asked me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.43,0:47:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 但我还是帮了\N- Exactly! - But I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.24,0:47:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你都多大了 你该懂事了\NAnd now, you're gonna be a big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.56,0:47:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你得成器了 - 成器？\N- It's your turn. - A big boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.06,0:47:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你竟然教育我？ - 没错 听好了\N- Did you really just say that to me? - Yeah. Yeah, you know, look...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.71,0:47:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能永远供着你妈\NI can't support your mother for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.48,0:47:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁让你操心了 - 哦 那谁操心？\N- You're not gonna have to. - Oh, yeah? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.24,0:47:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来承担 - 你承担？怎么承担？\N- Because I'm gonna step up. - You're gonna step up? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.59,0:47:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让我妈妈荣华富贵\NIn a way you can't imagine. She's gonna be living on Fifth Avenue
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.87,0:47:27.63,Default,,0,0,0,,住进有电梯的豪宅\Nin an apartment and building with a elevator,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.64,0:47:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,还有门童 还有专人伺候\Nand a man who works in the elevator that takes her every time she needs to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.45,0:47:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,得了得了 听好了\NSure, sure, sure. All right, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.39,0:47:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你两个选择 你自己选\NI'm gonna give you two options, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.50,0:47:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该能接受第一个\NI think you'll like the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.52,0:47:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,回鞋店干活\NYou come back to the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.34,0:47:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这回别再不务正业了\NThis time, no more bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.76,0:47:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,别再耍你那小乒乓了 明白吗？\NNone of this ping-pong mishegoss, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.57,0:47:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你更大的权责\NI'm gonna give you much more responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.53,0:47:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 你卖鞋挺有一手的\Nbecause truth be told, you're an amazing salesman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.04,0:47:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我都能卖给瘸子\NI could sell shoes to an amputee.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.02,0:47:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我偏不干 第二个选择呢？\NSo what? What's the other option?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.77,0:47:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那我就控告你 - 你才不会\N- I press charges. - You're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.38,0:47:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 洛伊是证人... - 你不会那么干的\N- Lloyd is a witness... - You're not doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.35,0:47:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,...然后你去蹲大牢\N...and you go to jail!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.44,0:47:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真的？对你亲外甥这么狠？你疯了吗？\NReally? You'd do that to your own kin? Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.93,0:48:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 得让你尝尝教训 - 萨尔 出来 萨尔\N- We'll see... You took it upon yourself. - Hey, Sal! Sal!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.80,0:48:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干嘛？ - 他给你多少钱来吓我？\N- What? - How much is he paying you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.83,0:48:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说什么 什么钱？\NWhat are you talking about, paying me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.36,0:48:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我舅给你多少钱来吓我？\NHow much is my uncle paying for you to scare me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.98,0:48:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不管多少 我出双倍 快来跪下给我舔吧\N'Cause whatever it is, I'll double it for you to suck my dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.53,0:48:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 给我舔\N- What? - Suck my dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.04,0:48:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你口臭真难闻 - 嘴放干净点 你这...\N- You have terrible breath. - Watch your mouth, you--
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.48,0:48:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 该死 - 走 现在就走\N- Ow! Fuck! - Let's go. We're going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.52,0:48:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他刚打了我 - 住手 行了行了\N- He just hit me! - Stop. Please stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.50,0:48:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老默 他打我 - 停下\N- Murray, he hit me. - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.63,0:48:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都商量好了\NWe worked everything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.38,0:48:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,听见没 我们商量好了\NYou were in the other room. You didn't hear. We already worked it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.63,0:48:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会补偿一切 - 粗鲁\N- He's paying back everything. - Animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.20,0:48:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他把钱给我了 都没事了\NHe gave me the money, and everything's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.48,0:48:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你从哪儿拿的钱？ - 你行李箱里\N- Where did you get that? - I got it from your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.37,0:48:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗 那是我去日本的钱\NAre you out of your mind? That's my money for Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.55,0:48:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是傻了？ - 走 赶紧走\N- Are you out of your fucking mind? - Let's go. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.02,0:48:36.53,Default,,0,0,0,,押到局里 把他押走\NJust take him downtown, damn it! Take him downtown!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.54,0:48:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 好 我听你的 停下 - 你玩完了 彻底完了\N- Okay. All right! Okay! I'll stop! - You're done. You're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.95,0:48:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 停下 停下 - 跟我走\N- Please. Stop. Stop. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.66,0:48:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 放开他 放开他 - 放开他？\N- All right. Let him go. Let him go. - Let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.90,0:48:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放开他 放开他 - 坐好\N- Let him go. Let him go. - Sit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.34,0:48:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 道个歉\NListen, apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.45,0:48:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,行 对不起 我错了\NOkay, I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.46,0:48:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,给他解开手铐\NTake his cuffs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.38,0:48:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 接下来这样安排 听好 - 好\N- This is what's gonna happen, okay? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.60,0:48:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们去花园咖啡馆见你妈\NWe're gonna meet your mom at the Garden Café.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.87,0:49:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们好好吃顿饭\NWe're gonna have a really nice dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.09,0:49:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,之前的破事儿就翻篇了 行吗？\NAnd let's just put all this shit behind us, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.56,0:49:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,行 没问题\NOkay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.61,0:49:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我错了 我错了 真错了 - 你知错了？\N- I'm sorry, I'm sorry. I'm sorry. - You're sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.05,0:49:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,剩下的事慢慢解决 赶紧穿衣服\NWe'll take care of everything. Just get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.31,0:49:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 舅舅爱你 - 行 我也爱你\N- Come on. I love you. - All right. I love you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.32,0:49:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你外甥真是个废物\NYour nephew's a piece of shit, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.19,0:49:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,哎 天呐 实在对不住\NOh, Jesus. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.87,0:49:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,再给你十块\NHere another ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.87,0:49:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好 行吧\NYeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.87,0:49:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,花园咖啡馆啊 点什么馅三明治？\NGarden Café, huh? What do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.64,0:49:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,烟熏肉啊 还能什么？\NThe pastrami, what else?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.64,0:49:27.97,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【烟熏肉三明治：东欧犹太移民特色食物】
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.32,0:49:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 烟熏肉 - 你点什么馅？\N- Ah, pastrami. - What do you get?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.00,0:49:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,英式烤牛肉\NRoast beef.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.00,0:49:31.97,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【英式烧牛肉：传统英式料理】
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.75,0:49:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 英式烧牛肉？ - 嗯\N- Roast beef? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.20,0:49:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,（意第绪语）你这吃洋饭的条子\NGoyishecop!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.63,0:49:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.36,0:49:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,开门 别磨蹭\NOpen up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.75,0:49:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把门撞开 - 你确定？\N- Break it down. - Break it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.48,0:49:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\NFuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.58,0:49:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你往哪儿跑？\NHey! Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.69,0:49:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,糟了\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.73,0:49:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？ - 他从窗户跑了\N- What happened? - He went out the window.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.96,0:49:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？怎么回事？ - 弗兰基\N- What? Wait! - Frankie!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.54,0:50:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 他沿着消防梯下去了\N- What? - He's coming down the escape right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.18,0:50:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那儿 别让他跑了\NThere he goes! Down the escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.88,0:50:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 快追 快追 快追\N- Oh, shit. - Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.65,0:50:08.60,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（纽约警察）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.21,0:50:25.60,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（埃塞克斯街宠物店）
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.30,0:50:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来 摸摸它 - 我去后头打个电话\N- You hold it. - I'm just gonna use the phone in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.88,0:50:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这兔子多喜欢你啊\NSee how much he likes you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.04,0:50:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 嘿 沃利 最近怎样 我是马蒂\N- Hello? - Hey, Wally. How you doing? It's Marty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.52,0:50:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 今晚出车吗？ - 废话 当然出\N- Are you working tonight? - Of course I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.16,0:50:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,行 好 开着车 多带现金\NOkay, great. Bring your cab and as much cash as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.31,0:50:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,到28街的哈尔西碰头 明白吗？\NI want you to meet me at The Halsey on 28th Street, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.79,0:50:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？你又想去骗局子？\NWhat? You wanna go hustling again?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.97,0:50:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对 没错\NYeah, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.15,0:50:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 还记得上次多惨吗？\NNo, no, no. I got my ass kicked last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.00,0:50:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们跑去史坦顿岛\NWe went all the way to Staten Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.51,0:50:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,十分钟你就被认出了 你还想回去？\Nand within ten minutes, they recognized you, and now you want to go back?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.07,0:51:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不去 这次去新泽西那边 奎因提过的那个地方\NNo, It's fine. We're gonna go to that place that Quinn was talking about in Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.96,0:51:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,坏主意\NThat's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.10,0:51:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是你的新宠物了 - 不 妈妈 我想要个小甲兽\N- That's your new pet. - No, Mom, I want the armadillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.84,0:51:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们商量过...\NNo, I already--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.93,0:51:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 我给你拿个小甲兽\NYou know what? I'm just gonna get you the armadillo.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.08,0:51:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你抱好 你自己挑\NI'm gonna give him to you, and then you can make a decision. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.21,0:51:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是个大爬虫 兔子才更乖\NThey're not reptiles. They're mammals.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.96,0:51:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,行 太好了 你真是个大好人 一个半小时后见\NOkay, great. You're a beautiful man. I'll see you in an hour and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.97,0:51:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哪儿？ - 哈尔西见 就这样 好哥们\N- Where? - At the Halsey. Okay. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.02,0:51:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 再见\NThank you. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.49,0:51:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 你来了\NOkay, good. Here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.85,0:51:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有后门可以出去？\NIs there a way I can go out the back or something, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.85,0:51:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛 你那眼神啥意思？\NWhat? Why are you looking at me like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.69,0:51:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你不打算说点什么吗？\NAren't you gonna say something to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.72,0:51:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 恭喜是吧？\NWhat, congratulations?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.61,0:51:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜？ - 对\N- Congratulations? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.61,0:51:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你傻吗？ - 你想让我说什么？\N- Are you kidding me? - What do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.24,0:51:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这八个月我一直在找你\NI've been trying to get in contact with you for eight months.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.19,0:51:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 这招没用的\NOkay, I see what you're trying to do. It's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.00,0:51:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 那孩子跟我没关系\N- Excuse me? - That's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.30,0:51:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绝对是你的 - 不可能 我都拔出来了\N- It is absolutely yours. - No, it's not. I pull out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.11,0:51:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是你的 - 你丈夫艾勒也拔出来吗？\N- Yes it is. - Does Ira pull out?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.09,0:51:44.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要我怎么说？ - 如实回答\N- What do you want me to say to that? - It's a simple question.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.10,0:51:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他和你上床时会拔出来吗？\NDoes he pull out when he has sex with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.70,0:51:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回答我 - 你竟然要我答这个？\N- Answer it. - You want me to answer that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.01,0:51:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对 快回答 他拔不拔出来\NYes! Answer it. Does he pull out when he...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.69,0:51:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起 不哭 不哭\NI'm sorry. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.80,0:51:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我陷入麻烦了 瑞秋 到处麻烦缠身\NI'm a mess right now. I'm really a mess, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.77,0:51:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我在伦敦输了后...\NI lost in London, by the way--
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.37,0:51:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.40,0:52:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\NGod.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.68,0:52:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干嘛呢？\NWhat's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.40,0:52:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他爸爸过世了\NHis father died.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.62,0:52:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放屁 - 她是我从八岁起的朋友\N- Bullshit! - This is my friend since I was eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.69,0:52:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你了吗？\NAm I talking to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.68,0:52:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,艾勒 我从八岁就认识她了\NIra, I've known her since I was eight years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.54,0:52:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸刚走 她在安慰我\NMy father just died. She was consoling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.07,0:52:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的 没事的\NHoney, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.72,0:52:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴 别碰我 - 你跟老婆就这样说话吗？\N- Shut up! Don't touch me! - That's how you talk to your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.33,0:52:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,对 有意见吗？\NYeah, that's how I talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.18,0:52:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行 - 有意见吗？\N- Okay. - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.09,0:52:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,来 来 来 把意见大声说出来\NNo, no, no! Come on. Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.94,0:52:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 说出来 - 马蒂 别说了\N- Keep going. - Marty, just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.23,0:52:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,看我不撕烂你的臭脸\NI'll rip that unibrow right off his fucking forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.12,0:52:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你想动手吗？跟个禽兽一样？\NYou wanna get physical? Like an ape?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.66,0:52:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,艾勒\NIra.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.98,0:52:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,艾勒 回来 快进来 你要干嘛？\NIra! Come back inside. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.54,0:52:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谁去把条子叫来 快点\NSomebody get the fucking cops over here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.59,0:52:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要干嘛？ - 操 我得赶紧溜\N- What did you do? - Fuck! I gotta get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.01,0:52:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么要躲警察\NWhy are you running from the cops?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.12,0:52:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在这儿 快去抓\NCome on, he's right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.55,0:52:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有后门吗？\NThere's no way out the back?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.07,0:52:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 后什么？ - 瑞秋 专心点 有没有？\N- What? What-- - Please! Come on. Rachel! Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.57,0:52:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,从这出去 走吧\NIt leads out the back. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.11,0:52:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,行 行 谢谢 谢谢\NOkay. Okay. Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.38,0:52:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别走 我上哪找你？ - 回头再说 回头再说\N- Where do we meet? Where? - I'll tell you later. I'll tell you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.33,0:53:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有没有看到一个戴眼镜的白小子从这儿出来？\NGuys, you see a white kid with glasses come through here?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.24,0:53:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,没人看见？\NNobody saw him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.26,0:53:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,听不懂英语？\NNo English, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.84,0:53:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,如需继续通话 请投币五分\NPlease insert a nickel if you'd like to continue the conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.15,0:53:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,要五分？电话要断了\NA nickel? They're gonna cut us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.34,0:53:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有五分吗？ - 没\N- Do you have a nickel? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.77,0:53:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 真没骗你 我保证这次是最后一次了\NMom, I'm not lying. I promise you this will be the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.42,0:53:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,难道我眼花了 这不是我的小毛毛吗？\NAre my eyes broke, or is that motherfucking Mouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.18,0:53:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 近来怎样？\N- Thank you. - What's up, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.37,0:53:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,太谢谢了 你要帮大忙了 谢谢\NThank you so much. I really appreciate it. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.51,0:53:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一身臭味 - 我知道\N- You smell like a fish, Marty. - I know, that's why
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.82,0:53:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,所以咱们得开个房 我得洗个澡\Nwe gotta get a hotel room. I need to get a shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.73,0:53:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 麻烦开一间房\NHow you doing? Hey, can we get a hotel room, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.75,0:53:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四块 - 你刚还说三块呢\N- Four dollars. - You said it was three dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.40,0:54:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是刚才那间价格 现在四块 - 怎么现在变四块了？\N- That was for the last room. It's four. - Why is it four dollars now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.36,0:54:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,先借我四块 我保证还你\NLet me get four bucks. I'll pay you back, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.05,0:54:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你说 我们只有十块本钱可以赌\NI'm telling you right now, we only got ten to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.05,0:54:07.35,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约120美元 820人民币 3,750新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.98,0:54:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就带了十块？搞什么鬼？\NYou brought ten dollars? What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.35,0:54:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一小时前才通知我 - 那咱们怎么赢钱？\N- You gave me a hour notice. - How are we supposed to make money?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.23,0:54:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 我得养娃呢 我就是个开出租的\NNigger, I got kids! I'm a fucking taxi driver.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.34,0:54:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有便宜点的房吗？不用讲究\NDo you have a cheaper room? It doesn't have to be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.59,0:54:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,五楼还有间 但不准洗澡\NThere's a room on the fifth floor, but you can't use the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.89,0:54:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那好 多少钱？ - 两块五\N- Okay, how much is that? - Two fifty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.89,0:54:16.47,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约30美元 210人民币 960新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.48,0:54:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 借我三块 谢谢 - 别赖账\N- Let me get three dollars. Thank you. - You better pay me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.29,0:54:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放心 放心 - 多亏你还有我这个哥们\N- Yeah, I will I will. - You lucky I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.09,0:54:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吉米 吉米 - 待会从赢的钱里扣\N- Jimmy. Jimmy. - It's coming out your winnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.19,0:54:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把钥匙递来\NGive me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.31,0:54:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这啥味儿？\NWhat's that smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.37,0:54:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呦 我去\NOh, my God! Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.65,0:54:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去 怎么那么臭 - 天呐\N- Wow! What is that? - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.36,0:54:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,出了点小意外\NHe had a little accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.92,0:54:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这哪是小意外啊\NGod! He had an enormous accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.68,0:54:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,难闻死了\NThat's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.32,0:54:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟掉粪坑里一样 - 我去\N- Smells like shit! - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.84,0:54:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 想必你是掉过粪坑吧\NJimmy, you smell like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.32,0:54:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你嘴比你那狗还臭 - 能把钥匙给我了吗？\N- Is that your breath or the dog? - Can I get my key, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.77,0:54:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不许带那狗上电梯 走楼梯\NDo not go in the elevator with that dog. Take the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.25,0:54:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹 - 赶紧洗狗\N- Are you kidding me? - Wash that dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.82,0:54:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安 吉米\NGoodbye, Jimmy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.82,0:54:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她肚子有多大了 - 非常大 大得吓人\N- How big is she, Marty? - Very big. Big.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.80,0:54:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大到明天就生吗？\NIs she popping out tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.94,0:54:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道什么时候生 我只知道孩子不是我的\NI don't know when she's popping out. Look, all I know is it's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.42,0:54:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我太了解她了 她有她的小算盘\NShe has an agenda. You don't know her like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.96,0:54:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她婚姻不幸 生活惨淡\NShe's stuck in a miserable marriage. She has a horrible life.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.98,0:54:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,她想借我逃避\NShe's trying to pin it down on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.08,0:54:58.60,Default,,0,0,0,,从八岁起 她就想把我套牢\NSince we were eight years old, she's trying to get me stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.62,0:55:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 套你这穷光蛋？ - 没错\N- Your bummy ass? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.49,0:55:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那她真有毛病\NYeah, she is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.48,0:55:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,从生理上讲那孩子绝不可能是我的\NIt's a biological impossibility that that kid is mine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.90,0:55:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你戴套了？ - 没 我不需要\N- So, you using raincoats? - No, I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.96,0:55:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那你多半是废了\NSo you must be shooting blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.96,0:55:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道“定海锁脉功”吗？\NDo you know what continence is, Wally? No?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.51,0:55:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,每次尿一半我就憋着\NEvery time I take a piss, I pull back,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.86,0:55:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,然后默唱首生日歌\NI hold my urine in, and I count to ten Mississippi.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.97,0:55:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 专练那块肌肉 - 我去\N- That's how you build up the muscle. - Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.24,0:55:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是专练膀胱炎的\NThat's how you get a fuckin' bladder infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.77,0:55:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢？那是我的信\NWhat are you doing? That's my mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.88,0:55:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,瞎看什么\NAre you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.65,0:55:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你得给你买尿布去了\NYou need to grab them goddamn diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.27,0:55:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不许走\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.48,0:55:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你得理智点\NAnd get a fucking grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.83,0:55:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不当什么爹\NI'm not a father.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.08,0:55:34.83,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（国际乒联）
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.29,0:55:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哟 马蒂 - 干嘛？\N- Yo, Marty. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.58,0:55:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,丽兹酒店是哪出？\NWhat's the Ritz?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.84,0:55:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛问这个？\NWhy?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.80,0:55:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你被国际乒联\NYou got a $1,500 fine
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.28,0:55:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,罚了一千五百美金\Nfrom the International Table Tennis...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.28,0:55:58.15,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约1.2万美元 8.5万人民币 37万新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.29,0:55:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - ...他们说...\N- What? - ...Association and...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.17,0:55:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们还... - 快拿给我\N- And they... - Bring it in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.89,0:56:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们还把你给禁赛了 - 给我\N- And they banned your scrawny ass. - Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.27,0:56:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 你他妈从哪冒出来的？\N- Are you okay? - Who the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.58,0:56:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快来帮我 快抬起来\NGod! Help me! Get this fucking thing off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.27,0:56:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我的狗\NMy dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.48,0:56:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 见鬼 出啥事了\N- Holy shit! - Shit! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.41,0:56:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 从浴缸滚出来帮我\NCome on! Get outta that fuckin' tub and help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.59,0:56:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我狗要淹死了 赶紧 帮我\NMy dog's drowning, man. Come on! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.44,0:56:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我要抬了 准备抽手\NOkay, I'm flipping it. Take your arm out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.59,0:56:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一 二 - 快抬\N- One. Two. - Lift it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.18,0:56:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,三\NThree.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.89,0:56:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快把手抽出来 - 疼死了 疼死了\N- Take your arm out! - Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.24,0:56:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,操 操\NFuck! Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.40,0:56:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呦 你的胳膊\NOh, fuck, your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.83,0:56:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,坐好 坐好 别看伤口\NLean back. Lean back. Don't look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.02,0:56:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我得弄个止血带 - 噢 操\N- I need to make a tourniquet. - Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.03,0:56:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过来 把手给我 - 你要干嘛？\N- Come here. Give me your arm. - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.36,0:56:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要干嘛？ - 手给我\N- What are you doing? - Give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.89,0:56:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 我的狗呢？\N- Fuck. - Where's my dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.31,0:56:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别管那狗了 手给我\NDon't worry about the dog! Give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.73,0:56:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 摩西 - 别乱动 别乱动\N- Moses. - Do nothing. Do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.01,0:56:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有我在呢 别担心\NI got you. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.31,0:56:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 快叫救护车\NWally, call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.59,0:56:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧？ - 不 我一点也不好\N- Are you good? - No, I'm not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.85,0:56:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我的眼镜呢？\NWhere are my glasses?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.96,0:57:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 你受伤没？你刚从楼板掉下去了\NI mean, are you hurt? You just fell through the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.62,0:57:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真见鬼 我得把房钱要回来\NFucking horseshit. I'm getting our money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.81,0:57:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 咱们闯大祸了 得赶紧溜\NMarty, we gotta get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.91,0:57:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,才两块五 你别傻了\NIt's $2.50.  What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.29,0:57:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我要的可不止两块五 你没懂吗？\NI'm asking for way more than $2.50. You see what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.60,0:57:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在这等着 等着\NWait here. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.71,0:57:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等多久? - 十秒钟\N- For how long? - Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.88,0:57:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鞋 我的衣服\NMy shoes, my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.65,0:57:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,全湿透了 你们怎么搞的\NEverything's soaking wet. It's a mess in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.81,0:57:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴吧 - 你得感谢没砸到你屋\N- Why don't you put a sock in it? - You wanna switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.41,0:57:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 是你 我跟你说过不能洗澡\N- Hey. - You! I... I told you not to use the fucking shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.95,0:57:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你才没说 是你把房租给我的 懂吗？\NNo, you didn't. You're the one that rented me the room, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.01,0:57:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点摔死\NI could have broken my neck falling out of that ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.35,0:57:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,再闹你现在也能死\NThat can fucking still happen too.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.92,0:57:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在威胁我吗？ - 对 对\N- Are you threatening me right now? - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.33,0:57:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 居然敢威胁我？ - 对\N- Rellay? You want to threaten me? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.28,0:57:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 地下室锁了 - 谁拿了钥匙？\N- Basement is locked! - Who's got the fucking key?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.26,0:57:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,给我听好了 听好了 把房钱还给我\NListen, man! Listen! I want my money for my room...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.11,0:57:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救护车来了 - ...我还要赔偿\N- Ambulance. - ...and I want a reimbursement
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.67,0:57:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的东西都毁了 - 你当真？\N- for my shit that got ruined. - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.92,0:57:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 废话 - 一分都不会给你\N- Yes! - You're not gonna get your shit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.39,0:57:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一共七块五 - 一分钱也不给\N- $7.50! - You'll get nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.39,0:57:46.46,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约90美元 630人民币 2,900新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.48,0:57:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点帮我 - 医护来了\N- Come on. Help me! - Paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.71,0:57:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们可来了 - 病人在哪儿？\N- Good, you're here. - Where's the patient at?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.49,0:57:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就在那儿 手臂受伤了 流了好多血\NHe's in here. It's his arm. He's lost a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.97,0:57:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.44,0:57:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 浴缸砸他身上了 - 浴缸砸他身上了？\N- Bathtub fell on him. - Bathtub fell on him?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.47,0:57:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我胳膊没知觉了\NI can't feel my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.71,0:57:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,吉米 你得替我照看好摩西\NYo, Jimmy. Come on, you gotta help me with this dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.96,0:58:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我这儿没人手 - 那就送他去兽医那儿\N- I don't got nobody free. - We gotta get him to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.94,0:58:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真腾不出人手 - 他是我的家人\N- I got nobody free right now. - He's my family, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.50,0:58:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 把两块五还我 我就走 七块五不要了\NListen, now. Just give me the $2.50, and I'll get outta here. Forget the $7.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.60,0:58:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把两块五给我就行 - 我做不了主\N- Just give me $2.50. - I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.06,0:58:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,明天找老板要\NSee the owner tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.25,0:58:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小子 - 都怪你的\N- Kid. - It's your shitty ceiling
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.36,0:58:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 烂地板 - 小子 小子\N- in this crummy hotel. - Kid. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.06,0:58:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么都不给 - 什么？\N- I ain't giving you nothing. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.26,0:58:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 帮我把狗送到兽医那儿\NKid. Come on. Just bring the dog to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.78,0:58:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我得工作 有活要干\NI can't. I got work. I got a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.59,0:58:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能被开除 - 你有工作？\N- I can't get fired. - You got a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.66,0:58:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我出双倍工钱 - 不 行不通 不行\N- I'll give you double what you're getting. - No, I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.59,0:58:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那就三倍 来吧\NI'll give you triple. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.14,0:58:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别乱动 别乱动 - 行吧\N- Take it easy. Calm down. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.86,0:58:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,好 打开那个包 椅子上的包\NOkay, look in that bag. See the bag on the chair?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.05,0:58:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,对 把包打开\NYeah, go in that bag, okay? Open it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.57,0:58:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我得给你上个止血带\NI'm gonna apply a tourniquet to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.31,0:58:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,换掉原来的\NI'm gonna remove the other tourniquet right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.28,0:58:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拿五十给你自己\NTake 50 for yourself. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.28,0:58:38.41,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约600美元 4,100人民币 1.8万新台币】
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.19,0:58:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,再拿五十给兽医 明白吗？\NBring 50 for the vet, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.41,0:58:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,有血喷出来\NWe got blood squirting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.68,0:58:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,兽医在13街和1大道交口\NHe's on 13th and 1st.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.23,0:58:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他我一完事就赶过去 懂吗？\NAnd tell him I'll be there as soon as I can get there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.86,0:58:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你居然要给他钱？\NYou're gonna give this motherfucker money?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.93,0:58:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是这混蛋砸的你\NHe's the one who fuckin' dropped the tub on ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.77,0:58:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过他别洗澡了\NI told him not to get in the fuckin' bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.54,0:58:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真靠得住 小子\NFucking mensch, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.10,0:58:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,准备抬 送他去贝尔维尤医院\NStretcher ready? We'll take him to Bellevue.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.85,0:58:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈好人\NFucking mensch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.74,0:58:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,现在掉头送他去兽医还来得及\NWe can still turn around and take him to the vet.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.82,0:58:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不用 不用\NNo. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.89,0:59:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五十块绰绰有余了 - 什么比五十大？是一百块\N- Fifty dollars is more than enough. - You know what's better than 50? 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.21,0:59:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,一百本钱能让咱大赚一笔\NWe can clean house with a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.60,0:59:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你个贪心的犹太鬼\NDon't be greedy, you fucking Jew.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.24,0:59:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有1500美元罚款 你亲自拿给我的 别忘了 - 别叫了\N- No, no. It's a $1,500 fine. You're the one that showed it to me. - Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.08,0:59:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且我们还得连赌两周夜场 - 我们？\N- By the way, we gotta do this every night for two weeks, - "We"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.53,0:59:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 否则我就去不了日本了 - 不 不 不\N- or else I can't go to Japan. - Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.93,0:59:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会因为你的错 为你耽误两周工作\NI'm not taking two weeks off work 'cause you fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.11,0:59:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,来 吃点这个 吃点这个\NHey. Take this, boy. Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.11,0:59:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,吃吧 好孩子\NThere you go. Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.14,0:59:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,把这狗的项圈松松\NLoosen up the collar on this motherfucker, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.30,0:59:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好 - 他都喘不过气了\N- All right. - He sound like a radiator.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.39,0:59:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们先去赌\NWe're gonna go play,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.45,0:59:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,回来顺路再送他去兽医\Nwe'll drop him off at the vet on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.96,0:59:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这也就几个小时 - 马蒂 我有接送安排 别忘了\N- What's a couple of hours to this guy? - Marty, I got rides set up, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.96,0:59:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,叫摩西\NHuh. Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.96,0:59:27.75,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（摩西）
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.96,0:59:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,到你了 三号球道\NLane three. That's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.81,0:59:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 要点什么？\N- Hi, how you doing? - Could I help?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.61,0:59:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还有球道吗？\NCan I get a lane?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.49,1:00:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大概得等三四十分钟样子\NProbably gonna be a half hour, 40 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.63,1:00:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 你确定能等？\N- That's okay. - You all right with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.81,1:00:04.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在拿鞋吗？ - 我待会儿再拿\N- You want shoes? - I'll just grab 'em later.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.49,1:00:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,结束 输了\NDone. Over.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.55,1:00:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,弱得可怜 给钱\NFucking pathetic. Pay up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.44,1:00:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来下一局？\NWho wants next?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.67,1:00:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我来一局 嘿 怎么玩？\NCan I play? Hey! Can I play?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.69,1:00:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一块钱一局 - 行吧\N- It's a dollar a game. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.38,1:00:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你叫什么？ - 塞思\N- What's your name? - Seth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.18,1:00:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,先来几回热热身吧\NLet's get a warm-up rally going.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.46,1:00:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 要打就押钱 否则滚蛋 我不白陪打\NNah. Put up or shut up. I don't play for free.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.60,1:00:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 没听过这规矩\NAll right. Never heard of that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.86,1:00:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我管账 - 钱给他\N- I'm holding. - He's holding.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.17,1:00:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你管账？凭什么让他管？\NYou're holding? Why is he holding?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.17,1:00:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你带钱了吗？ - 不许耍赖\N- Have you got yours? - Can I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.35,1:00:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 没问题\NTrust me, you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.83,1:00:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这句谁对谁？ - 塞思对阵罗杰\N- Where are we at? - All right, Seth vs. Roger.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.05,1:00:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,一块钱一局\NDollar game.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.05,1:00:42.68,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约12美元 85人民币 375新台币】
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.69,1:00:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我发球\NI serve.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.37,1:00:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛呢？我还没准备好\NWhat are you doing? I'm not even looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.63,1:00:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 1比0 - 我刚才都没看\N- One-zip. - I wasn't even looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.45,1:00:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 不能用手接球 - 什么？\N- No, you can't do that. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.08,1:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是接不到球\NYou gotta let the ball hit the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.57,1:00:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,就得让球自己落地 我得分\NYou can't catch it with your paddle. My point.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.07,1:00:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在扯什么？ - 手接球不算\N- What are you talking about? - You can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.50,1:01:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,拍子接不住就得让球落地\NYou gotta let the ball fall off the table.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.18,1:01:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 胡说八道 - 你犯规了\N- That's ridiculous. - You're cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.54,1:01:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我犯规了？ - 对 这就叫犯规\N- I'm cheating? - Yeah, that's called cheating.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.35,1:01:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没按规矩来 - 行吧 分给你\N- You're not following the rules. - Fine. Take the point.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.02,1:01:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 把球给我 - 1比1\N- Thank you. Give me the ball. - One-one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.12,1:01:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,操\NFuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.20,1:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好险 - 打得好 打得好\N- That was close. - That was good. That was good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.64,1:01:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 不 不 不\NOh. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.39,1:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,收着吧 收着吧\NNo, no. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.53,1:01:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我本该让你五分的 伙计\NI should have spotted you, like, five points, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.91,1:01:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你今天够倒霉了 留着吧\NYou've had a rough enough day already. Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.35,1:01:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 伙计 谢谢\NThank you, brother. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.69,1:01:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,没事儿\NIt's all good.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.15,1:01:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,打得不错\NGood game.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.18,1:01:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 亚当 亚当 该你了\NAll right, Adam. Adam, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.49,1:01:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想押多少？ - 五毛\N- What do you want to put on? - I can go 50 cents.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.83,1:01:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你手里有球吗？\NYou got a ball?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.98,1:01:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你鼻子怎么回事？\NWhat happened to your nose?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.41,1:01:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我有球 我有球\NI got one, I got one.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.81,1:01:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有人赖账跑了\NFare ran out on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.28,1:01:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,赖什么账？怎么回事？\NFare from what? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.71,1:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我开出租的 曼哈顿来的\NI'm a taxi driver. From Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.79,1:01:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 曼哈顿？ - 对\N- Manhattan? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.10,1:01:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,那路费可不便宜 伙计\NThat's an expensive trip, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.70,1:01:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是 大概二十块到二十五块呢\NOh, yeah. $20, $25.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.89,1:01:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,碰上有钱的主儿\NWell, the high rollers tip five,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.82,1:01:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,还能再给五块小费\Nso that's five in tips. And...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.04,1:01:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚把他送到 那人从后面掐住我脖子\NI fucking get to the spot, the guy chokes me out,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.15,1:01:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 朝我后脑勺猛揍 - 不会吧\N- punching me in the back of the head. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.07,1:01:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,然后抢了钱就跑\NTakes my money and run the fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.54,1:02:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,后来我追上那混蛋 你猜怎么着\NCaught up to the motherfucker, and, boy...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.69,1:02:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他揍得眼冒金星\NI beat the brights off that motherfucker, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.33,1:02:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我把他搜刮了个遍\NAnd I took what he had.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.08,1:02:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你把他搜刮了？\NYou took what he had?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.11,1:02:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那当然 谁他妈的会放过\NHell, yeah! You fucking damn right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.55,1:02:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你把钱踹你兜里？  - 当然了\N- You added that to your roll? - Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.02,1:02:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那厚厚一大摞钞票\NTo that fat roll I've seen you pulling out.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.49,1:02:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是原则问题 他妈的原则\NIt's principle. It's fucking principle!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.87,1:02:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 但是建议你把钱藏好\NI understand that. I would keep it hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,在这儿这种地方 最好别显摆\NI would keep that down, if I were you, in this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.45,1:02:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是谁都像他那么面善\NNot everybody's as nice as Christian is, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.79,1:02:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,这分是我的\NThat's my point.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.49,1:02:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那打球的臭小子是谁？\NWhat about that asshole right there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.46,1:02:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我哪知道那是谁\NI don't know who the fuck that guy is.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.36,1:02:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不能这么发球 - 为什么不能？\N- You can't serve like that. - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.30,1:02:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我这么发球都好几年了\NI've been serving like that for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.52,1:02:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 罗杰 罗杰 给你说话呢 - 你们的规则真荒唐\N- Hey, Roger. Roger. Hello. - That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.36,1:02:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 再打一分钟 - 球道轮到我们了\N- Give me one more minute. - Our lane is open.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.89,1:02:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 回来再打保龄球 - 不行 现在就得去\N- The lane can wait. It's fine. - No, we gotta go now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.98,1:02:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要不然就让给别人了 - 我正打乒乓呢\N- They're gonna give it away. - I'm playing now.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.74,1:02:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,为了打保龄球我都等一晚上了 赶紧的 快走\NI have been waiting all night to bowl. Let's go. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.14,1:02:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,罗杰\NRoger.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.85,1:02:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,, - 我得分 - 瞎喊什么的\N- My point. - Look what you made me do.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.83,1:02:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不玩了\NI gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.79,1:02:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？ - 把那一块钱还我\N- What do you mean you gotta go? - Give me my dollar back.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.11,1:02:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛还没打完呢\NWe're in the middle of a game.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.33,1:02:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你走就算弃权 把我的钱也给我\NYou forfeit the game, then. Give me my dollar.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.18,1:02:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把我的钱也给我 - 别激动 退后点\N- Give me my dollar back! - Relax. Back up, back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.11,1:02:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他弃权了 - 打完再给\N- He's gonna leave the game? - You didn't finish the game.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.42,1:02:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 那你接着打 你来打\NAll right, then you play. Then you play.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.67,1:02:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我没钱了 最后十块都给他了\NI'm broke, man. I gave him my last ten.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.41,1:02:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你打\NI'll play you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.52,1:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,喔 喔 喔\NWhoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.11,1:03:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,哇塞 你们这种人也会玩桌球了\NOh, wow. I didn't know you guys played table tennis.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.88,1:03:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一块一局 你玩得起吗？\NPut up a dollar. Do you have a dollar?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.74,1:03:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去你的 我押五块 - 你哪来的五块钱\N- Fuck you. Put up five. - You don't have five dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.74,1:03:07.66,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约60美元 400人民币 1,900新台币】
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.70,1:03:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,哇塞 你肯定是抢来的吧\NOh, wow. You must have robbed someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.74,1:03:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有种你也把钱亮出来\NPut your money where your mouth is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.01,1:03:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我亮出家伙 教你做人\NWhy don't I put my penis where your mouth is?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.29,1:03:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,计分的 沃利对阵这个混蛋\NRed shirt, Wally and whatever the fuck his name is.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.61,1:03:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,先别计分 回来再打\NMark it blank, baby. I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.54,1:03:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪？\NWhere are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.49,1:03:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那我先不计分\NI will mark it blank!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.13,1:03:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,看什么热闹呢？\NWhat's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.31,1:03:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这黑小子要把钱输光了\NThe colored boy is about to lose all his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.12,1:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 都输给这混蛋了\NYeah, to this asshole right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.98,1:03:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 - 赛点\N- Fuck! - Match point.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.48,1:03:46.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赛点 来了 - 沃利 加油\N- Match point. Here we go. - Wally! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.53,1:03:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 加油别泄气\NDon't get upset though, Wally. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.24,1:03:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,赢了\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.48,1:03:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,球擦边了 都他妈看见了吧\NIt grazed the edge. You fucking saw that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.94,1:03:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,没擦边\NIt didn't graze the edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.30,1:04:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 球变向了 这看见了吧 - 没擦边\N- It changed. You saw that. - It didn't graze the edge.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.90,1:04:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把钱给我 - 搞什么鬼?\N- No, give me my money. - What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.09,1:04:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把钱给我 - 这简直...\N- Give me my money. - This is b--
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.95,1:04:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱给我 钱给我\NGive me the money. Give me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.62,1:04:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱给我 - 求你了\N- Pay me. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.71,1:04:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,留我五块油钱行吗？\NLet me hold five for gas money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.70,1:04:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 你没钱还赌\NNo. You shouldn't bet with money you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.87,1:04:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 车没油了 我怎么回家？ - 用脚\N- How the fuck am I gonna get home? - Walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.57,1:04:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就给他留五块吧\NJust let him keep five.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.85,1:04:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 你今晚够混蛋了\N- No. - You've been a dick all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.04,1:04:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给钱 - 别再贪这点钱了\N- Give me my money. - Just stop being greedy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.18,1:04:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 留他五块回家钱吧 - 太坑人了\N- Just give him five to get home! - This is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.39,1:04:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是厚颜无耻 - 去死吧你\N- And you're fucking smiling. - Fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.40,1:04:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱给我 把钱给我\NGive me the money. Give me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.17,1:04:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\NFuck you.
