Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.79,1:04:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么回家啊\NHow the fuck am I gonna get home?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.35,1:04:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是你吹牛的下场\NThat's what happens when you talk shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.74,1:04:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 滋味不好受吧？ - 混蛋\N- It stinks, doesn't it? - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.04,1:04:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 罗杰在哪儿 快出来？ - 该死\N- Where's-- Where's Roger? - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.79,1:04:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来了 - 快来 罗杰\N- Yeah, I got it. - Yeah, Rog!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.49,1:04:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,跟这混蛋打一局 把他油钱赢回来\NPlay this numbnuts for his gas money.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.35,1:04:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你得跟罗杰打 明白吗？\NYou're gonna play Roger now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.29,1:04:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油 罗杰 - 加油\N- Let's go, Roger. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.68,1:04:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 别磨蹭 - 你？\N- Let's go right now. - You?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.78,1:04:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不跟你打 你太厉害了\NI won't play you. You're too good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.26,1:04:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你4分\NI'll spot you four points.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.02,1:04:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,行 赌四十块\NFine. Forty dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.02,1:04:46.63,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an8}【约490美元 3,300人民币 1.5万新台币】
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.60,1:04:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,四十块？我没这么多钱\NForty dollars? I don't have forty dollars.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.45,1:04:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,爱打就打 不打拉倒 我得走了\NYou want it? Take it or leave it. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.65,1:04:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 四十块 - 一 二 三...\N- Forty dollars. - One, two, three...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.67,1:04:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,谁还有钱 谁还有钱？\NCome on, who's got cash? Who's got cash?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.82,1:04:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我帮你 - 都帮沃利出点\N- I got you. - It's Team Wally. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.59,1:04:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,来 来 来 都凑一凑 凑一凑 送他回家\NPitch in, pitch in. Let's get him home. Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.64,1:05:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家 真谢谢大家\NThank you, everybody. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.18,1:05:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,一定给你赚出回家钱 一定\NWe're gonna get you home. We're gonna get you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.41,1:05:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 你们不出钱吗？\NAll right. Great. Great. Nothing? This whole row?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.35,1:05:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 我跟你单下一注\NYo, I'll put a side bet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.73,1:05:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,赌多少？\NHow much?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.84,1:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五块 - 你就这点钱？\N- Five dollars. - You don't got more than that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.42,1:05:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,十块 哟 还有点钱嘛\NTen. Ooh, you got a little bit of money.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.51,1:05:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 非常感谢\NThank you. Thanks so much.
