Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.82,1:06:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 要不你先把钱都给我\NWally, I was thinking. If you give me the full amount now,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.09,1:06:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我从日本回来给你十倍\NI can give you ten times that when I get back from Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.27,1:06:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹 小毛毛 - 你什么意思？\N- Stop, stop. Stop, Mouse. - No, no, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.69,1:06:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别想拿坑别人的那套来坑我\NYou're not gonna fuck me like you do everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.00,1:06:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到罚单了 别忘了 - 毛毛\N- You saw the fine. You saw it. - Mouse.
