Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.26,1:06:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我给你买个出租车牌照 - 别拿牌照忽悠我 毛毛\N- I'll buy you a medallion. - I don't want no fucking medallion, Mouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.94,1:06:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那给你买辆新车 别难为我\NI'll buy you a new cab. Don't give me a hard time about this.
