Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.06,1:06:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,逮到你了 王八蛋\NHey, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.75,1:06:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,完了 马蒂 马蒂 快上车 快上车\NOh, fuck. Marty. Marty, let's go. Get in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.05,1:06:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别慌 别慌 - 快上车\N- Okay, just let me do the talking. - Get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.01,1:07:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,逮到他了 搞死这王八蛋\NLook who it is! Let's get this motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.11,1:07:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,几位 晚上好\NGentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.79,1:07:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？哥几个还好吧？\NWhat's going on? How are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.76,1:07:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把钱还我们 - 你们在说什么？\N- Give us our money! - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.48,1:07:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正给这哥们加油呢 - 看看这是谁\N- I'm giving this guy some gas. - Look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.14,1:07:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别玩这套!\NDon't pull that shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.31,1:07:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你他妈设局坑我们 - 我没设局\N- You fucking hustled us! - I didn't hustle anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.79,1:07:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我认出你了 你是他妈的马蒂·毛瑟\NI know who you are! You're fuckin' Marty Mauser!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.10,1:07:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 冷静点 - 我就没听说过这个名字\N- Relax! - I don't know who that is!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.60,1:07:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,罗杰 住手 住手\NRoger! Stop it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.08,1:07:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别冲动 有话好说\NNo, relax. Relax. Relax. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.83,1:07:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出这破车\NOut of the fucking car!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.29,1:07:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,滚出这破车 你这黑鬼\NGet out of the fucking car, nigger!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.17,1:07:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凭什么要我... - 滚出来\N- Why I gotta be-- - Get the fuck out!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.77,1:07:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,去你们的\NFuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.35,1:07:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 赶快上车 - 去你们的\N- Marty, let's fucking go! - Fuck yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.43,1:07:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,走 走 走 走 快走\NGo, go, go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.77,1:07:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 注意 注意 电线杆\NWally, watch out! Watch out! The pole!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.80,1:07:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\NNo! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.10,1:07:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,沃利 狗掉了 狗掉下去了 沃利\NWally, the dog. The dog, Wally.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.95,1:07:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 管他的狗 - 不能丢下那狗\N- Fuck that dog! - I need the dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.09,1:07:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,去他的狗\NFuck the dog,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.19,1:07:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 不 不 - 也去你的 去你的\N- Oh, no. No! - and fuck you, man! Fuck you, man!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.13,1:07:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我这回赔大了\NThey'll take this out of my paycheck!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.69,1:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,车都废了 得从我工资里扣 我要丢工作了\NMy car's fucked up, man! I'm gonna lose my fucking job!
