Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.82,1:08:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太感谢你了 太感谢了\NThank you so much. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.76,1:08:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我会补偿你的\NI'm gonna make it up to you. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.05,1:08:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,别生我气 行吗?\NDon't be mad at me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.97,1:08:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我会给你买辆新出租 真的\NI'm gonna get you a new cab. All right?
