Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.30,1:09:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 泰德 - 嘿 马蒂 近来怎样？\N- Hey, Ted. - Hey, Marty. How you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.03,1:09:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 劳伦斯在吗？ - 听说令尊的事情了 请节哀\N- Is Lawrence here? - Sorry about your loss.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.57,1:09:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 劳伦斯来了吗？\NIt's all right. Is Lawrence here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.99,1:09:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,来了 应该就在里边吧\NUh, yeah. He's around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.76,1:09:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 我去找下 谢了 - 行 行\N- Okay. All right. Thank you. - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.70,1:09:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎回来伙计 - 嗯\N- Good to see you, man. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.38,1:09:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 - 近来可好？\N- Hi, Marty. - How you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.56,1:09:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好久不见 - 你好 你好\N- Nice to see you. - Hello, Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.44,1:09:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚能借住你后屋吗 求你了\NHey, can I stay in your back room tonight, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.13,1:09:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 你的小妞在后头呢 知道吗？\NHey, hey. Got your girl in the back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.30,1:09:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,她怀孕了 现在心情挺糟的\NShe pregnant. She real upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.03,1:09:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 好吧 知道了\NOh, God. Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.03,1:10:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我去看看她\NUh, let me go talk to her,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.53,1:10:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但你千万别走开 我马上回来\Nbut then please don't leave without finding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.18,1:10:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放心 我就在这儿 - 好 很高兴见到你\N- Yeah, I'll be here. Okay. - All right. Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.14,1:10:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 也很高兴见到你 - 嗯\N- All right, good to see you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.65,1:10:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你来这干嘛啊？\NHey. What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.06,1:10:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想麻烦你 我知道你很忙\NI don't mean to bother you. I know you're really busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.72,1:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这脸怎么回事 谁干的？ - 我真没地方落脚了\N- What the hell happened to your face? - I didn't really have anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.35,1:10:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我看看 - 他突然就开始...\N- Let me see. - He just started...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.54,1:10:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他突然就开始朝我大吼\Nhe just started yelling at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.04,1:10:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,跟疯了一样 还扯我的衣服不撒手\NAnd he was really mad and he was ripping my clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.59,1:10:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他打的？ - 他把我吓坏了\N- He did this to you? - He was really scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.92,1:10:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我真没别处可去了\NI just didn't know where else to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.99,1:10:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你会怪我吗？\NAre you mad at me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.34,1:11:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋？\NRachel?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.70,1:11:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不是瑞秋 是马蒂 开门\NNo, it's not Rachel. It's Marty. Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.16,1:11:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,等下\NOkay. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.56,1:11:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么来...\NWhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.81,1:11:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,活该\NShame on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.95,1:12:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 迪翁 你好啊 真是打扰了\NHey, Dion. How you doing, man? I really appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.74,1:12:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我妹妹 瑞秋\NThis is my sister Rachel, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.26,1:12:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 这是我朋友 也是我生意伙伴迪翁\NRachel, this is my buddy, my business partner, Dion.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.43,1:12:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿\N- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.68,1:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,她家被水淹了\NHer place flooded.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.02,1:12:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她得借宿一晚 不麻烦吧？\NShe needs a place to crash for the night. That's okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.21,1:12:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我说不好\NI don't know, man, it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.29,1:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我懂 但我不能让她住在都发霉有毒的地方啊\NI know, but I can't have her exposed to mold and spores and shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.32,1:12:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,迪翁 帮个忙 她都怀孕八个月了 懂吗？\ND, come on, she's eight months pregnant, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.51,1:12:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,帮个忙\NCome on...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.76,1:12:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子是我外甥\NThat's my nephew.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.20,1:12:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我家规矩不让带别人回来的\NI'm not supposed to have people over.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.80,1:12:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她家真没法住了 我不能让她回去 求你了\NShe's got a bad situation at home. I can't have her going back there. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.20,1:12:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧  好吧 那就住一晚\NAll right. Come on. You can spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.79,1:12:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但明天我爸妈回来前就得离开\NYou just gotta be out of here by tomorrow before my parents get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.23,1:12:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题\NOkay. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.31,1:12:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们得趁碰这次碰面好好商量下\NWe should take advantage of the time we have together.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.07,1:12:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,把生意计划好好商量一下\NYou know, really firm up our business plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.57,1:12:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这样你爸一回来 肯定对你另眼相看\NThat way, when your dad gets back, he sees how organized we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.90,1:12:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 他挺失望的\NYeah, he's pretty upset.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.26,1:12:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,这堆货丢这儿 你八个月都没管\NYou left us with all of this inventory for eight months.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.01,1:12:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系 几周后我拿下世界冠军\NThat's fine. In a few weeks I'll take the championship.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.03,1:12:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都会重回正轨\NWe'll be right back on track.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.12,1:12:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 球就都在这儿 - 真的？哪呢？\N- Balls are right in here. - Really? Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.89,1:12:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,最上头的箱子\NThe top box.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.54,1:12:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\NThanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.67,1:13:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哇 你做出橙球了？ - 是\N- Whoa. You did the orange? - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.05,1:13:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么做的？\NHow'd you do the orange?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.15,1:13:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我联系了哈克斯公司\NI contacted someone at Halex.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.72,1:13:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他们给塑料上的色\NThey colored the celluloid for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.28,1:13:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么办到的？ - 花钱 宝贝\N- How? - Money, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.76,1:13:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我老爸都看好你\NMe and my pop, we believe in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.45,1:13:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们投了钱的 你消失了 所以他挺生气的\NWe're invested. That's why he's been so mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.02,1:13:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个 瑞秋\NCheck it out, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.70,1:13:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,来 看看这包装\NHere, check out the packaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.33,1:13:20.46,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（至尊马蒂 马蒂·毛瑟冠军赛官方用球）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.76,1:13:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,“至尊马蒂 马蒂·毛瑟冠军赛官方用球”\N"Marty Supreme. The official Marty Mauser championship table tennis ball.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.46,1:13:22.67,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（精心打造 橙球 让你再也不必穿黑衣）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.48,1:13:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,“精心打造 橙球...”\NProfessionally made. Orange..."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.88,1:13:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这宣传词 你想出来了？\NOrange spheres? You came up with that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.61,1:13:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不错吧\NYeah. Pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.76,1:13:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,不错吧？迪翁 这让我刮目相看\NPretty good? Dion, this is... I'm stunned.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.13,1:13:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,刮目相看\NI'm stunned.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.33,1:13:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 而且还是手绘的 - 你画的？\N- Hand-drawn too. - You drew this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.10,1:13:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 真是神来之笔\N- Yeah. - It's inspired.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.51,1:13:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖\NI appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.38,1:13:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你都不知道自己多有能耐\NI don't think you know what you're capable of.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.38,1:13:35.94,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（至尊马蒂 美国制造）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.35,1:13:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你瞧瞧 - 过奖\N- Check it out. - Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.88,1:13:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.15,1:13:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,确实很漂亮\Nit's really nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.71,1:13:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是你房间？ - 不是 是我弟弟的\N- This is your room? - No, it's my brother's.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.79,1:13:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有弟弟？你怎么没跟我说过\NYou have a brother? You never told me you had a brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.24,1:13:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经毕业了 搬出去住了\NIt's a younger brother. He moved out.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.67,1:13:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那这房间空着？\NSo his room is free?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.26,1:13:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 对 - 我先去安顿一下我妹\N- Uh, yeah. - Let me get my sister situated.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.72,1:13:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 五分钟后去找你 - 行\N- I'll come find you in five minutes. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.20,1:13:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,马上见\NFive minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.43,1:13:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,迪翁 你真让我刮目相看\NI'm really impressed, D.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.01,1:13:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过奖 - 真佩服你\N- Thank you. - Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.38,1:13:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这家伙真不一般\NSpecial guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.69,1:14:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我去把床弄好 你就安心躺着吧\NLet me get the bed comfortable for you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.03,1:14:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就要走了吗？\NSo are you gonna go out there now?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.32,1:14:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,对 我得琢磨下明天的计划\NYeah, I gotta figure my plan out for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.40,1:14:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？什么计划？\NWhy? Plan for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.65,1:14:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我得把心态收拾好\NWell, I need to get my head together.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.65,1:14:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么个收拾法儿？\NHow so?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.16,1:14:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,有个有钱佬找我干活 我打算联系他\NThis rich guy hit me up for a job. I think I'm gonna get in touch with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.94,1:14:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的？ - 是啊\N- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.13,1:14:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么活？干什么？ - 不重要 能去日本就行\N- A job for what? What job? - It doesn't matter. Just to get to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.28,1:14:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去打世锦赛吗？ - 对\N- For the championship? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.33,1:14:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.15,1:14:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,生活一团糟 我会找到出路的\NEverything in my life is falling apart, but I'm gonna figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.13,1:14:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗？我可以帮你\NDo you need any help? I could help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.98,1:14:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没事 不用了 - 要帮忙吗？\N- No, it's all right. It's all right. - Can I do anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.80,1:14:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你饿吗？\NAre you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.14,1:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不饿 - 确定？\N- No. - You sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.87,1:14:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你休息吧 我就在隔壁\NUh, I'll just be in the other room, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.14,1:14:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 迪翁 这球是绝无仅有的 - 我就说吧 老兄\N- Dion, I've never seen anything like this. - I told you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.90,1:14:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老兄 咱们得好好叙叙旧\NMan, we have to have a big catch-up
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.38,1:14:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是八个月来我经历的最好的事\N'cause this is the greatest thing that's happened to me in the last eight months.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.27,1:14:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,找哈克斯 真天才啊\NWho would've thought? Halex?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.50,1:15:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好 洛克威尔墨水公司\NGood morning. Rockwell Ink.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.34,1:15:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 你好 麻烦帮我接米尔顿·洛克威尔先生\NYes, hi, can I speak to Milton Rockwell, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.82,1:15:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,他暂时不在 需要留个言吗？\NHe's not in at the moment. Can I take a message?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.90,1:15:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 他什么时候回来？\NOkay, when are you expecting him?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.19,1:15:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他今天外出\NWell, he's working off-site today.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.13,1:15:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 要不要留言？ - 小心烫\N- Again, can I take a message? - It's hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.99,1:15:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,太感谢了\NThank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.32,1:15:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,等我妹醒了 能给她也弄份吗？\NCan you make some for my sister for when she wakes up?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.22,1:15:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她肯定饿得要命 - 喂？\N- She'll be really hungry. - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.81,1:15:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚说他外出 具体在哪儿？\NYou said off-site where?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.26,1:15:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 这个信息我不能透露\NI'm sorry, I can't give you that information.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.08,1:15:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 您到底要不要留言？ - 要\N- Would you like to leave a message or not?- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.00,1:15:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,能替我向他道个歉吗？\NCan you apologize to him on my behalf?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.48,1:15:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我是原本今早要和他一起吃早饭的\NI was the young gentleman that was supposed to have breakfast
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.48,1:15:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那个年轻人\Nwith him this morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.59,1:15:30.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我对这事不熟 - 就是他儿子那个营的\N- I'm not familiar.- From his son's battalion.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.00,1:15:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我对此一无所知\NI'm sorry, I-- I don't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.82,1:15:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我手上有他儿子的遗物 要交给他\NI have some personal belongings of his son's I was supposed to give to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.74,1:15:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,信件啊纪念品什么的 但我睡过头来不及了\NLetters and mementos and such, but I messed up and I overslept.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.85,1:15:42.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天就要走了 要不我回头寄给他？\NI'm leaving town today, but I could mail it to him if that's easier.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.81,1:15:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不行 - 不行？好的\N- No, no, no.- No? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.88,1:15:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 你给莫罗斯科剧院打个电话问问\NHow about this, why don't you try giving a call over to the Morosco Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.54,1:15:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好 莫罗斯科剧院\NThe Morosco Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.92,1:15:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我算什么？我这是干嘛啊\NSo, I'm like what? What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.51,1:15:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,真不该来 好好晚上被你毁了\NComing up here to wreck my night.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.36,1:15:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 妈 你怎么会在这种地方\NHonest, Mama, I didn't even know you were coming here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.82,1:15:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我受够了你这套把戏\NI'm through with you playing games.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.08,1:15:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是来找点乐子\NI was just coming for a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.33,1:16:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,听说应召女郎都在这儿\NI heard this was where all the call girls gather.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.81,1:16:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我在努力攒钱重建生活 你不明白吗？\NI'm trying to rebuild my life here. Don't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.63,1:16:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是出卖自己吧\NMore like selling out to the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.91,1:16:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你没资格评判我 小杰\NYou've got no right to judge me, Jed.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.42,1:16:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我拼尽全力才换来那么一点幸福\NI fought tooth and nail for every shred of happiness
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.63,1:16:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我拼尽全力... - 那你给过我什么？\N- I've ever found while you... - Right, and what did you give to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.92,1:16:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你从没相信过我 一次都没有\NYou never believed in me. Not once!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.25,1:16:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,少装可怜 你自生自灭吧\NYou wanna wallow in self-pity? Well, here's an oven, Jed!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.58,1:16:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔玛 别\NAlma!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.69,1:16:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 亨利\NI'm all right, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.77,1:16:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给我们点时间 - 我妈就是个婊子\N- Just give us a minute, please. - My mama is a dirty bird.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.11,1:16:30.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嘴放干净点 杰迪代亚\NBe careful now, Jedidiah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.10,1:16:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你给她的那身花衣服 只是掩盖她的耻辱\NAnd that fancy dress you put her in is the only thing keeping in the stench!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.64,1:16:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别打我儿子\NDon't you lay a hand on my child.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.91,1:16:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我...抱歉\NI-I'm sorry, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.55,1:16:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,妈 完蛋了\NMama, what did I do?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.79,1:16:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,走 快跑\NGo! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.42,1:16:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁把门锁了 - 真会打断\N- The door is locked. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.84,1:17:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,谁锁的啊\NYou've gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.22,1:17:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,正演戏呢？谁干的 谁给锁的啊\NFor Christ's sake, did somebody put a latch on the door?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.52,1:17:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢天呐 - 我们刚进入节奏\N- Oh, God. - I thought we had a good rhythm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.02,1:17:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,进入节奏？演成这样叫节奏？还我们？\NA good rhythm going? On what planet is that a good rhythm
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.29,1:17:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不顾其他人吗？ - 我入戏了\N- if you're alone in a room? - I was in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.73,1:17:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,搞得跟我不在场一样 入戏？独角戏？\NIt's like I wasn't even there. In it? In what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.49,1:17:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 格伦 我连句台词都插不进去 - 我懂 咱们会解决的\N- Glenn, I couldn't get a word out. - I understand. We're gonna fix it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.32,1:17:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 排练就是为了解决这些 - 真绝了\N- That's what a rehearsal process is for. - Fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.68,1:17:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,先停一下吧 大家休息五分钟\NLet's lose this, by the way. Everybody take five.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.89,1:17:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,帮个忙 各位...\NDo me a favor, everybody...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.33,1:17:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,得有人跟他说说这事\NSomebody needs to tell him something.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.62,1:17:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真离谱 - 真离谱\N- It's impossible. - Impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.94,1:17:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喝水吗？ - 喝\N- Do you want some water? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.75,1:17:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我去给你拿点 - 天呐\N- Let me bring you some. - God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.81,1:17:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 凯\NHey, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.41,1:17:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 马蒂\NHey, it's Marty.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.75,1:17:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,伦敦那个\NFrom London.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.50,1:17:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么跑这了？\NWhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.68,1:17:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来见个朋友 他搞舞台的\NWell, I got a friend in the stagehands union.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.34,1:17:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我过来给他送点东西\NI was dropping something off for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.64,1:17:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你刚才看了吧 - 看了 没关系吧\N- You watched that? - Yeah, I hope that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.77,1:17:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐\NOh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.90,1:17:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到你又开始演戏了\NHey, I can't believe you're acting again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.23,1:17:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那不叫演戏 他老抢我戏\NThat wasn't acting. He won't let me act.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.40,1:17:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,挺气人的 那家伙什么来头？\NYeah, no, that looked frustrating. What's the deal with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.07,1:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别提了\NDon't get me started.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.35,1:18:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,即便被抢戏 你也比他演得好\NYeah, you were running circles around him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.89,1:18:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那还用说\NOf course I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.12,1:18:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,对 演得真好\NYeah. It was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.75,1:18:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他连续三天不睡觉\NHe stays up for three days in a row
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.41,1:18:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了要演得累\Nbecause his character is supposed to be tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.75,1:18:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是疯了 - 对啊\N- It's obnoxious. - Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.01,1:18:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他要是真投入  怎么会因锁打断？\NIf he's so committed, why'd he stop the scene?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.11,1:18:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛不一脚踹开？\NWhy didn't he punch his hand through the screen,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.01,1:18:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,接着演呢？\Nunlock it from the other side?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.66,1:18:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对吧？换我会这么干 - 格伦\N- Right? That's what I would've done. - Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.76,1:18:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就来 - 格伦\N- Yeah. - Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.70,1:18:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 来了 - 我跟你说句话\N- Yes. Thank you. Yes. - I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.26,1:18:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 你说怎么了\N- Yes, what? - What? What? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.57,1:18:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这小子比他更懂这个角色\NThis kid understands the character better than he does.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.04,1:18:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？\NExcuse me?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.28,1:18:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把你刚说的话告诉他 - 不 我不想说\N- Tell him what you just told me. - No, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.64,1:18:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧 告诉他\NNo, tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.45,1:18:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我说你不像是真入戏了\NI was just saying you didn't really seem like you were in the scene is all.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.63,1:18:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他懂不懂戏？ - 当局者迷\N- Uh, who is this? - He's nobody.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.34,1:18:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 旁观者清 - 而且 在我看来\N- That's the point. - Also, you know, in my experience,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.02,1:18:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,只有玩过家家才这样拿刀\Nonly children hold a knife like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.89,1:18:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要是真打 刀该这样拿\NIf it's a serious fight, you hold your knife like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.58,1:18:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刀要在上面 - 这又不是街头斗殴\N- with the blade square to your wrist. - This is not a street fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.97,1:18:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 既然你们不求真的话\NOkay, well, if you're not going for realistic,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.41,1:18:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还得再加点花样\Nyou might as well add a little flair.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.97,1:19:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就像这样\NLike that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.14,1:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别闹了 - 对吧 凯？\N- Cut it out. - Right, Kay?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.50,1:19:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 行了 谢了你的教程 谢谢\NYeah, okay. Thanks for the tutorial. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.76,1:19:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真是太感谢了 抓紧走吧 谢谢\NThank you very much indeed. That's all we need today. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.87,1:19:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油 凯 - 送他出去\N- Best of luck, Kay. Best of luck. - Get him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.65,1:19:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不需要你了 谢谢 抓紧走吧\NWe no longer require your presence. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.69,1:19:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言...\NWell, with all due respect...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.07,1:19:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,每套布景竟然都要五千多块\NAnd yet every set cost more than $5,000.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.90,1:19:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要让您太太高兴又少花钱 真办不到啊\NI can't just snap my fingers and get your money and your wife into alignment.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.39,1:19:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那我花钱雇你干嘛\NI pay you to say no.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.90,1:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,让她感觉有主导权 又要控制她开销\NShe seems to think that this is carte blanche.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.83,1:19:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这根本做不到啊\NI can't just perform the impossible here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.55,1:19:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你做不到 我就另请他人\NIf you can't control her, I will find someone else who can.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.24,1:19:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\NAsshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.49,1:19:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,洛克威尔先生 请等一下\NMr. Rockwell. Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.11,1:19:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 干什么？ - 是我 马蒂·毛瑟 又见面了\N- What? - Hey. Marty Mauser. Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.74,1:19:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是你冒充我儿子战友给我办公室打的电话？\NDid you call my office and say you're friends with my son?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.62,1:19:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 但是... - 混蛋\N- Yes. But... - Goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.00,1:19:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我没别的办法联络您了 请您听我说\NI had no other way to get in touch with you. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.08,1:19:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想再谈谈去日本的事\NI wanna revisit our conversation about Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.73,1:19:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我重新考虑过了 我想去 我觉得主意不错\NI reconsidered it and I wanna do it. I think it's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.96,1:19:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛就在下周 我已经有别的计划了\NThe event's next week. I've made alternate plans.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.88,1:19:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别的计划？这最初可是您的主意\NWhat other plans? Okay, it was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.59,1:20:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,这主意棒极了 求您给我两分钟谈谈\NIt's a fantastic idea. Let's just have a conversation about this for two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.63,1:20:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你干什么呢？嘿 嘿 洛克威尔先生\NWhat are you doing? Hey. Hey. Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.24,1:20:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,求您了 咱们务实些\NPlease, let's both be pragmatists about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.16,1:20:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把私人感情放一边\NPut your personal feelings about me aside for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.33,1:20:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,您也知道 我和远藤合作能带来多少好处\NYou and I both know how much value I would add with Endo.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.41,1:20:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,在他的主场打表演赛？\NIn an exhibition on his home turf?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.29,1:20:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,势必会引爆全场\NImagine it. I'd be like a stick of dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.21,1:20:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不管您的备选计划是什么\NWhatever you have planned, the alternative,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.79,1:20:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,都比不上这个\Nit's gonna pale in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.15,1:20:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,请给我两分钟\NPlease give me two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.38,1:20:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还能达成共识 求您了\NWe have enough common ground to figure this out. Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.53,1:20:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 行吧 上车说 - 真的？谢谢\N- All right, get in the car. - Really? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.09,1:20:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,汤米 开车\NTommy, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.43,1:20:29.99,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 嘿\NHey. Hey! Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.44,1:20:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你这王八蛋 桌球还是我给你引荐的\NYou son of a bitch. I gave you the idea!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.22,1:20:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 凯·斯通小姐让我转告你\NI'm sorry. Miss Stone wanted to let you know
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.93,1:20:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,她想与您共进午餐\Nthat she'd love to have lunch with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.78,1:20:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说是小姐？ - 是的\N- Miss Stone? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.10,1:21:07.61,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 我迟到太久了\NMy God, I'm so late.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.62,1:21:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在意这些干嘛\NCome on. What do you care?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.22,1:21:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你可是主角 心里应该爽才对\NYou're the star. Gotta feel pretty good, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.75,1:21:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,话说 你当初为啥退出演艺圈？\NI mean, why'd you even stop in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.62,1:21:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要个保障 结果怀孕了\NI wanted security, and I got pregnant,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.13,1:21:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他又给我压力 我就答应了\Nand he pressured me, and I settled.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.94,1:21:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,眼下你是走对路了\NWell, I mean, clearly, you're doing the right thing now
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.36,1:21:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,而且他看起来正加倍补偿你\Nand it sounds like he's paying you back with interest.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.53,1:21:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁补偿？ - 你丈夫\N- Who is? - Your husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.70,1:21:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你的演出都是他出钱吧？\NI mean, he's funding your whole show, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.28,1:21:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哪来的这种想法？\NWhere'd you get that idea?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.37,1:21:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我在走廊无意听到他嘟囔这些\NI overheard him complaining about it in the lobby.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.20,1:21:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘟囔？ - 是的 抱怨开销太大\N- Complaining? - Yeah, about the costs.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.33,1:21:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让他滚一边去吧\NHe can go fuck himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.56,1:21:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 彻底滚蛋\NCompletely. You know what you should do,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.21,1:21:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该把他榨干\Nyou should leech him for every penny he's worth,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.11,1:21:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,把自己捧成最红的星\Nassume your place as the biggest star on the planet,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.92,1:21:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,然后狠狠打他那张自大嘴脸\Nand then you rub it in his smug little face.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.80,1:21:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 我可不想听你的人生建议\NThank you, but I'm really not looking for life advice from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.92,1:21:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我只是说 你根本不用靠他\NNo, I'm just saying you clearly never needed him in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.45,1:21:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我 绝不靠谁帮忙\NLike with me, I'm never accepting anyone's help.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.64,1:21:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我只靠我自己 靠我的手艺\NI gotta do it completely on my own. Purely on the basis of my own talent.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.77,1:21:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不然的话 奖杯都被玷污了\NOtherwise it's, like, the success won't even count.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.94,1:22:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这只是我自己的观念\NBut that's just me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.13,1:22:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来倒是容易\NYes, well, that's very easy to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.44,1:22:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来容易 做起来可真难\NWell, it's easy to say but it's sure not easy to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.32,1:22:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你懂的 所以你才拿钱退圈了\NI mean, you know that. That's why you cashed out.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.05,1:22:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我问你个事\NLet me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.06,1:22:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你靠这门小桌球挣到钱了吗？\NDo you make money at this little table tennis thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.66,1:22:17.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还没呢 - 你有工作吗？\N- Not yet. - Do you have a job?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.35,1:22:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,没有 我是说 桌球就是我的工作\NNo. I mean, table tennis is my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.52,1:22:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那你靠什么糊口？\NHow do you live?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.63,1:22:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠信念\NI live with the confidence
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.69,1:22:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我相信自己 钱自然会来的\Nthat if I believe in myself, the money will follow.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.50,1:22:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,归根结底 我奋斗的重点不是钱\NUltimately, my struggle isn't even about money.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.05,1:22:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么交房租？ - 不交\N- How do you pay rent? - I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.22,1:22:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是在回避问题 - 不 我没回避\N- You're avoiding the question. - No, I'm not avoiding anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.39,1:22:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那今天你打算怎么吃饭？\NHow do you plan on eating food today?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.32,1:22:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我打算你一走就叫客房送饭来\NHonestly, I was gonna order room service the second you leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.46,1:22:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真行啊 - 是啊 是啊\N- Nice. - Yeah. Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.08,1:22:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你这梦想行不通 你有什么打算？\NAnd what do you plan to do if this whole dream of yours doesn't work out?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.78,1:22:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我压根不会想这种事情\NThat doesn't even enter my consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.33,1:22:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 也许你得考虑一下现实了\NOkay. Well, maybe it should.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.39,1:22:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哇\NWow.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.76,1:22:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你这口气真像我妈 随便说说\NYou sound like my mom. No offense.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.57,1:22:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你倒像个小屁孩\NAnd you sound like a child.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.41,1:22:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗？我可够成熟的\NOh, yeah? Clearly I'm old enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.64,1:22:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你什么意思？\NAnd what is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.94,1:22:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,成熟到能在你东山再起的时候\NThat I'm old enough to fuck you in your hotel room
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.69,1:23:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,在酒店干你一场 还是你的酒店\Nin the middle of your big comeback.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.62,1:23:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你真下流\NYou're disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.14,1:23:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,祝演出顺利\NBreak a leg.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.82,1:23:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白 不过我在外地\NNo, I know, but I was out of town
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.64,1:23:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这信我昨天才刚收着\Nso I only just received it yesterday for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.50,1:23:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,去日本行程已经订好了 改不了了\NWell, look, not coming to Japan is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.96,1:23:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦跟拉姆·塞西说 全额的\NOkay, well, just let Mr. Sethi know that a cashier's check in the full amount
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.19,1:23:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,银行担保的赔付支票已经寄出\Nis already on the way to him. It's in the mail.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.63,1:23:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不介意 只是...\NNo, that's fine, but just...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.71,1:23:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,别在现场一见到我就惊讶\NI don't want any confusion about my attendance.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.76,1:23:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定到场 开赛时肯定见得着我\NI'm gonna be there. I'm gonna be there when the tournament starts.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.82,1:23:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 找到了 - 太好了 太好了 太好了\N- I got it! - Yes! Yes! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.14,1:23:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,能值多少钱？\NHow much do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.69,1:23:40.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是假货 - 假货？你什么意思？\N- This is not real. - What do you mean it's not real?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.31,1:23:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 完全赝品 - 这可是从大富婆脖子上摘下来的\N- Total fake. - It came from the neck of a millionaire.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.52,1:23:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看着摘下来的\NI saw it come off her neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.94,1:23:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管来路 这玩意不值钱\NI don't care where it came from. It's total garbage.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.97,1:23:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 装饰用的仿制品 - 装饰用的？\N- Costume jewelry. - Costume jewelry?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.59,1:23:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗯 - 该死\N- Yeah. - Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.36,1:23:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,想卖的话 我最多给你两块钱\NIf you want, I can give you two bucks for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.07,1:23:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂  - 喂 迪翁 是我\N- Hello. - Hey, Dion. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.30,1:23:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,忙不忙啊\NHow are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.43,1:24:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你跑哪去了？你答应过要准备经销商名单的\NHey, where have you been? You promised me we'd have a list of distributors.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.35,1:24:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸今晚就回来了\NMy dad lands tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.48,1:24:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就回去 全力做这件事\NI'll come back now and give you my undivided attention.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.23,1:24:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,先让我跟我妹说句话\NLet me just talk to my sister for a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.84,1:24:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 马蒂来电话了\NRachel, Marty's on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.67,1:24:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 你在哪呢？ - 喂 瑞秋 听好了\N- Hi. Where are you?- Hi, Rachel, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.44,1:24:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我夹克里有个狗项圈\NThere's a dog collar in my jacket, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.76,1:24:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有个人狗在新泽西丢了\NI know a guy who lost a dog out in New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.70,1:24:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他会付大笔赏金\NHe'll pay a big reward.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.26,1:24:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,还有 他家门口那碗里有车钥匙\NAlso, there's a set of car keys in a bowl by the front door.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.02,1:24:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看见了吗？ - 看见了\N- You see them?- Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.18,1:24:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上钥匙 把车开来 别让迪翁瞧见\NGrab the keys, and make sure Dion doesn't see you do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.00,1:24:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 迪翁\NHey, Dion.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.08,1:24:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,能去商店帮我买点生姜吗？\NCan you go to the store and grab me some ginger?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.08,1:24:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我晨吐反应特别厉害\NI'm having really bad morning sickness.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.50,1:24:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.45,1:24:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 加油站打样了\NSorry, station's closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.99,1:24:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我们不是来加油的\NThat's okay. We're not looking for service.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.26,1:24:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们附近有看到跑丢的狗吗？\NDid you see a dog come around here?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.16,1:24:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,没 没见着 你瞧见狗了吗？\NNah, I ain't seen nothing. You seen a dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.25,1:24:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 差不多这么高 - 什么时候丢的？\N- He's this tall. - When did you lose it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.14,1:24:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,几天前\NA few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.41,1:24:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,克兰伯里有个收容所 往那走大概八公里\NThere's a pound down in Cranberry. About five miles that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.96,1:24:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 问问他们 - 我打过电话了\N- Maybe try there. - I called there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.17,1:24:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 帮不上忙 - 好吧\N- Sorry, can't help you. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.97,1:24:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.50,1:25:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,没人看到狗\NThey didn't see anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.07,1:25:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们去那里试试\NLet's go try that place.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.98,1:25:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有人在家吗？\NHello.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.82,1:25:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗?\NHello?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.10,1:25:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪？ - 我去后面瞧瞧\N- Where are you going? - Just gonna check out back.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.02,1:26:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,“我们非常感谢全国各地的唱片商和艺术家们”\N"We're grateful to the record manufacturers and artists
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.69,1:26:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,“全国各地的艺术家们”\Nall over the country."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.04,1:26:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我去 摩西\NOh, shit. Moses.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.93,1:26:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 狗狗 嘿 嘿 摩西\NHey, buddy. Hey. Hey, Moses.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.86,1:26:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是我 马蒂 乖狗狗\NIt's Marty. Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.27,1:26:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\NOh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.19,1:26:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,乖狗狗\NHey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.07,1:26:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西 摩西\NMoses. Moses!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.00,1:26:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静 冷静 我来带你回家\NHey, buddy. Calm down. Let's get you home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.38,1:26:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,想不想回家？走 咱们回家\NYou wanna go home, right? Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.24,1:26:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 别 别 别\NOkay. Hey. No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.32,1:26:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,“刚才为您播放的是佩珀敏特·哈里斯”\N"And that was Peppermint Harris
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.22,1:26:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,“以及他的那首金曲...”\N"and that great record of his...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.58,1:26:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,“不过现在是时候暂别这档节目了”\N"But it's time to hang up the old blunderbuss for now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.19,1:26:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,“记住 如果你想...”\N"Remember, if you want any..."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.00,1:27:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你好？ - 有事吗？\N- Hi, how are you? - Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.33,1:27:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们狗丢了 正在找狗\NWe were just searching the area for a lost dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.16,1:27:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们？ - 我和我丈夫\N- "We"? - My husband and I.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.70,1:27:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的狗几天前在加油站附近丢了\NWe lost our dog a couple of days ago out near the gas station
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.06,1:27:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他们叫我们来这边瞧瞧...\Nand they told us to come and check over here...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.56,1:27:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你是最近的一户人家 - 谁？\N- seeing that you're the closest house. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.08,1:27:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让你来的？哪个加油站？\NWho? Which gas station?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.32,1:27:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说不上来 - 嘿\N- I don't know. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.50,1:27:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是加油站伙计说的\NIt was one of the guys that work there.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.65,1:27:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 老兄 你终于来了 - 我丈夫\N- Oh, man, I'm so excited you're back. - There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.55,1:27:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看来你捡到了我们的狗 - 你们在私闯民宅\N- I think you might've found our dog. - You're trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.34,1:27:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别误会 抱歉打扰了 我们听到后院有狗叫\NNo. I'm sorry, that's not our intention. We heard barking in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.16,1:27:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我不懂你在说啥\NI have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.85,1:27:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我的狗 被你捡到了\NMy dog. You found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.74,1:27:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我没捡过狗\NI didn't find any dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.03,1:27:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定？\NAre you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.43,1:27:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然确定 你呢？\NYeah, I'm sure. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.06,1:27:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊...\NYeah...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.55,1:27:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我趴着你那窗户\NI looked through your window.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.65,1:27:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到了我的狗 - 你竟然偷看我窗户？\N- I saw my dog. - You were looking through my window?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.28,1:27:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不看怎么找到的\NYeah, It was a good thing I did, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.45,1:27:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,趁我报警前 赶紧滚出我的地盘\NGet the hell off my property before I call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.09,1:27:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,该叫警察的是我才对\NYou call? I should call the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.76,1:27:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,行啊 要不要再核实下看清楚？\NOkay. You wanna get a closer look at him?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.01,1:27:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 近距离看清楚？ - 是的 麻烦了\N- You wanna closer look? - Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.35,1:27:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,行 我就让你看清楚\NOkay, good, good. I'll give you a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.19,1:27:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.06,1:28:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点\NCalm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.49,1:28:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我很冷静\NI am calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.62,1:28:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你这张犹太脸... - 你认真的？\N- If I see your kike face... - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.46,1:28:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...再敢偷瞄我窗户 - 马蒂 快上车\N- ...looking through my window again... - Marty, get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.62,1:28:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你疯了吗？ - ...我我就把你脸打烂\N- Are you out of your mind? - ...I'm gonna shoot it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.57,1:28:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,别把事搞大 我们这就走 马蒂 快上车\NThere's no need for that. We're leaving. Marty, get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.33,1:28:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.77,1:28:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 快上车 - 不行 必须得拿到狗\N- Get in the car, Marty! - No! I need the dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.12,1:28:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快上车 - 看我不打爆你的脸\N- Get in the car! - Next one's going to your face.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.32,1:28:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 快...\NMarty, get...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.55,1:28:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 不 不 不 别开枪 别开枪\NNo, no, no, no! Don't shoot! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.15,1:28:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 快帮我\NRachel! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.16,1:28:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 快上车\NMarty, get in the car!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.21,1:28:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快跑 快跑\NCome on, come on, come on. Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.87,1:28:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,上车 上车 上车\NGet in! Get in! Get in!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.25,1:28:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,开车 开车 开车 快开 瑞秋 快\NGo, go, go straight, Rachel. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.22,1:28:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,超前开 快 开进玉米地\NStraight! Go! Go in the corn!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.13,1:28:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快开 快开 快开 - 天呐 天呐 天呐\N- Go, go, go, go, go, go, go. - Oh, my god! Oh, my god! Oh, my god!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.06,1:28:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐\NOh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.31,1:28:56.66,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（摩西）
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.28,1:29:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}Hello?{\i0}\N- Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.03,1:29:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, did you...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.12,1:29:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you by any chance\Nlose a dog named Moses?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.83,1:29:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, I did. Why?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.29,1:29:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you did? Amazing!\N'Cause we just found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.84,1:29:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}For real?{\i0}\N- I did, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.88,1:29:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- {\i1}How is he? How's his breathing?{\i0}\N- You know what?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.21,1:29:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,When we got him,\Nhis breathing was a little shallow.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.18,1:29:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- The money.\N- {\i1}Give me your address.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.55,1:29:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm gonna come right now.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.05,1:29:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.93,1:29:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The thing? What do you mean?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.06,1:29:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,'Cause you know in situations\Nlike these it's...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.56,1:29:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,it's kind of customary\Nto give the person a reward, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.77,1:29:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah, fine. How much you have in mind?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.30,1:29:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱太多了 太多了 - 不 直接说 他他妈有的是钱\N- It's too much money. It's too much. - No, say it. He's fucking loaded.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.97,1:29:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂? - 告诉他\N- Hello?- Tell him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.64,1:29:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想 拿两千块钱还算公道\NI was thinking maybe $2,000 seems fair for this kind of a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.85,1:29:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得挺公道的\NThat seems pretty fair to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.35,1:29:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 两千 - 你开玩笑呢吧?\N- Two thousand. - You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.73,1:29:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没开玩笑 - 简直他妈的离谱\N- No, no. No. - That's fucking ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.36,1:30:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 听着...\NLook, look...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.69,1:30:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这事跟你没关系\NI know it's really not your problem,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.65,1:30:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但我快生了 而且 瞧 我现在也没丈夫\Nbut I'm about to have a baby, and, look, I got no husband right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.45,1:30:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我没工作 这笔钱真的 真的能帮到我\NI got no job, and this money would really, really help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.49,1:30:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,而且 你懂的 咱们都是好人...\NAnd, you know, let's be good people and...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.45,1:30:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那条狗是我从收容所免费领的 对吧?\NYou realize I got that dog for free at the pound, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.46,1:30:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,额 那你这看法可就不对了\NWell, that's kind of the wrong way to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.21,1:30:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 是吗? - 是的 真的\N- Oh, really?- Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.46,1:30:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那我该怎么看?\NHow am I supposed to look at it?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.96,1:30:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们就这么说吧 我现在打这电话不是为了狗\N'Cause let's just say that I'm not calling about a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.76,1:30:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,假设我这电话是为你妈打的\NLet's say that I'm calling about your mother,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.43,1:30:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我是个医生 我得给她做急诊手术\Nand I'm a doctor, and I gotta perform emergency surgery on her
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.43,1:30:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,否则她就没命了 你会怎么做?\Nor she's gonna die. What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.10,1:30:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为你妈也是"免费"来的 你就拒绝手术?\NRefuse the surgery because you got your mother for free?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.64,1:30:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 那太疯了 你肯定会同意手术\NNo! That's crazy. You're gonna take the surgery
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.48,1:30:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 因为你爱你妈 - 这是我听过最蠢的话\N- because you love your mother. - That's the stupidest thing I ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.48,1:30:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那我看你压根不懂什么是爱\NWell, then I guess you don't know anything about love.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.36,1:30:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 别扯了 给我地址 好吗? 我现在就过去\NAll right, forget it. Give me your address, okay? I'll come now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.90,1:30:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我带现金过去 - 抱歉 但不行\N- I'll bring you the cash.- I'm sorry, but no.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.16,1:30:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不行? - 不行\N- No?- No.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.53,1:30:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这真的不是你的错 听起来你也是个大好人\Nit's really not your fault, and you sound like a very nice person.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.87,1:30:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只是我以前被坑过太多次了\NIt's just I've been ripped off one too many times in the past,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.41,1:30:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我再也不想让那种事发生了\Nand I'm just not willing to let that happen to me again.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.29,1:31:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 咱们得想个办法 让我先拿到钱\NSo, we're just gonna need to find a way to get me the money first.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.46,1:31:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你懂吗? 对 - 真的吗?\N- You know? Yeah. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.96,1:31:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,给我听好了 你这个他妈的臭娘们\NListen to me, you fucking dumb bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.80,1:31:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一分钱也别想拿到... - 你有什么毛病?\N- You're not getting one red cent...- What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.92,1:31:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...除非我亲眼见到它\N...without me laying eyes on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.17,1:31:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果你真的不在乎... - 听明白了吗 妹子?\N- If you really don't give a shit about... - You understand, sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.76,1:31:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...你那只白捡的狗 没准我该把它捐给医学界做研究?\N...your dog that you got for free, how about I donate him to medical science?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.43,1:31:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想要那种结果吗? - 我就说这行不通\N- Would that be something you want? - I told you this wasn't gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.27,1:31:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该知道的 我在干什么啊?\NI should have known better. What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.02,1:31:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真是个烂主意 - 马蒂!\N- It was a terrible idea. - Marty!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.27,1:31:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 蠢透了 - 抱歉 我当时想...\N- It was moronic. - I'm sorry, I was--
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.69,1:31:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我只是想试一把\NI'm sorry. I was trying to give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.94,1:31:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是你的错 是这事太蠢了 - 好了 冷静点\N- It's not your fault. It was stupid. - All right. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.61,1:31:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那狗是什么颜色的?\NWhat color is the dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.57,1:31:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛? 谁在乎啊 是棕色的\NWhy? Who cares? It's brown.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.91,1:31:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 因为我老板认识当地所有的育犬师\NOkay, because my boss knows all of the local breeders,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.83,1:31:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,没准咱们能找只长得一样的\Nand maybe we can get one that looks the same,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.95,1:31:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,主人肯定分不出区别\Nand the owner won't be able to tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.62,1:31:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得他会认不出他心爱的狗?\NYou don't think he's gonna recognize his own dog that he loves?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.54,1:31:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是说起码一开始认不出 - 我现在本该在练球\N- I'm saying maybe not at first. - I should be working on my game right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.79,1:31:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,结果我现在却在二手车场\NInstead, I'm in a used car lot
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.46,1:31:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,玩这种恶作剧电话 把生活搞得像个笑话\Nmaking a mockery of my life, doing prank calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.85,1:32:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们在干什么? - 嘿 你怎么还没睡?\N- What are you guys doing? - Hey. What are you still doing up?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.81,1:32:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,小点声 我爸妈在睡觉\NKeep your voice down. My parents are sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.82,1:32:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道他们回来了 - 我告诉过你他们回来了\N- I didn't know they were back. - I told you they were back.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.57,1:32:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我爸的车呢? - 在车库里\N- Where's my dad's car? - It's in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.90,1:32:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,迪翁 我跟你说 我们这一天过得简直难以置信\NYou're not gonna believe, Dion, when I tell you the day that we had.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.99,1:32:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你骗了我 - 不 我没有 你在说什么呢?\N- You tricked me. - No, I didn't. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.16,1:32:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确实骗了 你这骗子婊子 - 喔\N- Yes, you did, you lying bitch. - Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.08,1:32:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘴放干净点 你这死肥猪\NHey, you watch your mouth, you fat piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.04,1:32:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别这么跟我说话 - 别这么跟他说话\N- Don't talk to me like that. - Don't talk to him like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.83,1:32:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他可是我全世界最铁的朋友\NHe's one of my favorite people on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.04,1:32:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 叫他别这么跟我说话 - 别这么跟她说话\N- Tell him not to talk to me like that. - Don't talk to her like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.75,1:32:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别这么跟他说话 - 小声点\N- Don't talk to him like that. - Keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.08,1:32:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是我让她干的 我不开口她肯定不会干\NI'm the one that told her to do it. She wouldn't have if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.38,1:32:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把车钥匙给我 - 行 就在这儿 拿着\N- Give me the car keys. - Okay, they're right here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.09,1:32:31.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱们出了点小剐蹭... - 什么?\N- We got into a little fender bender... - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.68,1:32:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...但没大碍\N...but it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.76,1:32:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是点小伤 我会赔的 - 拿什么赔? 什么时候赔?\N- It's minor damage. I can pay for it. - How? When?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.43,1:32:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,迪翁 这么晚了 咱们都该歇歇了\NDion, it's very late right now. We should all get a little bit of rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.56,1:32:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,明早吃早饭时我会跟你爸解释清楚\NI'll smooth it over with your father at breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.06,1:32:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他不会生气的... - 你们不能住这儿!\N- He's not gonna get angry-- - You're not staying here!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.77,1:32:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱们没别的地方住了 - 你们必须得走\N- We got no other place to stay. - You guys gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.06,1:32:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 迪翁 咱们必须得留下\NNo. Dion. We have to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.48,1:32:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱们没处去... 迪翁 别赶人 - 不行 嘘\N- We have nowhere-- Dion. Stop it. - No. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.40,1:32:49.15,Default,,0,0,0,,她都怀孕八个月了 你疯了吗?\NShe's eight months pregnant. Are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.15,1:32:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 咱们能不能再谈谈? - 声音小点\N- Please can we just talk about it? - Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.86,1:32:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,深更半夜的 你要把咱们赶到大街上?\NGonna throw us out in the street in the dead of night?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.20,1:32:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 走吧 - 咱们真的没地方去\N- Yeah, yeah. - We've got nowhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.91,1:32:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,拿上你们的破烂赶紧滚\NGet your shit and leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.87,1:32:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道咱们今天经历了什么吗?\NDo you have any idea what we've been through today?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.95,1:33:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我没在跟你说话\NI'm not talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.45,1:33:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想跟我说话?\NYou're not talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.29,1:33:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你彻底不打算跟我说话了?\NNow you're not talking to me, period?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.17,1:33:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真离谱\NUnbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:05.67,1:33:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,含着金汤匙出生肯定很爽吧\NMust be nice being born with a silver spoon in your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.59,1:33:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,而咱们有些人得为了生活奔波\NMeanwhile, some of us have to work for a living.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.59,1:33:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你听过"工作"这词儿吗?\NYou ever heard that word, "work"?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.42,1:33:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是整天躲屋里涂鸦\NInstead of doodling in your room all day?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.30,1:33:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,居然把朋友往大街上赶...\NThrowing your friends out on the street...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.97,1:33:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,别一直盯着咱们看行吗? 看墙去\NCan you not stare at us? Can you look at the wall?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.77,1:33:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,看得我毛骨悚然\NYou're creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.26,1:33:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们要去哪? 因为...\NWhere are we gonna go? Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.02,1:33:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不住 既然这儿就有张床... - 没事的\N- I'm sorry. You have a bed right here... - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.19,1:33:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...我本来能睡上面的 - 没事的\N- ...and I could be sleeping on it. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.07,1:33:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我肚里还有个娃呢 我肚里还有个娃呢\NAnd I got a baby in me. I got a baby in me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.32,1:33:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,看看你在干嘛?\NSee what you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.40,1:33:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,大半夜的把孕妇赶出门\NYou're throwing a pregnant woman out in the dead of the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.86,1:33:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你会一辈子受良心谴责的\NIt's gonna live on your conscience forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.99,1:33:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛要这么折磨自己? - 对不起\N- Why would you do this to yourself? - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.95,1:33:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,能让我陪她待一会儿吗? 我得安慰她\NCan I have a moment with her, please? Just to comfort her,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.58,1:33:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,跟我亲妹妹单独待会 好吗?\Nin privacy with my sister, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.16,1:33:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让她小声点 - 我尽量 但我得先让她冷静下来\N- Keep her voice down. - I'm gonna try, but I gotta calm her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.54,1:33:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\NSorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.29,1:33:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办 我不知道该怎么办\NI don't know what to do. I don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.55,1:33:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,演得真好\NThat was really good.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.97,1:33:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞秋 演得太牛了 - 谢谢\N- That was amazing, Rachel. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.59,1:33:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,太到位了 没准能成\NThat was so good, it might work.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.80,1:33:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 如果他把咱们赶走 咱们去哪? - 他现在可能真会留咱们住下\N- Where are we gonna go if he kicks us out? - He might actually let us stay now.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.01,1:33:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那演技简直绝了\NThat acting was so brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.81,1:34:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真的在哭吗? - 没 马蒂 你在干什么?\N- Are you actually crying? - No. Marty, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.39,1:34:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么? - 什么?\N- What is that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.69,1:34:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这是化妆品?\NIs this makeup?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.36,1:34:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\NHold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.57,1:34:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,等等听我说 听我解释 这不怪我 好吗?\NJust wait. Because I can explain. It's not my fault. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.90,1:34:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\NNo talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.99,1:34:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我也是没法子 你懂吗? - 够了 求你别说了 闭嘴\N- I didn't have a choice, you know? - Stop. Stop, please. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.70,1:34:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瑞秋 别说了 - 我得离开那儿\N- Rachel, stop. - I needed to get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.37,1:34:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看到我现在有多冷静了吗? 但快到头了 - 对\N- See how calm I am? It's not gonna last. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.58,1:34:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚出去\NGet the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.04,1:34:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 我觉得... - 给我滚出去\N- No. What I think-- - Get the fuck out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.71,1:34:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得咱们都该走 因为... - 闭嘴\N- I think that we should both go because... - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.25,1:34:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这种破事也就我妈能干得出来\NThis is the kinda shit my mother would do to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.88,1:34:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,亏我这么对你 偏偏是你 居然也这么对我?\NHow could you of all people do this to me, the way I treat you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.17,1:34:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我怎么对你了? - 对 明知道我经历了什么还这么干?\N- How could I do this to you? - Yes, knowing what I'm going through?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.51,1:34:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那你对我做的这些呢? - 够了 嘘 你在干嘛...\N- How about what you're doing to me? - Stop. Shh. What are you doing...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.89,1:34:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕有一秒钟 你考虑过你正在做什么吗...\NHave you ever for one second thought about what you're doing--
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.89,1:34:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 住口 - 闭上你的臭嘴吧 你这自恋的畜生\N- Stop. - Shush yourself, you narcissistic prick.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.85,1:34:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别碰我! - 够了 你们在干什么?\N- Don't touch me! - Stop. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.69,1:34:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要把我爸妈吵醒了 闭嘴 - 去他妈的你父母吧\N- You're gonna wake my parents up. Shut up. - Enough about your fucking parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.10,1:34:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈都三十岁的人了 难道不是吗?\NAren't you, like, 30 years old?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.52,1:34:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你意识到我还有四周就生了吗?\NYou realize I'm due in four weeks?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.36,1:34:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还有四周就生了! - 孩子又不是我的\N- I am due in four weeks! - It's not my baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.15,1:34:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而且孩子就是他的 顺便说下 真是他妈的孩子\NAnd it's his baby, by the way. It's his fucking baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.78,1:34:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这事儿他也在撒谎\NHe's lying about that too.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.36,1:35:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我家出什么事了? - 爸 我只是带几个朋友过来\N- What's going on in my house? - I was just having some friends over, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.28,1:35:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计 你还好吗?\NBuddy, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.37,1:35:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 明早咱们得第一时间和斯伯丁开会\NHey, we have a meeting with Spalding first thing in the morning
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.66,1:35:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 为了"至尊"的样球 - 迪翁 算了吧 别演了\N- for the Supreme samples. - Dion, come on. Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.62,1:35:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,那根本就不可能成\NThat's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.25,1:35:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你拿了我儿子的钱 - 您在说什么呢?\N- You've taken my son's money. - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.54,1:35:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信 迪 难道你看不出来发生了什么吗?\NI don't believe it. D, don't you see what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.13,1:35:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 简直离谱 太他妈离谱了... - 你一直都在骗我儿子\N- Unbelievable. Un-fucking... - You're conning my son all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:16.51,1:35:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我才没有骗你儿子 - 你卷走了他所有的钱\N- I am not conning your son. - You're taking all his money.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.30,1:35:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了他生活的意义 哪怕你只给了他钱\NI give him meaning. All you do is give him money.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.93,1:35:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我给了他奋斗的目标 - 给我听好!\N- I give him purpose. - You listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.64,1:35:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他他妈看都不敢看你一眼 他怕你怕得要死\NHe won't even fucking look at you, he's so petrified of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.93,1:35:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们怎么办 哈? 你们打算让咱们去哪儿?\NWhat are we gonna do, huh? Where do you expect us to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.85,1:35:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你真想让我睡大街? 我怀孕了\NYou really want me to sleep on the street? I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:31.10,1:35:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别 别 迪翁! 迪翁!\NNo, no, no. Dion! Dion!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.42,1:35:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 瑞秋 我得告诉你件事 我没想针对你\NAll right, I gotta tell you something, Rachel. It's not intended to be mean.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:59.47,1:36:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我有我的使命 而你没有\NI have a purpose. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.14,1:36:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你觉得那算是什么恩赐 那你就大错特错了\NIf you think that's some sort of blessing, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.64,1:36:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那反倒成了我人生中巨大的劣势\NIt puts me at a huge life disadvantage.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.89,1:36:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,它意味着我背负着要成就某件事的义务\NIt means I have an obligation to see a very specific thing through.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.39,1:36:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而那份义务必然伴随着牺牲 懂吗?\NAnd with that obligation comes sacrifice, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.60,1:36:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我的人生是我所有被迫做出的选择的产物\NMy life is the product of all the choices I've had to make.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.57,1:36:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,而你的人生则是...\NYour life is the product of...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.94,1:36:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我都不知道你的人生算什么产物\NI don't even know what your life is the product of.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.53,1:36:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你过一天算一天 你这种人就这样\NYou're making it up as you go. That's the kind of person you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.74,1:36:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是那种人 懂吗?\NThat's not the kind of person I am, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.95,1:36:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你得为你那些操蛋决定负责\NYou're responsible for the shitty decisions you've made.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.87,1:36:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没叫你结婚 一次都没有\NI never told you to get married, not once.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.91,1:36:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你别想把这些赖在我头上 - 我明白\N- You cannot pawn them off onto me. - I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.62,1:36:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你在宠物店一年挣多少?\NHow much do you make a year at the pet store?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.71,1:36:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,差不多1200块\NAbout $1200.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.79,1:36:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 免得你忘了 我得在一周内弄到1500块\NOkay, in case you forgot, I have a week to make $1500,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.84,1:36:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,还没算机票呢\Nnot including air fare.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.96,1:36:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在得专注 别让我分心\NI need to focus right now, no distractions.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.51,1:36:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的很抱歉 - 没事\N- I'm really sorry. - No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.01,1:36:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,显而易见 我现在没法安定下来\NIt goes without saying, I'm in no position to settle down right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.97,1:36:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,断了这个念头吧 我现在不会安定下来的 好吗?\NGet that out of your mind. I will not settle down right now. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.81,1:36:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,要是你真打算离开艾拉 我不会抛弃你的\NIf you're serious about leaving Ira, I will not abandon you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.23,1:36:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,作为朋友 我会帮你\NAs your friend, I will help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.19,1:36:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们会去查 找个好的待产院\NWe'll do the research, we'll find a great maternity home.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.73,1:36:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会收留你 给孩子找个好人家\NThey'll take you in, they'll ensure the baby's got a good family.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.90,1:36:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以办个... 不行? 怎么了?\NWe could do a-- No? No?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.99,1:37:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那就回家吧 瑞秋 回家去\NThen go home, Rachel. Just go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.57,1:37:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我该怎么说? - 你会想出办法的 回家吧 瑞秋\N- What am I gonna say? - You'll figure it out. Go home, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.34,1:38:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,艾拉 醒醒\NIra, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.85,1:38:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子不是你的\NIt's not your baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:25.15,1:38:27.99,Default,,0,0,0,,蠢货 给我看着地\NStupid bitch, look at the fucking ground,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.99,1:38:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,活脱脱一个臭婊子\Nlike a dumb fucking whore.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.24,1:38:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,操\NFuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.91,1:38:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,真是他妈的扯淡 给我滚那边去\NFucking bullshit. Fucking go over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.25,1:38:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,给他妈我站到墙角去\NStand in the fucking corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.79,1:38:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我要抽死你... 你想找死吗?\NI'm gonna smack... You wanna do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.51,1:38:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那野种肯定跟它那死爹一样 是个满脸脓包的废物\NThat baby's gonna be a pimple-faced bum just like its fucking father.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.35,1:38:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是像它那臭婊子妈一样的贱货\NOr it's gonna be a whore like its fucking whore mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.14,1:38:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就开门! 别人还要睡觉呢!\NOpen up the door right now! There are people trying to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.35,1:38:55.77,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.77,1:39:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 住手! 安静! - 嘿 瑞秋 你新婆婆来了\N- Stop this! Quiet! - Hey, Rachel. It's your new mother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.77,1:39:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 住手! 安静! - 嘿 瑞秋 你新婆婆来了\N- Stop this! Quiet! - Hey, Rachel. It's your new mother-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.06,1:39:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 艾拉! 别这么跟她说! 对不起 - 嘿 恭喜啊 毛瑟太太\N- Ira! Don't say that to her! I'm sorry. - Hey, congratulations, Mrs. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.86,1:39:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 您要当祖母了 - 什么?\N- You're gonna be a grandmother. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.28,1:39:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 瑞秋现在是你的累赘了 拿着她的破烂\NHere, she's your problem now. Here, take her shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.41,1:39:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 你需要帮忙吗?\NRachel, do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.99,1:39:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 够了 抱歉 - 亲爱的 需不需要帮忙?\N- That's enough. I'm sorry. - Do you need help, honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.70,1:39:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没 我没事 大家回去睡吧 - 呵 很好 她倒挺愧疚的\N- No, I'm okay. Everyone, go back to bed. - Yeah, great. She's so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.43,1:40:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是瑞秋? - 你是埃兹拉?\N- Are you Rachel? - You're Ezra?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.55,1:40:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他在哪? - 给钱我就带他出来\N- Where is he? - Give me the money and I'll bring him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.22,1:40:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,给钱? 不见到我的狗 你一分钱也别想拿\NMoney? You ain't getting a nickel unless I see my dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.06,1:40:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你 我可不是一个人 懂吗? 到处都是我的人盯着呢\NJust so you know, I'm not alone, okay? I got people watching all around me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.15,1:40:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈才不管谁盯着\NI don't give a shit who's watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:23.44,1:40:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说我有的是底气 劝你别耍花样\NI'm letting you know I'm very protected right now in case you try anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.57,1:40:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 行了 你到底要不要你的狗?\N- What? - Okay, do you want your dog?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.19,1:40:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,狗就在我这儿\NI have your dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.49,1:40:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你干嘛? - 我不要那个项圈\N- What are you doing? - I don't want that collar.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.07,1:40:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要项圈里的东西 - 拿钱出来\N- I want what's inside the collar. - Show me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.49,1:40:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没弄到你的狗 我会有这个吗? 不可能\NWould I have this if I didn't have your dog? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.25,1:40:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以把钱拿出来 我这就去把他牵给你\NSo show me the money, and I'll go and get him for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.12,1:40:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 赶紧的!\NCome on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.92,1:40:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,妹子 你不知道你在跟谁玩呢 懂吗?\NYou don't know who you're playing with, girl. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.00,1:40:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱在这儿 - 我他妈才不管\N- Here's the money. - I don't fucking care.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.05,1:40:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看信封里装了什么\NShow me what's inside the envelope.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.67,1:40:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道里面到底有没有货?\NHow am I supposed to know there's anything in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.47,1:40:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 瞧 想看是吧? 给你看 行了吧? - 行 太好了\N- Here, you wanna see? Here, look. Okay? - Yes. Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.51,1:40:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你去哪 妹子? - 她到底有没有带狗?\N- Where you going, girl? - Does she have the dog or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.89,1:40:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谁他妈知道\NWho the fuck knows?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.86,1:41:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.07,1:41:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 喂 布拉尼石酒吧 - 嗨 是我\N- Yeah, Blarney Stone.- Hi, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.33,1:41:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,“是我”是谁?\NWho's "me"?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.12,1:41:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 谢谢 可以把狗牵出来了\NYeah, thank you. You can bring the dog out now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:22.21,1:41:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是那个丢下狗的人? 说好的“马上回来”呢?\NYou're the one that left the dog? What happened to "coming right back"?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.96,1:41:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们准备好了 牵出来吧\NWe're ready, so you can walk him outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.25,1:41:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那畜生尿了一地 - 好的 待会儿见\N- The thing's pissed all over the floor.- Okay. I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.30,1:41:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事? - 听我说一下 好吗?\N- What is going on? - Listen to me for a second, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.26,1:41:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,看 那边 瞧见没?\NLook. Right over there. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.22,1:41:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那个绿顶篷\NThe green awning.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.39,1:41:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我朋友马上会牵着狗出来\NMy friend's gonna come out in a second with the dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.72,1:41:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你给钱 我就打电话说账结清了 行吗?\NOnce you give me the money, I'm gonna call and say we're squared up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.85,1:41:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 他正牵着狗呢 没骗你吧\NLook, there he is right now with the dog. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.98,1:41:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,把钱给我吧\NSo hand me the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:50.61,1:41:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,去你的\NFuck you.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.36,1:41:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嘿 把钱给我\NHey! Hey, give me my money.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.86,1:41:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那什么... 嘿!\NWhat about... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.33,1:42:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,抓小偷! 拦住那两个人\NThief! Stop those two.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.20,1:42:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们抢了我的钱包 - 嘿\N- They took my wallet. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.54,1:42:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,拦住他们!\NStop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.91,1:42:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,往哪跑? 嘿\NWhere you going? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.41,1:42:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 撒手 - 赶紧的\N- Get off of me. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.75,1:42:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 还有那个! 那个打石膏的!\NHey, him too! Him with the cast!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.09,1:42:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,那个打石膏的\NWith the cast.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.17,1:42:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你们居然想抢孕妇的东西?\NWhat are you doing trying to steal from a pregnant woman?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.17,1:42:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 嘿 警察!\N- Shit. - Hey, police!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.63,1:42:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈是什么 伙计?\NWhat the fuck is this, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.09,1:42:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是摩西 嘿\NThat not Moses. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.51,1:42:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我的狗\NThat's not my dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.01,1:42:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 我在这儿 那个女的叫我过来的\NYo, I'm out here. The lady said to come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.89,1:42:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他妈的耍我是吧? - 离远点 嘿!\N- Fucking playing games with me? - Stay away. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.14,1:42:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的耍我是吧? 哈?\NFucking playing games with me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.98,1:42:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈跟我玩什么花招呢?\NWhat kind of fucking shit you playing with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.44,1:42:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 给我死开 退后 伙计 - 嘿 冷静点 妈的\N- Hey, get the fuck off me. Back up, man. - Hey, calm down. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.78,1:42:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈的 - 站住\N- Shit. - Stop there.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.53,1:42:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谁来帮帮她!\NSomeone help her!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.11,1:42:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 救命! 帮帮我! - 被我逮到了吧 你这臭婊子!\N- Somebody! Help! - I got you, you fucking bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.12,1:42:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 住手!\NHey! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.25,1:42:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.62,1:42:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 别来无恙? - 你在这儿干什么?\N- Hey, how are you doing? - What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.42,1:42:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,都十二点半了 我在想你愿不愿意一块儿吃午饭\NIt's 12:30. I was wondering if you wanted to get lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.30,1:42:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,想都别想 我今晚演出首映\NIt's out of the question. I have a show opening tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.47,1:42:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耽搁你一小时行吗? - 不行\N- Well, can I steal you away for an hour? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.43,1:43:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 能跟你谈谈吗? 拜托 - 我很忙\N- Can I talk to you for a second? Please. - I'm very busy.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:01.14,1:43:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,就一分钟 拜托了\NPlease, it'll just take a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.31,1:43:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,额...\NUm...
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.85,1:43:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟你说这事我还有点紧张 - 什么事?\N- I feel kind of nervous telling you this. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.94,1:43:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 呃 这东西是我从你那儿偷的 行吗?\NAll right, uh, I stole this from you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.65,1:43:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我想把它还给你 明白吗?\NAnd I want to return it. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.98,1:43:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 我本打算把它卖了再也不见你\NI'm sorry. My plan was to sell it and never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.24,1:43:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,可我总是忍不住想起你 我没法偷你的东西\NBut I can't stop thinking about you, and I can't steal from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.45,1:43:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\NMmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.45,1:43:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那是廉价首饰 对吧?\NYou know that's costume jewelry, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.00,1:43:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是假货? 我真是个蠢货 - 剧组道具\N- This is costume jewelry? I'm an idiot. - From the production.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.04,1:43:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你那套全靠自己的志气呢? 之前的慷慨陈词上哪去了?\NWhat happened to doing it all on your own? Where did that speech go?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.13,1:43:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我满嘴喷粪 行了吧?\NI know, I'm completely full of shit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.13,1:43:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时手头紧 缺钱才偷了你的东西\NI was in a tight spot, and I stole from you cause I needed some money,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.38,1:43:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我做错了\Nand it was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.84,1:43:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我破产了\NI'm broke.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.26,1:43:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 我一点门路都没有\NLook, I got no resources.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.72,1:43:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,下周日本有锦标赛 我连去的路费都没有\NI got the championship next week in Japan. I got no way to get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.89,1:43:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我没招了 没人能帮我 凯\NI got no options. I got no one looking out for me, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.60,1:43:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 这不是你的麻烦 所以我才来归还 懂吗?\NWhich isn't your problem. Which is why I'm returning it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.60,1:43:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 知道我怎么想吗? - 什么?\N- You know what I think? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.65,1:43:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得你是去销赃才发现那是垃圾\NI think you went to sell that and discovered it was junk.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.94,1:43:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.03,1:43:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你带着这种荒唐的套路出现\NAnd now you've shown up here with this ridiculous strategy
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.49,1:44:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就为了博取同情让我掏钱\Nto get me to have some sympathy and open my wallet.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.36,1:44:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,太荒唐了 你觉得我会这样侮辱你的智商吗?\NThat's absurd. You think I would insult your intelligence like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.16,1:44:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还要演下去? - 演什么?\N- Are you gonna keep going? - Keep going what?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.53,1:44:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还要继续玩这套? - 我只是在做自己\N- Are you gonna keep on with this? - Just being myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.12,1:44:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你满嘴谎话 - 我没有 这就是真实的我\N- You're lying through your teeth. - I'm not. It's me being me.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.04,1:44:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真可悲 你在做自己? - 我说的是真话\N- This is pathetic. You're being you? - I am telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.00,1:44:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我偷了你的东西然后感到内疚\NI stole from you and then I feel bad about it,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.71,1:44:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 所以想来补救 - 别白费劲了 我不在乎\N- so I'm trying to make amends. - You're wasting your energy. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.92,1:44:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,换了我也会偷我自己的\NI would have stolen from me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.38,1:44:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,凯\NKay.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.30,1:44:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 看来我打断你们了\N- Hi. - Looks like I'm interrupting something.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.85,1:44:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 没那回事\NNo, no. Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.93,1:44:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这位是马丁 我朋友卡罗尔的儿子 他正要走\NThis is Martin, my friend Carol's son. He was just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.68,1:44:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这位是默尔 我的公关 - 你好\N- This is Merle, my publicist. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.27,1:44:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,马丁想当个演员 但可惜他演技不太行\NMartin would like to be an actor, but unfortunately he's not very good.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.11,1:44:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,额 那个\NAh, well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.82,1:44:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 百老汇也需要领位员嘛 - 座位安排得怎么样了?\N- Broadway needs ushers too. - So what's happening with the seating?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.57,1:44:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟米尔顿谈过了 他会派所有员工过来\NI spoke to Milton. He's sending all of his employees.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.74,1:44:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就像强制任务 公司的内部指标\NIt's like a mandate. Like, a company mandate.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.83,1:44:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这就能让我高兴了?\NThis is supposed to make me happy?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.29,1:44:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 既然座无虚席 目的不就达到了吗?\NWell, I mean, it's a full house. Isn't that the point?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:48.87,1:44:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,满座的他妈的蠢货 - 不 没那么糟 里面还有点--\NFull of fucking morons. - No, no. You got some--
Dialogue: 0,1:44:51.33,1:44:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 弗雷德·阿斯泰尔要来 - 好 我不在这儿碍事了\N- Fred Astaire is coming. - Okay, I'm gonna get out your hair...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.42,1:44:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别 一定要给他一张今晚的票\NNo. Make sure you give him a ticket for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.21,1:44:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的? - 是啊\N- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.63,1:45:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 小伙子 你这下有福了\NOh. You are in for such a treat, young man.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.01,1:45:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当你看到这位女士演戏时\NWhen you see this lady act,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.34,1:45:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你会觉得就像被吸尘器口爆了一样\Nyou're gonna feel like you got your cock sucked by a vacuum cleaner.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.31,1:45:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 默尔! - 她脸红了 看见没?\N- Merle! - She's blushing. See her?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:08.60,1:45:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.60,1:45:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,坐回你那臭位子上\NTake your stinking seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.69,1:46:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么鬼?\NWhat the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.24,1:46:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈疯了吗?\NHave you lost your damned mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.16,1:46:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,杰德 我在跟你说话\NJed. I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.29,1:46:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在练准头 妈\NI was just practicing my aim, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.96,1:46:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你总说做人要有大志向\NYou always said to shoot for the stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.72,1:46:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿\NHey.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.47,1:46:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\NCome.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.10,1:46:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉迟到了 脱不开身\NI'm sorry I'm late. I couldn't get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.60,1:46:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 呵 我信 - 他一直缠着我\N- Oh, I bet. - He was all over me.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.64,1:46:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你今晚棒极了 简直不可思议\NYou were incredible tonight. That was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.48,1:46:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我有东西送你 - 给我的?\N- I have something for you. - For me?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.94,1:46:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,转过去\NTurn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:44.36,1:46:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,每年结婚纪念日我丈夫都会送我一件珠宝\NEvery year my husband gives me a piece of jewelry for our anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.32,1:46:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我有25件了 每一件都代表一年的痛苦\NI have 25 of them. One for each year of misery.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:52.24,1:46:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这够你那趟路费了 没准还有剩\NThat should cover your trip and then some.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.21,1:46:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,戴着这玩意儿让我觉得反胃\NWearing it makes me feel like shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.68,1:47:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 操 停下 停下 停下\NOh, shit. Stop, stop, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.51,1:47:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,停\NStop.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.39,1:47:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿! 嘿 你们在干什么?\NHey! Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:53.93,1:47:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 该死 天哪 - 站起来!\N- Shit. Oh, God. - Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.43,1:47:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别乱动 - 站起来 我看见你了\N- Lay still. - Stand up, I see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.06,1:48:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,听我口令就跑 一 二 三 起\NWhen I tell you, run. One, two, three. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:02.06,1:48:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 跑 - 嘿!\N- Come on. Go. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.07,1:48:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,乔伊 拦住他们!\NJoey, stop them!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:05.78,1:48:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\NCome on. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.57,1:48:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 你们去哪? 跑这儿干嘛呢?\NHey. Hey. Where are you guys going? What are you guys doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.70,1:48:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没干嘛 - 不 不 不\N- Nothing. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:11.82,1:48:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我看到你们的双手 - 铐上他\N- Let me see both of your hands. - Cuff him.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.33,1:48:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 天哪 我们只是... - 我们什么都没干\N- Oh, my God. We were just... - We didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.20,1:48:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,饶了我们吧 我们在草地里找她的耳环\NGive us a break. We were looking for her earrings in the grass.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.16,1:48:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我的耳环掉了 我们在找我的耳环\NMy earring came off. We were looking for my earring.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:20.25,1:48:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧你耳朵上不是挂着两只吗\NIt looks like you've got two earrings in your ears there.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.29,1:48:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不是这只 是... 之前的 还有一只\NNot this earring. There was... From before. There was another earring.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.42,1:48:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,今天早些时候还有另一对耳环\NThere's another pair of earrings from earlier in the day.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.76,1:48:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我认得你\NI recognize you.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.22,1:48:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 天哪 - 你是凯·斯通\N- Oh, God. Oh, God. - You're Kay Stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:32.93,1:48:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没错 我太清楚你是谁了 - 见鬼了\N- Yes. I know exactly who you are. - This is not happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.26,1:48:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 让我看到你的手 - 你认真的吗?\N- Let see your hands. - Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.31,1:48:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 我回家取个钱包\NYou know, I will go home,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.85,1:48:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,拿点现金给你们 毕竟给你们添麻烦了\Nand I'll get my wallet, and I will get you some cash because we've put you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.94,1:48:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 长官 她这就回家拿钱包 给你现金\N- Please, officer. She's gonna go home and get her wallet. And give you cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.23,1:48:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有证件吗? - 没 没证件\N- Got ID? - No. No ID.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.07,1:48:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 铐上她 - 别 拜托\N- Cuff her. - No, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.61,1:48:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没证件是吧? 让我搜搜 - 拜托了 别这样\N- No ID, huh? Let's see. - Please, please. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.12,1:48:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 让我回家行吗? - 少废话\N- Please, will you just let me go home? - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.08,1:48:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证\NI'll give you my word.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:57.54,1:49:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 瞧瞧 真是条漂亮的项链\NWow, lookie here. That's a really nice necklace.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.71,1:49:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,拿去 拿去吧 归你了\NTake it. Take it. It's yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.59,1:49:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,太感谢了\NThank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.21,1:49:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信\NI can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.67,1:49:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你能再帮我弄条项链吗?\NDo you think you could grab me another necklace?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.51,1:49:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你认真的吗?\NAre you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.59,1:49:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你说这些对你没意义 就几分钟的事\NYou said them mean nothing to you. It'd just take you a couple of minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.72,1:49:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我才刚消失了半小时 不能上去又马上下来\NI was just gone for half an hour. I can't go up and come right back down.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.22,1:49:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我妈在那呢 - 你刚才给警察倒是挺爽快\N- My mother is up there. - You'd do that for the police officers.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:19.60,1:49:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢天呐 我的头发 - 我在走廊等\N- Oh, my God. My hair. - I'll wait in the hall.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.14,1:49:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不 准跟着\NNo, you will not.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.73,1:49:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等\NWait. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.98,1:49:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\NThere.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.40,1:49:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你真美\NYou look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.49,1:49:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 你有25条呢\NPlease, you have 25 of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:32.86,1:49:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,行了!\NFine!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.20,1:49:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 待这儿 明白吗? - 我在这待着 好吧\N- Stay here. Do you understand me? - I'll stay here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.74,1:49:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别乱动 - 好的\N- Do not move. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.21,1:49:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的\NShit.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.26,1:49:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 很高兴见到你们\NHello. Lovely to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.64,1:50:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大卫 你好吗? - 挺好 你呢?\N- David, how are you? - Good. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.56,1:50:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈死哪去了?\NWhere the fuck have you been?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.40,1:50:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我想清静一会儿 有问题吗?\NI needed a moment to myself. Is that a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:09.73,1:50:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道出门还得请示\NI didn't realize I needed a permission slip.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:11.94,1:50:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我为你操办了这一切 你却让我像个蠢货\NI put this whole thing on for you and you're making me look like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.82,1:50:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,天哪\NGod.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:15.91,1:50:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 默尔正跟《纽约时报》通电话\NLook. Merle's on the phone right now with The New York Times.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.95,1:50:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:20.04,1:50:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他找了个排版员正读剧评呢\NHe's got a printer who's gonna read the review.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.50,1:50:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\NMy God.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.58,1:50:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 还是说你压根不在乎? - 接通了! 接通了!\N- Or do you not care? - I got him! I have him!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:24.67,1:50:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢天呐 来了 - 快来 快来!\N- Oh, my God. Okay. - Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.33,1:50:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,来了!\NComing!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.67,1:50:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点 拿到剧评了! - 来了\N- Hurry, he has the review! - I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:29.38,1:50:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,剧评!\NThe review!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.75,1:50:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快点\NCome on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:32.26,1:50:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快来 - 来了\N- Come on, come on. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.09,1:50:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,拉乌尔 凯\NRaoul, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:36.09,1:50:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 标题 "凯·斯通回归" 作者罗伯特...\NOkay. Title, "Kay Stone Returns" by Robert...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.44,1:50:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝今晚愉快 - 门开着 大家都要下来了\N- Have a good night. - Leave it open. Everyone's coming down.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.65,1:50:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是吗? - 是啊\N- Are they? - Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.53,1:50:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,派对结束了\NParty's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.03,1:51:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,晚安\NGood night.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.42,1:51:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,派对结束了\NThe party's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.67,1:51:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们在赶咱们走 - 什么意思? 咱们才刚到\N- They're asking us to leave. - What do you mean? We just got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.21,1:51:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们该在门口拦住咱们的 凭什么让咱们进来?\NThey should've stopped us at the door. Why'd they let us in?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.39,1:51:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰下 你知道凯在哪儿吗?\NExcuse me. Do you know where Kay is?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.14,1:51:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她在楼上卧室 - 好的\N- She's upstairs in her bedroom. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.98,1:52:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 凯在里面吗?\NHi. Is Kay in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.44,1:52:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不方便\NThis is not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.65,1:52:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 但我能跟她谈谈吗?\NOkay, but can I just speak to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.44,1:52:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了 现在真的不方便\NAs I said, it's really not a good time.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.85,1:52:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,到年底 如果这人帮你挣了钱 你就留着他\NAt the end of the year, if the guy made you money, you keep him.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.73,1:52:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,否则你就让他滚蛋\NAnd if not, you throw the bum out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.44,1:52:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰下\NExcuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.32,1:53:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你在开玩笑吧\N- Hi. - You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:02.20,1:53:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉上门打扰 - 你是怎么进我家的?\N- I'm sorry to disturb you in your home. - How did you get in my house?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.83,1:53:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,请再给我一次机会 我都给你跪下了\NPlease give me another chance. I am on my hands and knees.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.62,1:53:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我得去日本 还需要1500块参加锦标赛\NI need a ride to Japan and I need $1,500 so I can compete in the championship.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.33,1:53:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我非常 非常需要这份工作\NI need this job very, very badly.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.79,1:53:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我求你了\NI'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.34,1:53:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我随你怎么使唤 故意输球也行\NI'll work for you however you want. I will lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.46,1:53:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,除了让你的活动圆满成功 我没任何个人立场\NI'll have no personal point of view apart from making your event a success.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:22.13,1:53:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 人生没有第二次机会\NMarty, there are no second chances in life.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.14,1:53:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 凭什么没有? - 我给过你工作 你拒绝了!\N- Why not? - I offered you the job and you said no!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.43,1:53:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 那是因为我冲动 我后悔了\NI know, because I was impulsive. And I regret it.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:30.39,1:53:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢?\NAnd?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:31.69,1:53:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,然后就是我太无礼 太自负了\NAnd I was rude and overconfident.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.31,1:53:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我太狂妄了 态度也有问题\NAnd I was cocky, and I copped an attitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.06,1:53:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还有呢?\NAnd?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.15,1:53:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不会有下次了 对不起\NAnd it won't happen again. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.98,1:53:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,请再给我一次机会 洛克威尔先生\NPlease just give me another chance, Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.15,1:53:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我任凭你发落 让我做什么都行\NI'm throwing myself at your mercy. I'll do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.66,1:53:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么看? 我该给这小混蛋第二次机会吗?\NWhat do you guys think? Should I give this little asshole a second chance?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.24,1:53:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托 给吧! - 别问我\N- Yes, please! - Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.91,1:53:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道这对我有多重要 拜托 我求你了\NYou don't know how important this is to me. Please. I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.75,1:53:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,就让我搭你的飞机 让我跟你们一起去\NJust let me go on your plane, and let me join you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.12,1:53:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 我是在低声下气地求你\NPlease, I'm humbling myself before you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.21,1:53:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 看着你就反胃 - 对不起\N- You're making me sick. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:58.63,1:54:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 站起来! - 好的 行\N- Stand up! - Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.67,1:54:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托 好吗? 我什么都肯做\NPlease. Okay? I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:03.63,1:54:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么都肯做? - 是的 任何事\N- Anything? - Yes. Anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.14,1:54:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.22,1:54:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,顺着走廊走 右手边第二扇门是我办公室\NGo down the hall. Second door on the right is my office.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.47,1:54:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,去把球拍拿来\NGrab the paddle and bring it back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.39,1:54:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这比戏里演得还带劲\NThis is more dramatic than the play.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.77,1:54:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 确实\N- Okay. - That's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.54,1:54:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 马蒂 把球拍给我\NOh, Marty. Give me the paddle.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.96,1:54:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了 我要你这么做\NSo here's what I want you to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.00,1:54:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你趴在椅子上 把裤子脱了\NI want you to bend over that chair and drop your pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.26,1:54:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你认真的?\NAre you for real?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.64,1:54:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是个淘气坏小子 现在该打屁股了\NYou've been a really bad boy. Now you're gonna get a spanking.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.14,1:54:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 你认真的吗?\NCome on. Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.72,1:54:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你想去日本的 对吧?\NYou wanna get to Japan, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.18,1:54:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我想去日本 但这就是你想要的?\NYeah, I wanna go to Japan. But this is what you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.27,1:54:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,必须得这么干 趴好\NThat's what it's gonna take. Now bend over.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:59.52,1:55:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 说清楚\NOkay, so to be clear,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.19,1:55:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你带我去日本 然后再给我报酬?\Nyou're gonna bring me to Japan and then you're gonna compensate me?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.53,1:55:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,明早八点半 拉瓜迪亚机场 咱们出发去日本\NTomorrow morning, 8:30, LaGuardia. We're on our way to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.11,1:55:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我需要票吗? - 飞机是我的\N- Do I need a ticket? - I own the plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.70,1:55:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你会说话算数?\NHow do I know you're gonna honor this?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:11.29,1:55:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道 因为你没资格讨价还价\NYou don't. Because you have no power here.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.91,1:55:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,趴好\NNow bend over.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.60,1:55:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,手放这儿 弧度要漂亮点\NPut your hands over here. I want a nice arc.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.97,1:55:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,开始吧\NLet's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:36.39,1:55:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天呐\NOh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:38.94,1:55:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 我准备好了\NOkay, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:42.52,1:55:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这一下是替我儿子打的\NThis one is for my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.03,1:55:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.49,1:55:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这一下是为我自己\NThis one is for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:51.83,1:55:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,该死!\NGod!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.20,1:55:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,现在是加分环节\NNow the bonus round.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:58.50,1:56:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,漂亮的球拍 一面是木头 一面是海绵\NBeautiful paddle. One side's wood and the other is foam.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:16.39,1:56:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 马蒂 怎么样? - 嘿 泰德 嘿 劳伦斯\N- Hey, Marty, how you doin'? - Hey, Ted. Hey, Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.52,1:56:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 妈的 嘿 伙计 近来可好?\NAw, damn. Hey, man. How you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:20.73,1:56:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你看我今晚能住后屋吗?\NYou think I could stay in the back room tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.69,1:56:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 伙计 布莱恩今晚住那儿\NWow, man. I got Brian staying there tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.15,1:56:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我本想让你住家里的 但我老婆不答应\NI would let you stay at the house, man, but the wife ain't havin' it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.11,1:56:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我就在这儿晃悠到起飞吧\NI'm just gonna hang around until my flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:30.24,1:56:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去哪?\NWhere you goin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.41,1:56:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,去日本 明早八点出发\NGoing to Japan. Tomorrow morning, 8:00 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.03,1:56:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢耶! - 好样的小伙子!\N- Oh, yeah! - My man!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.79,1:56:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哟 你真要去啦! 弄到钱了 - 是啊 是啊\N- Yo, you goin'! You got that money. - Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.29,1:56:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,真为你高兴 伙计\NGood for you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.16,1:56:40.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你看着一点都不兴奋啊\NYou ain't even look like you excited.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.87,1:56:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,没 我... 我挺好的 我挺好\NNo, I'm-- I'm good. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.21,1:56:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,知道你那哥们沃利在后头吧 他一直在等你\NYou know your boy back there, Wally, he's been waitin' on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.55,1:56:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 沃利在这儿? - 沃利 对\N- Wally's here? - Wally, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.97,1:56:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他怎么样? - 沃利挺好 挺淡定的 伙计\N- How'd he seem? - Wally's good. He cool, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.38,1:56:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在后头哪待着呢\NHe's back there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:51.68,1:56:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他看好你 他出一块 她出一块\NHe believes in you. He has a dollar. She has a dollar.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.51,1:56:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么样?\NHey. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:58.52,1:57:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 哇! 见到你真高兴! 怎么样?\NOh, wow! How you doing? Nice to see you!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:01.02,1:57:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直想联系你\NI've been trying to get in touch with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:02.60,1:57:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 噢 真的? - 是啊 你的狗呢? 摩西怎么样了?\N- Oh, really? - Yeah. How's your dog? How's Moses doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.15,1:57:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你能别废话了吗?\NYou wanna cut the bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.32,1:57:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,没废话 我是真的关心他\NNo bullshit. I'm genuinely concerned about him.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.11,1:57:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂 你没事吧 伙计? - 没事 我挺好\N- Marty. You good, man? - Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.70,1:57:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 听我说 听着 听着 听着\NNow, listen to me. Listen. Listen. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.74,1:57:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你那小妞就在楼下车里 她正等你呢\NI got your girl downstairs in the car. She's waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.74,1:57:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈在说什么? 瑞秋在你那儿?\NWhat the fuck are you telling me? You got Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:17.12,1:57:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.20,1:57:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟我说我的狗在新泽西某处 而且你有地址\NShe told me my dog's in Jersey somewhere. And you got the address.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.67,1:57:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 咱们走\N- Okay. - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.13,1:57:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,行吧 好吧 让我...\NOkay. All right. Let me, uh...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.67,1:57:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,额 行吧 让我先...\NUm, okay, let me just...
Dialogue: 0,1:57:28.26,1:57:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,给我两秒钟 我就跟我哥们说句话\NGive me two seconds. I just wanna say one thing to my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:30.88,1:57:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,给你两秒钟行 但老子可不等你\NGive you two seconds, yeah, but I'm not gonna be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:33.14,1:57:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要去哪? - 我去哪?\N- Where you gonna be? - Where am I gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:35.10,1:57:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我这就下楼拿榔头砸你那小妞的肚子\NI'm gonna be downstairs taking a hammer to your girl's stomach.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.31,1:57:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是我要干的事\NThat's where I'm gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.02,1:57:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 知道了 知道了\NOkay. All right. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.48,1:57:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 小毛毛!\NYo, Mouse!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.65,1:57:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搞快点 走 - 好吧\N- Come on. Let's go. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.82,1:57:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,父母留给咱们的钱 他的那份大半都被我拿了\NWell, I took most of his share of the money that our parents left us.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.95,1:57:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你花了你弟的钱? - 是的\N- You spent your brother's money? - Yes, I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.45,1:57:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,呵 看来你挺疼你弟的?\NYeah, you love your brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:57.78,1:58:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你能给我弟安排个差事 你知道他是个讲究人\NMaybe you could give my brother a job. You know he's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:01.08,1:58:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你的差事给他 行了吧? 米奇 帮个忙\NI'll give him your job, okay? Mitch, do me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.29,1:58:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.79,1:58:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 行吗?\NStop talking. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:12.17,1:58:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 看到那边的加油站了吗?\NOkay. See the gas station there?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:15.14,1:58:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,左手边那栋房子就是\Nit's the house to the left.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:16.35,1:58:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下个左转口? - 对\N- Next left? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:17.43,1:58:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了\NI got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.70,1:58:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,下车 赶紧的\NGet out of the car. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:40.66,1:58:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,米奇 过来\NMitch, come.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:42.45,1:58:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 鲁本 你看着她 - 噢 好的\N- Reuben, you wait with her. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:47.46,1:58:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,老实坐着\NSit tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.73,1:59:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,搞快点 使劲敲\NCome on. Louder.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:07.65,1:59:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,敲响点\NKnock louder.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.57,1:59:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的狗\NThat's my dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:16.74,1:59:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西! 喂!\NMoses! Yo!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.12,1:59:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,开门!\NOpen up!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.24,1:59:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,操 摩西\NFuck. Moses.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.83,1:59:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搞快点 - 我讨厌那只他妈的杂种狗\N- Come on. - I hate that fuckin' mutt.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.71,1:59:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西!\NMoses!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.59,1:59:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西!\NMoses!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.42,1:59:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我的狗 摩西!\NThat's my dog. Moses!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.72,1:59:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,摩西!\NMoses!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.72,1:59:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧见里头有什么没?\NSee anything in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:39.14,1:59:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,没 啥也没瞧见\NNo, not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.60,1:59:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 马蒂! - 妈的\N- Marty! - Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.48,1:59:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂! 快跑!\NMarty! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.03,1:59:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂!\NMarty!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.07,2:00:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下! 趴下!\NGet down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.04,2:00:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,操!\NFuck!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.01,2:00:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂! 马蒂! 我中弹了!\NMarty! Marty! I got shot!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.64,2:00:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,救命!\NHelp!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:21.39,2:00:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,救命 马蒂! 求你帮帮我!\NHelp, Marty! Please help!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.43,2:00:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,救命!\NHelp!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.14,2:00:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧? 噢不! 你还好吗?\NAre you okay? Oh, no! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.81,2:00:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗? - 这他妈是怎么回事?\N- Are you okay? - What the fuck's going on?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.19,2:00:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 没事的\NOkay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.65,2:00:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我流血了 我在流血\NI'm bleeding, I'm bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:33.57,2:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 没事了 没事了 没事了\NOkay. It's okay. It's okay. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.99,2:00:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 真的很抱歉 - 对不起\N- I'm so sorry. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.70,2:00:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快去拿钱 - 什么钱?\N- Go get the money. - What money?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:44.03,2:00:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,快去拿钱 就在他口袋里 在他兜里\NGo get the money. It's in his pocket. It's in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:47.08,2:00:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定?\NAre you sure?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.16,2:00:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱! 就在内兜里! - 好的 知道了 知道了\N- The money! It's in the inside pocket! - Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:03.22,2:01:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 操\NOh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:11.90,2:01:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么玩意?\NWhat is this?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.57,2:01:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 你这混蛋...\NOh, you motherfucker...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.83,2:01:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 好了 没事了 没事了\NOkay. Okay. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.84,2:01:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事? 操!\NWhat happened? Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.76,2:01:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,撒开我! 你想上哪儿去?\NGet off me! Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.60,2:01:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\Nit's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.56,2:01:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,行了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:53.40,2:01:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拿到了吗? 拿到了吗? - 嗯 拿到了 拿到了\N- You got it? You got it? - Yeah. I got it, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.61,2:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,钱到手了吗?\NYou got the money?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:56.98,2:01:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 钱多吗? - 挺多的\N- Is there a lot of money? - There's a lot.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:59.07,2:02:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你现在能走了 - 我知道 你表现得太牛了\N- You can go now. - I know. You did amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.36,2:02:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你现在可以去参赛了 - 我就知道你行 太棒了\N- You can go on your trip now. - I knew you could do this. So good.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.78,2:02:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你干得太漂亮了\NYou did such a good job.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.12,2:02:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\NI love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:07.83,2:02:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 你的预产期是什么时候? - 怎么了? 孩子没事吧?\N- Honey, when is your due date? - Why? Is the baby okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.91,2:02:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子没大碍 我只需要你冷静点\NThe baby is fine. I just need you to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:12.83,2:02:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是她丈夫吗? - 不是 我是她朋友\N- Are you the husband? - No. I'm her friend.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:14.75,2:02:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,她还有四周就生了 孩子会没事吗?\NShe's due in four weeks. The baby will be okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:16.84,2:02:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子很安全 现在得说再见了\NThe baby is okay. It's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:18.42,2:02:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不能进去? - 手术室只准家属进\N- I can't go? - Only family in the operating room.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:20.46,2:02:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别别别别别!\NNo, no, no, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:22.13,2:02:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,会没事的 瑞秋 没事的 真的没事的\Nit's gonna be fine. Rachel, it's fine. It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:23.97,2:02:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 别别别! 马蒂 不要\NNo, no, no! Marty, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:26.09,2:02:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在门外候着\NHe'll be right outside.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:27.30,2:02:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 不要!\NMarty, no!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:28.72,2:02:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞秋 我进不去 他们说我不能进去\NRachel, I can't go. They're telling me I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:30.89,2:02:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不想让你... - 请冷静下来\N- I don't want you to-- - Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.48,2:02:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别走 求你了! - 请冷静点\N- Don't go, please! - Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:33.98,2:02:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,求你别走! 马蒂!\NPlease don't go! Marty!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.40,2:02:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不!\NNo!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:48.08,2:02:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,多谢 欢迎来到日本 洛克威尔先生\NThank you very much. Welcome to Japan, Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.99,2:02:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 谢谢\N- Thank you. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:16.62,2:03:19.09,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（日本 东京）
Dialogue: 0,2:04:19.98,2:04:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,毛瑟先生 毛瑟先生\NMr. Mauser. Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.78,2:04:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 洛克威尔先生说让你去队尾\NAh. Mr. Rockwell says the back of the line.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.11,2:04:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他还不想正式开始\NHe doesn't want to begin yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.19,2:05:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,该练练了 也该整口啤酒了\NNeeds some practice. Needs a beer.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.66,2:05:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,赛斯先生? 赛斯先生\NMr. Sethi? Mr. Sethi.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.20,2:05:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 是我 我是马蒂·毛瑟\NHey. It's me. It's Marty Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:11.12,2:05:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样? 实际上 看到你在这儿我挺惊讶的\NHow you doing? I'm surprised to see you here, actually.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.20,2:05:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么说? - 我不知道 我...\N- Why's that? - I don't know. I--
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.29,2:05:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们确实得宣传锦标赛\NWe do have a tournament to promote.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.58,2:05:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 当然 当然\NNo, of course, of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.38,2:05:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:20.88,2:05:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我该为在伦敦时的表现向你道歉\NI think I owe you an apology for the way I acted in London.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.67,2:05:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时就是个混账\NI was a jackass.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:24.76,2:05:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,讲礼貌是基本准则 毛瑟先生\NThere is such a thing as a code of courtesy, Mr. Mauser.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.47,2:05:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我知道 只是...\NNo, I know. It's just--
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.09,2:05:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,在我长大的地方 每个人都只顾自己\NIt's every man for himself where I come from.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:30.97,2:05:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是在那样的环境下长大的 懂吗?\NThat's just how I grew up. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.14,2:05:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,有时候我觉得自己甚至无法控制...\NAnd sometimes I feel like I don't even have control--
Dialogue: 0,2:05:34.10,2:05:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你的借口真的没兴趣\NI'm really not interested in your excuses.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:35.85,2:05:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 知道 这不是借口\NNo, no, I know. It's not an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.39,2:05:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 重点是接下来的态度我会好得多\NLook, the point is I'm gonna proceed with a much better attitude.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:39.94,2:05:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,顺便说下 要是今天看到我在场上很无礼\NAnd by the way, if you see me acting rude up there today,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.23,2:05:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,那是人设 是按剧本演的 我会输个14比21\Nthat's a character. This is scripted. I'm gonna lose 21-14.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.11,2:05:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是玩真的 真正的我 那个讲礼貌的我 下周你就能见识到了\NThis isn't a real thing. The real me, the polite me, you'll see next week.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.45,2:05:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 下周? - 锦标赛上\N- Next week? - At the championship.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.95,2:05:51.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你不参加锦标赛\NYou're not playing in the championship.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.78,2:05:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 你今年没资格参赛\N- What? - You're not participating this year.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.79,2:05:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 我想你搞错了\NNo, no, no. I think you're confused.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.62,2:05:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我参加这活动就是为了这事儿 这样我才能付清剩下的罚款\NThat's what I'm doing the event for, so I can pay off the rest of my fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.08,2:05:59.58,Default,,0,0,0,,马上跟我去见洛克威尔先生\NCome talk to Mr. Rockwell right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.58,2:06:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,锦标赛还有不到两周就开始了\NThe tournament is less than two weeks away.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.75,2:06:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 分组已经定好了 - 不 咱们可以重排分组\N- All the bracketing has been set. - No, but we'll redo the bracketing.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:04.25,2:06:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会为一个自以为是的美国人就打乱整个赛程\NI'm not gonna tear up the entire schedule on behalf of one entitled American.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:07.97,2:06:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,不 赛斯先生 赛斯先生 听着...\NNo, Mr. Sethi. Mr. Sethi. Look...
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.18,2:06:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我人都在这儿了\NI'm here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:11.26,2:06:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你不知道我来这儿费了多大劲\NI don't think you know how difficult that was, for me to come here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:14.47,2:06:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在可是在日本\NI'm in Japan right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.93,2:06:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕你走得还不够远\NYou haven't come far enough, I'm afraid.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:18.89,2:06:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.98,2:06:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你来这儿纯属白费劲\NYou have wasted your time coming here.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.11,2:06:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,简直不敢相信\NUnbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.74,2:07:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我远渡重洋来到日本\NI've traveled many miles here to Japan
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.49,2:07:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,就是为了挑战我的宿敌 远藤!\Nto challenge my great nemesis, Endo!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.79,2:07:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他说什么?\NWhat's he say?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.54,2:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他不想让你再丢人现眼了\NHe doesn't want to embarrass you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:28.42,2:07:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,让我丢脸? 我早就没脸没皮了\NEmbarrass me? I am beyond embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.47,2:07:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他他是个... 你们的冠军就是个骗子和怂包\NTell him he's a-- Your champion is a fraud and a chicken.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.52,2:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是个怂包!\NHe's chicken!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.56,2:07:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤先生同意比试\NMr. Endo agrees to the match.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.02,2:07:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,挺好\NGreat.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.15,2:07:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,条件是...\NOn the condition that...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:48.07,2:07:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,输家必须当着所有观众的面亲吻一头猪\Nthe loser has to kiss a pig in front of the entire audience.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:52.32,2:07:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亲猪? - 是的\N- A pig? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:55.66,2:07:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,亲猪? 什么?\NA pig? What?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:57.49,2:08:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他说既然你要表现得像头猪\NHe said if you are going to act like a pig,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:00.95,2:08:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他很乐意帮你配个种\Nhe will happily mate you with one.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:05.00,2:08:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那他妈什么...\NWhat does that--
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.99,2:08:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈电线挡道了\NIt's this cord in the fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.90,2:08:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我踩到线了 挪开点\NI'm stepping on the cord. Move the cord.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:36.87,2:08:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,把线往那边挪挪 省得我下次又滑倒!\NMove the cord over there so I don't slip on it next time!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.24,2:08:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对不起 对不起 - 省得我折了脚踝!\N- I'm sorry. I'm sorry. - So I don't break my ankle!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.63,2:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤! 远藤!\NEndo! Endo!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.70,2:09:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你会说英语吗? - 会\N- You speak English? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.46,2:09:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他在说什么?\NWhat's he saying?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.71,2:09:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"我们欢迎一位特别嘉宾"\N"We are welcoming a special guest."
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.46,2:09:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,"拉姆·赛斯先生 请上台"\N"Mr. Ram Sethi. Come on up."
Dialogue: 0,2:09:42.81,2:09:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:43.89,2:09:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,也谢谢洛克威尔先生 举办了这么一场令人难忘的活动\NAnd thank you, Mr. Rockwell, for hosting such an unforgettable event.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:49.77,2:09:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们刚才看到的 只是下周精彩内容的一个预告\NWhat we have just witnessed is a mere taste of what is to come next week
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.40,2:09:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,届时世界顶尖选手们将同台竞技\Nwhen the finest players in the world will be competing
Dialogue: 0,2:09:59.07,2:10:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,挑战你们家乡的英雄 远藤琴音先生\Nagainst your hometown hero, Koto Endo-san.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:09.79,2:10:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,废话不多说 请出小猪阿古\NNo more words from me. Let's bring on Agu the pig
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.88,2:10:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,看看这位美国人怎么亲它吧\Nand see the American plant a kiss on him.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.51,2:10:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"现在把猪请上台"\N"Now we bring the pig onto the stage."
Dialogue: 0,2:10:42.74,2:10:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 等等 等等\NWait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.87,2:10:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿\NHey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:48.37,2:10:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,亲猪之前 我想先跟他真刀真枪赛一场\NI want to play him in a real game first before I kiss the pig.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.17,2:10:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我想跟他真正较量一下\NI want to play him in a real game.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:51.96,2:10:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他 我想来场不掺水的比赛\NTell him I want to play him in a game that's not a sham.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.75,2:10:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他!\NTell him!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.92,2:11:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你 告诉观众 刚才那是假赛\NYou, tell the audience that was a fake game.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.59,2:11:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉他们刚才是在演戏 我想跟他来场认真的\NTell them it was a sham and I want to play a real game against him.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:03.22,2:11:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我办不到 - 为什么办不到?\N- I cannot do that for you. - Why can't you do that?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:05.56,2:11:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才那是假赛 是排演好的\NThat was a fake game. That was staged.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:08.85,2:11:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没一点是真的\NNo part of that was real.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:10.64,2:11:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我根本没发挥实力\NI was not playing to the best of my ability.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:13.65,2:11:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这是对在场所有人的极大不尊重\NIt was an enormous form of disrespect to everyone here.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:17.36,2:11:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 听着 谁想看真比赛?\NHey, listen, who wants a real game?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:19.78,2:11:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,举手示意下 快点\NShow of hands. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:21.15,2:11:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 这位先生 这位先生\NWait, this man. This man.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:25.33,2:11:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,马蒂 你说得对 咱们想看真比赛!\NMarty, you're right. We want to see the real game!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:27.58,2:11:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没错!\NYes!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:37.46,2:11:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤 你要站在他们那边?\NEn-do, you're gonna side with them?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.09,2:11:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,翻译 翻译这句\NTranslate. Translate this.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:41.80,2:11:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他真要站他们那边?\NHe's gonna side with them, really?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.51,2:11:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,任由一家美国公司把他当吉祥物 压榨他的价值卖产品?\NAn American company selling their product off of his back like he's a mascot?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.68,2:11:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是吉祥物\NYou're not a mascot.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:48.77,2:11:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,布莱恩 把他带下去\NBrian, get him down.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:50.35,2:11:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们来场真的 观众想看真比赛\NLet's give them a real game. They want a real game.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:53.02,2:11:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 好了\NOkay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:54.27,2:11:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 咱们得继续流程\NThank you, thank you. We need to move it along.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:56.44,2:11:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,下周锦标赛我参加不了了\NI'm not gonna be at the championship next week
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.32,2:12:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,全拜这混蛋所赐 我打不了锦标赛\N'cause of this asshole. I'm not gonna be at the championship.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.03,2:12:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,给我个机会 你羞辱了我\NGive me a chance. You humiliated me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.03,2:12:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了 远藤 求你\NPlease, please, Endo. Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.07,2:12:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拜托了 就当帮我 行吗? - 好吧\N- Please, for me. Yes? - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:07.83,2:12:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太好了 行 - 成了? 他答应了?\N- Yes. Okay. - Good? He says yes?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.16,2:12:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他答应了\NHe says yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:10.33,2:12:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 远藤 谢谢\NThank you, Endo. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:13.46,2:12:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他答应了 耶\NHe said yes. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:34.77,2:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这小畜生\NThis little fuck.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.02,2:12:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,开干吧\NLet's do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:50.08,2:12:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,操\NFuck.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:00.63,2:13:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 马蒂 行吧\NOkay, Marty. All right.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.01,2:13:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,耶!\NYeah!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.10,2:13:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,耶 马蒂! 上啊 小伙子!\NYeah, Marty! Go boy!
Dialogue: 0,2:14:52.37,2:14:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,省省唾沫吧 我知道我拿不到钱\NYou can save your breath. I know I'm not getting paid.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.33,2:14:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,赢也好输也好 你一分钱都拿不到 我倒想看看你怎么回家\NWin or lose, you get nothing. I wonder how you're gonna get home.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:56.62,2:14:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你别想上我的飞机 - 没关系 好吗?\N- You're not getting on my plane. - It doesn't matter, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.62,2:15:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,除非你打算取消活动 否则咱们没什么好谈的\NUnless you're planning on shutting down the event, we got nothing to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:01.25,2:15:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你觉得就这么简单? - 对 我就这么觉得\N- You think it's that simple? - Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.84,2:15:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,让我来给你解释一下\NLet me explain to you.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.21,2:15:11.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我生于1601年 我是个吸血鬼 我活了很久很久了\NI was born in 1601. I'm a vampire. I've been around forever.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.01,2:15:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,几个世纪以来 我见过很多像马蒂·毛瑟这样的人\NI've met many Marty Mausers over the centuries.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:14.14,2:15:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,有些跟我作对 有些不走正道 他们不诚实\NSome of them crossed me, some weren't straight. They weren't honest.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:16.93,2:15:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,而正是这类人 才能一直活到现在\NAnd those are the ones that are still here.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:19.14,2:15:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你去赢下那场比赛 你也会永远留在这里\NYou go out and win that game, you're gonna be here forever too.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:22.06,2:15:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你永远不会快乐 你永远不会快乐的\NAnd you'll never be happy. You will never be happy.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.98,2:15:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 洛克威尔先生\NOkay, Mr. Rockwell.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:38.66,2:15:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,远藤! 远藤! 远藤!\NEndo! Endo! Endo!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.41,2:16:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了!\NThere we go!
Dialogue: 0,2:17:06.37,2:17:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈开玩笑呢吧\NYou gotta fucking kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.15,2:17:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,赛点\NMatch point.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:09.46,2:19:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别让他逮到你 马蒂! - 耶 马蒂! 上啊 小伙子!\N- Don't let him getcha, Marty! - Yeah, Marty! Go boy!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:52.50,2:19:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.67,2:19:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 精彩的比赛 精彩的比赛\NThank you. Good game. Good game.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:55.96,2:19:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个伟大的选手\NYou're a great player.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:58.67,2:20:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你在锦标赛好运 行吗? 希望你能赢\NGood luck at the championship, okay? I hope you win.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:48.64,2:20:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,贝尔维尤医院 有什么可以帮您?\NBellevue Hospital. May I help you?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:50.64,2:20:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 是的\NHi, yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.73,2:20:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我想找瑞秋·米兹勒接个电话 谢谢?\NI was hoping to be connected with Rachel Mizler, please?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:53.98,2:20:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,您知道她在几楼吗?\NDo you know what floor she's on?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:55.73,2:20:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,额 她应该刚做完手术\NWell, she would have gotten out of surgery.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:57.77,2:20:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,就是你们安置这类人的地方\NSo wherever you keep people like that.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:59.82,2:21:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:01.90,2:21:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,目前看来 她昨晚被转到了产科病房\NSo it looks like she was moved to the maternity ward last night.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:05.74,2:21:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 产科病房? - 是的\N- The maternity ward?- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:07.62,2:21:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- “产科病房”是什么意思? - 抱歉 我不清楚细节\N- What do you mean, "the maternity ward"?- I'm sorry, I don't know the details.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.37,2:21:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她还好吗? 孩子生了吗? 离预产期还有四周呢\NIs she okay? Did she have the baby? She's not due for four weeks.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:12.66,2:21:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有这些信息 她是被急救送进来的...\NThis is all the information that I have, that she was rushed--
Dialogue: 0,2:21:15.67,2:21:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,“急救”? 你说什么“急救”? 你刚才还说“转到”\N"Rushed"? What are you saying, "rushed"? First you said, "moved,"
Dialogue: 0,2:21:17.83,2:21:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在又说“急救”? - 先生 请您冷静点好吗?\N- now you're saying, "rushed"?- Sir, can you please calm down?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:19.92,2:21:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,直接帮我转产科病房 谢谢\NJust put me through to the maternity ward, please.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.63,2:21:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸! - 嘿!\N- Daddy! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.28,2:21:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰下 产科病房是在这儿吗?\NExcuse me. Maternity ward's here?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.03,2:21:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 顺着走廊走 - 谢谢\N- Yes, down the hall. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:46.61,2:21:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 先生 您得登记一下 - 不 不 我是父亲\N- Sir, you need to sign in. - No, no. I'm the father.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:54.83,2:21:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨\NHi.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:37.91,2:22:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 睡吧 我在呢 我在这儿 没事的\NIt's okay, sleep. I'm here. I'm here. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:42.46,2:22:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我就在这里 别担心 我哪儿也不去\NI'm right here. Don't worry, I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:45.09,2:22:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,睡吧\NGo back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:46.88,2:22:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你\NI love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.06,2:23:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,五号床 谢谢 米兹勒\NFive, please, Mizler.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:02.12,2:24:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我抱抱他吗?\NDo you want me to pick him up?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:22.56,2:24:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,跟爸爸打个招呼\NSay hi to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:30.03,2:24:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 他在这儿呢 喊爸爸\NYeah, there he is. Say hi.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:42.83,2:24:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 对\NYes. Yeah.

